  <para style="h">Yenesis</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yenesis</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yenesis</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yen</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yenesis</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ntọọñọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Ke aditọọñọ Abasi amaabot mme hefịn ye isọñ. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Ndin isọñ akedo ikpu-ikpu ye ukpọk. Ekịm amaayọhọ anyọñ akpammọọñ, ndin Sịbidịd Abasi amaafuum ke anyọñ mmọọñ.<verse eid="GEN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Ndin Abasi amaabo, “Yak unwana aba,” unwana amaanyʌñ aba. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Abasi amaakịt ke unwana ado a-afọn, anye amaanyʌñ adiañña unwana ado akpọñ ekịm. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Abasi amaakoot unwana “uweemeayio,” anyʌñ akoot ekịm “akonayio.” Ndin ndubiayio ye ubakusen emaeba ke akpa usen.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Ndin Abasi amaabo, “Yak ukpa aba ke ufọọd mmọọñ nọ adiañña mmọọñ ye mmọọñ.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Ndin Abasi amaanam ukpa anyʌñ adiañña mmọọñ idak ukpa ye mmọọñ anyọñ ukpa. Ndin amaado ntoro. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Abasi amaakoot ukpa ado “ikpaanyọñ.” Ndin ndubiayio ye ubakusen emaeba ke ayọhọ usen iba.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Ndin Abasi amaabo, “Yak mmọọñ ke idak ikpaanyọñ aboho itie keed, yak nsaad isọñ anyʌñ awuọ ada.” Ndin amaado ntoro. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Abasi amaakoot nsaad isọñ “isọñ”, anyʌñ akoot mme mmọọñ e-ekebohoke “mme akpainyañ.” Abasi amaanyʌñ akịt ke amaafọn.<verse eid="GEN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Ndin Abasi amaabo, “Yak isọñ atịppe mbid: mme eto se iyọhọ ye ñkpasi ye mme eto ke isọñ e-enwịmme mfịd ye ñkpasi ke esịd, akeene nsio-nsio aduuk ammọ.” Ndin amaado ntoro. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Isọñ amaatịppe mbid. Mme eto emaesakka ke ñkpasi ekeene mme aduuk ammọ ye mme eto enwịmme mfịd ekeene mme aduuk ammọ. Abasi amaanyʌñ akịt ke a-afọn. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Ndin ndubiayio ye ubakusen emaeba ke ayọhọ usen ita.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Ndin Abasi amaabo, “Yak unwana aba ke ukpa ikpaanyọñ, nọ abakka uweemeayio ye akonayio, yak ammọ enyʌñ eba nte idiọọñọ adiwọt mme asaña-asaña ini, ye mme usen ye mme isua, <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />yak ammọ enyʌñ edo unwana ke ukpa ikpaanyọñ nọ ayamma anọ isọñ.” Ndin amaado ntoro. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Abasi amaanam ikpọ unwana iba, unwana andikpon ñkan adikara uweemeayio ye etək unwana adikara akonayio. Anye amaanyʌñ anam mme ntantaafiọñ. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Abasi amaanịm ammọ ke ukpa ikpaanyọñ adinọ isọñ unwana, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />adikara uweemeayio ye akonayio, anyʌñ adiañña unwana akpọñ ekịm. Ndin Abasi amaakịt ke a-afọn. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Ndin ndubiayio ye ubakusen emaeba ke ayọhọ usen inaañ.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Ndin Abasi amaabo “Yak mmọọñ ayọhọ ye mme aduuwem ñkpọ, yak mme inuen enyʌñ efuurọ ekpọñ isọñ ke ukpa ikpaanyọñ.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Ntom ke Abasi akebot mme ikpọ unam ke akpainyañ ye afịd ñkpọ se idu uwem e-edọñọke eyọhọ mmọọñ, e-enyʌññọ esaaña ke esịd mmọọñ akeene aduuk ammọ, ye aduuk inuen se inie mba akeene mme aduuk ammọ. Abasi amaanyʌñ akịt ke a-afọn. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Abasi amaadiọñ ammọ anyʌñ abo, “Itọt inyʌñ iwak ke ibad inyʌñ iyọhọ mmọọñ ke mme akpainyañ, yak mme inuen enyʌñ etọt ke ederimbod.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Ndin ndubiayio ye ubakusen emaeba ke ayọhọ usen ition.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Akema Abasi amaabo “Yak isọñ asịññe mme aduuwem ñkpọ akeene mme aduuk ammọ: Mme ufene, mme unam e-esaañake ke isọñ, ye mme ndiọi unamikọd, afịd akeene aduuk ammọ.” Ndin amaado ntoro. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Abasi amaanam ndiọi unamikọd akeene aduuk ammọ, mme ufene akeene aduuk ammọ, ye afịd mme unam e-esaañake ke isọñ akeene aduuk ammọ. Ndin Abasi amaakịt ke a-afọn.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Ndin Abasi amaabo, “Yak ñnyịn ibot awo ke mbid idem ñnyịn, ukem naña ñnyịn iba, nọ ammọ ekaara mme iyak ke akpainyañ ye mme inuen ke ikpaanyọñ, ye mme ufene ye afịd ndiọi unamikọd, ye afịd mme unam e-esaañake ke isọñ.”<verse eid="GEN 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Ndin Abasi amaabot awo ke mbid idem amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 1:27">ke mbid Abasi anye amaabot ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 1:27">anye amaabot ammọ, awodeen ye awonwaan.<verse eid="GEN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Abasi amaadiọñ ammọ anyʌñ abo ammọ ate, “Itọt, inyʌñ iwak ke ibad; iyọhọ ederimbod inyʌñ isịn anye ke idak ndufo. Ikaara mme iyak ke akpainyañ ye mme inuen ke ikpaanyọñ ye afịd aduuwem ñkpọ e-esaañake ke isọñ.”<verse eid="GEN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Ndin Abasi amaabo, “Ami mminọ ndufo afịd eto se inwịm mfịd e-ebaaha ke afịd ederimbod ye afịd eto se inie mfịd ye ñkpasi ke esịd. Ammọ ediido ndidia inọ ndufo. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Ami mmenọ afịd unam ke ederimbod ye afịd inuen ke ikpaanyọñ ye afịd aduuwem ñkpọ se isaaña ke isọñ, afịd ñkpọ se inie ibifịk uwem, ami mmenọ ammọ afịd awawa mbid nte ndidia.” Ndin amaado ntoro.<verse eid="GEN 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Abasi amaakịt afịd se anye akenam, ke amaanekke afọn. Ndin ndubiayio ye ubakusen emaeba ke ayọhọ usen itiokeed.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Ntom ke ekenam mme hefịn ye isọñ ema ke afịd ayọhọ ndaha ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba, Abasi amaama utom a-anye akenamma; ke ntoro, ke ayọhọ usen itiaba anye amaaduọk adudu ke afịd utom amọ. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Ndin Abasi amaadiọñ ayọhọ usen itiaba anyʌñ anam anye ado adisana, sia usen ado ke anye akeduọk adudu ke afịd utom a-anye akenamma.<verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adam ye Iif</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Mbʌk e-ekewette naña ekebot mme anyọñ ye isọñ ado ami, ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi akebotto isọñ ye mme anyọñ.<verse eid="GEN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />Idaha ntoro, ñwịb ndomokeed ikitịppeke ke ederimbod,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a-akeme ido isọñ; se ñko Yenesis 2:6</char></note> ñko etoinwañ ndomokeed ikitịppeke, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ikidọññọ edịm diin inọ isọñ, ñko awo ndomokeed ikibaaha se inam utom ke isọñ. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Ado idịm amaasakka awuọ ke isọñ adiduọk mmọọñ ke afịd iso isọñ. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaaben ntañ a-atooho isọñ abot awo anyʌñ anweek ibifịk uwem asịn anye ke aduiwuo, ndin awo ado amaakappa ado aduuwem ñkpọ.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Idaha ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaatọ inwañ ke edem usakkautịn ke Idịn; ndin anye amaaben awo a-anye akebotto asịn do. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaanam afịd aduuk eto etịbe ewuọñọ ke isọñ, mme eto e-ekefọọnọ awo ke anyen enyʌñ efọn se edia. Ke ufọọd inwañ ado, eto uwem ye eto udiọọñọ eti ye idiọọk emaeba.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Inyañ a-akenọọhọ inwañ ado mmọọñ akewuọ ato Idịn; aketo do ke ekebakka anye esịn ke itie iwuod inyañ inaañ. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Anyịñ akpa inyañ akedo Pisọn; anye afeghe ke afịd isọñ Hafila, a-kold abaaha. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />(Kold isọñ ado, ado eti; anemufịk resịn ye ọniks enyʌñ eba do.) <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Ayọhọ inyañ iba akere Kihọn; anye afeghe ke afịd isọñ Kuus. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Anyịñ ayọhọ inyañ ita ado Tikris; anye afeghe aboiyo ke mbeñ usakkautịn Asọọ. Ndin ayọhọ inyañ inaañ ado Yufretis.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaaben awo asịn ke Inwañ Idịn nọ anam utom ke esịd anyʌñ ase ñkpọ abaña anye. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaanọ awo uyio abo, “Afo amekeme adidia nto eto keed akeedodo a-abaaha ke inwañ, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />ado inaaha afo adia se ito eto a-anọọhọ awo ifiọk eti ye idiọọk, sia afo umaudia anye, uduutreke adikpa.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaabo ate, “Ifọnnọ awodeen adiba ikpọọñ. Ami ñyaabot awo unwam a-adotto ye anye.”<verse eid="GEN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaabot afịd ndiọi unamikọd ye afịd inuen ke ikpaanyọñ ato ntan isọñ. Anye amaakoono ammọ abịne awo ado nọ asio ammọ anyịñ; ndin se awo akekoot aduuwem ñkpọ keedekeed, anyịñ amọ akedo ado. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Ndin awo amaanọ afịd ufene anyịñ, mme inuen ke ikpaanyọñ ye afịd ndiọi unamikọd.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:20">Ado Adam ikinieghe awo unwam a-adotto ye anye. <verse eid="GEN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Ke ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaanam akpọsọñ idab ayeet Adam. Ndin ke idaha anye akesʌkkọ adaiya, Abasi amaasio akpọñkañ amọ keed anyʌñ amaana adat abʌkidem afʌk itie ado. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaakama akpọñkañ a-anye akesioho ke idem Adam abot awonwaan, anyʌñ aben anye asọk Adam.<verse eid="GEN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Adam amaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">“Anye ami ndin ado akpọ a-atooho akpọ mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 2:23">ye abʌk a-atooho abʌk mmi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">anye adiikere ‘awonwaan,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 2:23">sia ekesio anye eto awodeen.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Ntak ado anam awodeen akpọñ ete ye eka amọ akediana ye anwaan amọ, ndin ammọ ekappa edo abʌk keed.<verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Adam ye anwaan amọ ekesaña ifed, ikinyʌññọ ikop abuud.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Iduọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Ke atu afịd ndiọi unamikọd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi akebot, udʌkikọd akekara ñkara akan. Anye amaabo awonwaan ate, “Nte Abasi amaanekke ibo, ‘Ndufo inaaha edia mfịd eto ndomokeed ke inwañ?’ ”<verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Awonwaan amaabọọrọ udʌkikọd, “Ñnyịn imikeme idia mfịd eto ke inwañ, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />ado Abasi amaabo, ‘Inaaha ndufo edia mfịd eto a-abaaha ke ufọọd inwañ, inyʌññọ ina ndufo etuuk anye, imiidooho ndufo eyaekpa.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Udʌkikọd amaabo awonwaan, “Ke akpanikọ ndufo idiikpaaha. <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Abasi adiọọñọ ke ndufo emaedia eto ado, anyen ndufo ayaatara, ndufo eyaenyʌñ eba nte Abasi, e-ediọọñọ eti ye idiọọk.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Ke ini awonwaan ado akekịtte ke mfịd eto ado a-afọn se edia anyʌñ ayaiya se ese ke anyen, anyʌñ ado se ekama enie ifiọk, anye amaakịppe ubaak adia. Anye amaaben ubaak asọk ebe amọ, a-akebaaha ye anye; anye ñko amaabọ adia. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Ndin anyen ammọ awo iba emaetaara, ndin ammọ emaekịt ke mmimọ ikisaña ifed; do ke ammọ ekekoono mfañ fik ekịm edian keed enam ufʌkidem enọ idem ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Akema awodeen ado ye anwaan amọ emaekop uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi nte asaña ke inwañ ke mfuud uweemeayio, ammọ emaenyʌñ ekedịbe ke ufọọd mme eto ke inwañ. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaakoot awodeen ate, “Afo aba ke mmọọ?”<verse eid="GEN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami ñkekop uyio mfo ke inwañ, ndin ndịk amannam miin, sia ami ñkesaña ifed; ke ntoro ami mmaadịbe.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Ndin Abasi amaabo, “Anie ikudọkkọ fiin ke asaña ifed? Afo amedia ato eto a-ami ñkubooho fiin kuudia?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Awodeen amaabo, “Awonwaan a-afo akenịmme mi ye ami, anye akennọọ usʌk mfịd a-atooho eto ado, ami mmaanyʌñ ndia.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaabo awonwaan, “Nsoo ke afo anam ami?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:13">Awonwaan amaabo, “Udʌkikọd akembiaña miin, ndin ami mbọ ndia.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Ke ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaabo udʌkikọd, “Sia afo amenam ñkpọ ami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:14">“Adọdiọọk unọ fiin ke atu mme ufene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:14">ye ke atu afịd unam ikọd!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:14">Afo ayaanyọọn ke idịb mfo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:14">ayaanyʌñ adia ntọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:14">ke afịd usen uwem mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Ndin ami ñyaasịn usua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:15">ke ufọọd mfo ye awonwaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:15">ke ufọọd mfịd idịb mfo ye ake amọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:15">anye ayaunuak fiin iwuod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:15">afo ayaanyʌñ akọñ anye itịghitịghi.<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Anye amaabo awonwaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:16">“Ami ñyaanam ubiak mfo anekke akpon ke ini uman ayịn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:16">ke akpọsọñ ubiakuman ke afo uduuman nditọ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:16">Udọñ mfo adiido ebe mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:16">ndin anye ayaukara fiin.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Ndin anye amaabo Adam, “Sia afo amaakpañ utọñ anọ anwaan mfo anyʌñ adia mfịd eto a-ami ñkubooho fiin, ‘Inaaha afo adia ato anye,’ </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:17">“Adọdiọọk anọ isọñ ato ke ntak mfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:17">adito ke akpọsọñ ufen ke afo uduudia ñkpọ uto isọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:17">ke afịd ayio uwem mfo.<verse eid="GEN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Anye adiitịppe akpab ye mbaraekpe unọ fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:18">ndin ndufo ediidia mme eto inwañ.<verse eid="GEN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Ke ibibiak akpọiso mfo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:19">ke afo uduudia ñkpọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">tutu afo atịmme anyọñ isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">sia ke anye ke afo aketo adi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">ntọñ ke afo ado,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">ndin ntọñ ke afo uduutịmme uka.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Adam akekoot anwaan amọ Iif<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido Iif awuọñọ aduuwem</char></note>, sia anye adiido eka afịd mme aduuwem.<verse eid="GEN 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaanam afọñidem ke ikpa aben asịn Adam ye anwaan amọ. <verse eid="GEN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaabo, “Idahami, awo ayeba nte keed ke atu ñnyịn, adiọọñọ eti ye idiọọk. Inaaha eyak anye nọ anyan ubọk amọ akịppe mfịd eto uwem adia anyʌñ adu uwem ke nsi-nsi.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Ke ntoro, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaabịne anye asio ke inwañ Idịn nọ aka akenam utom ke isọñ a-anye aketooho awuọ. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Ke anye amaakebịne awo asio, anye amaanịm serubim ye eduad a-asakka ikañ ke usakkautịn inwañ Idịn nọ anye asaaña ke inwañ akpeme eto uwem.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Keen ye Ebeel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Adam amaanam ima ye anwaan amọ Iif, anye amaanyʌñ ayommo aman Keen. Ndin anye amaabo ate, “Ato ke unwam <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ami mmeman ayịn awodeen.” <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Akemaana, anye amaaman ayịneka amọ Ebeel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:2">Ebeel akedo abọọk ufene, Keen akedo atọ inwañ. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Akema, Keen amaaben mme mfịd e-eketooho inwañ amọ adi nte uwa adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Ebeel ñko amaanyʌñ aben enọ adi, ikpọ nti akpa mfịd ufene amọ. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanem esịd ye Ebeel ye uwa amọ, <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikinemme esịd ye Keen ye uwa amọ. Ke ntak ado, Keen amaanekke ayat esịd, ndin iso amọ amaata efiad.<verse eid="GEN 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Keen, “Nsoo inam nọ afo ayat esịd? Nsoo inam nọ iso mfo ata efiad? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Adieke afo anamma se ifọn, nte ami ñkpibọọhọ uwa mfo? Ado adieke afo umuunamma se ifọn, idiọọkñkpọ asʌk akaan ke anyenusʌñ mfo. Anye a-anie udọñ adunie fiin, ado ana afo akara anye.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Akema, Keen amaabo ayịneka amọ Ebeel, “Di yak ñnyịn ika inwañ.” Ke ini ammọ ebaaha ke inwañ, Keen amaatịppe ikọ ye ayịneka amọ anyʌñ awot anye.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabịp Keen ate, “Ebeel ayịneka mfo aba ke mmọọ?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:9">Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Ami ndiọọñọke. Ami ndo akpeme ayịneka mmi?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “Nsoo ke afo anam? Kpañ utọñ! Iyiib ayịneka mfo a-ato isọñ atua ambịne miin. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Idahami afo aba ke idak isuuñọ, enyʌñ ubịne fiin esio ke isọñ a-akekʌppọke inua abọ iyiib ayịneka mfo ato ubọk mfo. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Afo umautọ ñkpọ ke isọñ, anye idiinwịmme mfịd unọ fiin aba. Afo adiido ñyooñ i-imiinieghe nduọk adudu ke ederimbod.” <verse eid="GEN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Keen amaabo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, “Ufen mmi akpon akan se ami ñyọ. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Mfịn afo amembịne miin asio ke isọñ, ami ndiinyʌñ ndedịbe ke iso mfo; ami ndiinyʌñ ndo ñyooñ ke ederimbod, awo añkịtte miin ayañwot miin.” <verse eid="GEN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo anye, “Idooho ntoro; awo akeedodo a-awotto Keen ayaabọ usiene ufen amọ akañ itiaba.” Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanịm Keen idiọọñọ mbaak awo ndomokeed a-akịtte anye adiwot anye. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Ndin Keen amaadakka akpọñ iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedʌñ ke isọñ mbon Nod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nọd awuọñọ ñyooñ (se ke Yenesis 4:12)</char></note>, ke usakkautịn Idịn.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Keen amaanam ima ye anwaan amọ, ndin anye amaayommo anyʌñ aman Inọk. Idaha ado Keen akesʌk abọp abio, ndin anye amaaben abio ado akoot adian ayịn amọ Inọk. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Emaeman Irad enọ Inọk, Irad ñko akebon Mehuyeel, ndin Mehuyeel akedo ete Metuseel, ndin Metuseel ado ete Lamek.<verse eid="GEN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lamek akedọ ibaan iba, keed akere Ada, anye ako akere Sila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada amaaman Yabal; anye akedo ete mbon e-ekedʌññọ ke mme atayad enyʌñ ebọọk ufene. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Ayịneka amọ akekere Yubal; anye akedo ete anọ afịd mme abre ndido udʌk ye mme afịt adʌk. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Sila amaanyʌñ anie ayịn awodeen, Tubal-Keen, a-akekamake brọns ye ukwak anam nsio-nsio ñkpọ utom. Ayịneka awonwaan Tubal-Keen akedo Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lamek amaabo ibaan amọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada ye Sila, ikpañ utọñ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">Ibaan Lamek, ikop ikọ mmi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">Ami mmewot awo ke ntak a-anye akennọọhọ miin unan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">mmewot akparawa ke anye adikinnọ miin unọmọ.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Ekpesio Keen usiene akañ itiaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:24">ake Lamek adiido akañ ata mme duob mme itiaba.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adam amaamaana anam ima ye anwaan amọ, anye amaaman ayịn awodeen, ndin amaasio anye anyịñ Sed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido Sed awuọñọ adinọ</char></note>, ndin anye abo ate, “Abasi annọ miin ayịn mfen ke itie Ebeel, sia Keen amaawot anye.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Sed amaanyʌñ anie ayịn awodeen a-anye akekoodo Enos.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:26">Ke ini ado, mme awo emaetọọñọ adikoot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido aditommo</char></note> anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Tọọñọ ke Adam Tutu Asịm Nua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Ami ado mbʌk se ewet ebaña ubon Adam.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 5:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 5:1">Ke ini Abasi akebotto awo, anye akebot ammọ ke mbid Abasi. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Anye akebot ammọ awodeen ye awonwaan, anyʌñ adiọñ ammọ. Anye akesio ammọ anyịñ, “Ubonawo”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru ado </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Adam</char></note> idaha anye akebotto ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Ke ini Adam amaakedu uwem isua ikie mme edịb mme duob (130), anye amaanie ayịn awodeen ke mbid idem amọ; anye amaasio anye Sed. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Ke Sed amaakemana, Adam amaadu uwem isua ikie itiaita (800), anyʌñ anie nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Ke afịd, Adam akedu uwem isua ikie usʌkkeed mme edịb mme duob (930), ndin anye akpa.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Ke Sed amaakedu uwem isua ikie mme ition (105), anye amaakappa ado ete anọ Enos. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Ke anye amaakebon Enos, Sed amaadu uwem isua ikie itiaita mme itiaba (807), anyʌñ anie nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Ke afịd, Sed akedu uwem isua ikie usʌkkeed mme duob mme iba (912), ndin anye akpa.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Ke ini Enos amaakedu uwem isua anaañ mme duob (90), anye amaabon Kenan. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Ke anye amaakebon Kenan, Enos amaadu uwem isua ikie itiaita mme duob mme ition (815), anyʌñ anie nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Ke afịd, Enos akedu uwem isua ikie usʌkkeed mme ition (905), ndin anye akpa.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Ke ini Kenan amaakedu uwem isua ata mme duob (70), anye amaabon Mahalalel. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Ke anye amaakebon Mahalalel, Kenan amaadu uwem isua ikie itiaita mme aba (840), anyʌñ abon nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Ke afịd, Kenan akedu uwem isua ikie usʌkkeed mme duob (910), ndin anye akpa.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Ke Mahalalel amaakedu uwem isua ata mme ition (65), anye amaabon Yared. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Ke anye amaakedo ete Yared, Mahalalel amaadu uwem isua ikie itiaita mme edịb mme duob (830), anyʌñ anie nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Ke afịd, Mahalalel akedu uwem isua ikie itiaita mme anaañ mme duob mme ition (895), ndin anye akpa.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Yared akedu uwem isua ikie keed mme ata mme iba (162), ndin anye amaabon Inọk. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Ke anye amaakebon Inọk, Yared amaadu uwem isua ikie itiaita (800), anyʌñ anieñe nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Ke afịd, Yared akedu uwem isua ikie usʌkkeed mme ata mme iba (962), ndin anye akpa. <verse eid="GEN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Ke ini Inọk amaakedu uwem isua ata mme ition (65), anye amaabon Metusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Ke anye amaakebon Metusela, Inọk amaasaña mfọn-mfọn ye Abasi isua ikie ita (300), anyʌñ abon nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Ke afịd, Inọk akedu uwem isua ikie ita mme ata mme ition (365). <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Inọk amaasaña mfọn-mfọn ye Abasi; ndin anye ikibaaha aba, sia Abasi amaaben anye asio.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Ke Metusela amaakedu uwem isua ikie mme anaañ mme itiaba (187), anye amaabon Lamek. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Ke anye amaakebon Lamek, Metusela amaadu uwem isua ikie itiaba mme anaañ mme iba (782), anyʌñ anie nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Ke afịd, Metusela akedu uwem isua ikie usʌkkeed mme ata mme usʌkkeed (969), ndin anye akpa.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Ke Lamek amaakedu uwem isua ikie mme anaañ mme iba (182), anye amaanie ayịn awodeen. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Anye akesio anye Nua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nua </char><char style="ft" closed="false">akaiba nte idọñesịd </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ke usem Hibru</char></note> anyʌñ abo, “Anye ayaidọñ ñnyịn esịd ke utom ubọk ñnyịn ye mbiaak ufen ubọk ñnyịn a-atooho ntak <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> amaakesuuñọ isọñ.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Ke Nua amaakemana, Lamek amaadu uwem isua ikie ition mme anaañ mme duob mme ition (595), anyʌñ anie nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Ke afịd, Lamek akedu uwem isua ikie itiaba mme ata mme duob mme itiaba (777), ndin anye akpa.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Ke Nua amaakeyọhọ isua ikie ition (500), anye amaabon Sem, Ham ye Yafed.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ibak ke Ederimbod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Ke ini ubonawo emaeketọọñọ aditọt ke ibad ke ederimbod, nditọ ibaan emaenyʌñ emana enọ ammọ, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />nditọ ideen Abasi emaekịt ke nditọ ibaan ubonawo emaeyaiya, ammọ emaenyʌñ edọ awonwaan akeedodo a-ammọ ekemekke. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “Sịbidịd mmi idiibaaha ye awo ke nsi-nsi, sia ammọ edo awo, abʌk ye iyiib; mme usen uwem ammọ adiido isua ikie mme edịb.”<verse eid="GEN 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Mbon Nefilim emaeba ke ederimbod ke ini ado, ndin ke ini ado ye ke ini iso nditọ ideen Abasi emaekaa ebịne nditọ ibaan ke ubonawo enyʌñ ekenieñe nditọ eto ammọ. Ammọ ekedo mbon uko, mme awuọetob ideen.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakịt naña ibak ubonawo akpon ke ederimbod, ndin ke afịd akikere esịd awo ekedoñño ndiọi afịd ini. <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatua ñkpọfiọk abaña adikibot awo ke ederimbod, ndin esịd amọ amaanekke atịmede. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Ke ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo “Ami ñyaasobo ubonawo a-ami ñkebotto nsio ke iso isọñ, ndian ye mme unam, mme inuen ye mme aduuwem ñkpọ se inyọọn ke isọñ, sia ami mmetua ñkpọfiọk mbaña adibot ammọ.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Ado Nua amaakịt mfọn ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nua ye Ukwọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Ami ado mbʌk emana ubon Nua.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 6:9" />
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 6:9">Nua akedo adinen awo, inieghe ndo ke atu mme awo e-ekebaaha ke ayio amọ. Anye amaanyʌñ asaña mfọn-mfọn ke iso Abasi. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Nua akenie nditọ ideen ita: Sem, Ham ye Yafed.<verse eid="GEN 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Ndin ederimbod amaabiara ke iso Abasi anyʌñ ayọhọ ye afai. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Abasi amaakịt naña ederimbod abiara, sia mme awo ke ederimbod emaebiat usʌñ ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Ke ntoro Abasi amaabo Nua, “Ami ñyaanam utịd aba anọ afịd awo, sia ederimbod ayọhọ ye afai ke ntak ammọ. Ami ñyaasobo ammọ ye ederimbod. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Ke ntoro dat eto saipres bọp ubom nọ idem mfo. Nam ubeed ke esịd amọ, nyʌñ dat itai deppe esịd ye edem ubom. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Naña afo uduubọp ubom ado ami: Anye adiido kubid ikie ita ke unyọọñ, ubom amọ adiido kubid aba mme duob; ñko anye adiikoñ kubid edịb mme duob.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 450, ukpa ado ikpad 75 ndin unyọọñ ado ikpad 45 me mita 135, ukpa mita 23 ndin unyọọñ mita 14.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Nam akọm nọ anye, ke idak akọm ado, nam itie keed ana inwañ ke udomo kubid keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ñkpọ nte sentimita 45</char></note> nọ anye akoñño ke isọñ ke afịd ndaha. Sịn usʌñ ke mben ubom ado nyʌñ nam abom ke isọñ, ufọọd ye ke anyọñ. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Ami ñyaaben mmọọñ ukwọ ndi isọñ adibiat afịd uwem ke idak mme hefịn, afịd ñkpọ se inie ibifịk uwem ke idem ammọ. Afịd ñkpọ ke ederimbod eyaetak. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Ado ami ñyaasọọñọ edioomo mmi ye afo, afo ayaadʌk ubom ado, afo ye nditọ mfo ideen ye anwaan mfo ye ibaan nditọ mfo. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Ana afo aben afịd mme aduuwem ñkpọ asịn ke ubom, ayaara ye uman, nọ enịm ammọ uwem ye afo. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Iba ke atu afịd aduuk inuen, afịd aduuk unam ye afịd aduuk ñkpọ se inie uwem a-asañake ke isọñ eyaedi ubịne fiin nọ afo anịm ammọ uwem. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Ana afo aben afịd ndidia se ido se edia abono se ndufo ye ammọ ediidia.”<verse eid="GEN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Nua amaanam afịd ñkpọ se Abasi aketemme anye.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Nua, “Dakka dʌk ubom, afo ye afịd ekpək mfo, sia ami mmukịt fiin nte adinen awo ke emana anyem. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Ben utọ uduud unam itiaba, iba-iba, e-esanake, ayaara ye nsaña amọ, ye uduud unam keed se imiisanake, ayaara ye nsaña amọ, <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />ndin ben afịd utọ inuen itiaba, iba-iba, ayaara ye uman, nọ anịm mme aduuk afịd unam ke uwem ke afịd ederimbod. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Usen itiaba amaaboiyo tọọñọ ke mfịn, ami ñyaanam edịm adep ke ederimbod uweemeayio aba ye akonayio aba, ndin ami ñyaasọọk afịd aduuwem ñkpọ se ami ñkebot mfep ke unadod.”<verse eid="GEN 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Nua amaanam afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ anye ewʌhọ abo anam.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Nua akedo isua ikie itiokeed idaha a-mmọọñ edịmukwọ aketịppeke ke ederimbod. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Akema Nua ye nditọ amọ ideen, ye anwaan amọ ye ibaan nditọ amọ ideen emaedʌk ubom nọ ebọkkọ mmọọñ edịmukwọ. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Mme unam se isana ye se ideghe, ye inuen, ye afịd se eboot e-ekesañake ke isọñ emaesaña iba, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />ayaara ye uman, edi ebịne Nua enyʌñ edʌk ubom, kpa naña Abasi akenọọ Nua ewʌhọ abo anam. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Ndin ke usen itiaba emaekeboiyo, mmọọñ ukwọ amaadʌk ederimbod.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Ke ayọhọ isua uwem Nua ikie itiokeed, ke ayọhọ usen duob mme itiaba ke ayọhọ afiọñ iba, ke usen ado ke afịd idịm inyañ ibom akesakka, ndin emaebeere mme inuaatob mme hefịn. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Ndin edịm amaadep ke isọñ uweemeayio aba ye akonayio aba. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Ke ataa usen ado Nua ye nditọ amọ ideen, Sem, Ham ye Yafed dian anwaan amọ ye ibaan nditọ amọ ita, ekedʌk ubom. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Ammọ emaenie afịd afai unamikọd akeene utọ ammọ, afịd ufene akeene utọ ammọ, afịd unam se inyọọn ke isọñ akeene utọ ammọ, ye afịd inuen akeene utọ ammọ, afịd ñkpọ se inie mba. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Afịd se ebot e-enieghe ibifịk uwem ke idem ammọ emaesaña iba-iba ebịne Nua enyʌñ edʌk ubom. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Mme unam se ikidʌk ekedo ayaara ye uman afịd aduuwem ñkpọ, kpa naña Abasi akenọọ Nua ewʌhọ abo anam. Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabet usʌñ asịn Nua.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Ke usen aba mmọọñ ukwọ amaakaa iso aba ke ederimbod, ndin naña mmọọñ ayọọk, anye amaabenne ubom akpọñ isọñ. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Mmọọñ amaadọọk anyʌñ ayọọk eti-eti ke isọñ, ado ubom amaafiọrọ ke anyọñ mmọọñ. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Mmọọñ amaadọọk eti-eti anyʌñ afʌk afịd mme ikpọabod e-ekebaaha ke idak mme hefịn. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Mmọọñ amaadọọk afʌk mme ikpọabod atəño akan kubid duob mme ition.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 23 me mita 6.8</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Afịd aduuwem ñkpọ se ikisaña ke isọñ emaekpañña. Mme inuen, ufene, afai unamikọd, afịd mme aduuwem ñkpọ se inyọọn ke isọñ, ye afịd ubonawo emaekpañña.<verse eid="GEN 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Afịd ñkpọ ke nsaad isọñ e-ekenieghe ibifịk uwem ke aduiwuo ammọ emaekpañña. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Emaesobo afịd mme aduuwem ñkpọ ke iso isọñ. Emaenyʌñ esobo mme awo ye mme unam ye mme aduuwem ñkpọ se inyọọn ke isọñ ye mme inuen esio ke ederimbod. Nua ikpọọñ ye mbon se ikisịne ke ubom ye anye ekesʌhọ.<verse eid="GEN 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Mmọọñ amaafiọrọ ke isọñ ke usen ikie mme aba mme duob.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Ado Abasi amaatoiyo Nua ye afịd mme afai unamikọd ye mme ufene ekebaaha ke ubom ye anye, anyʌñ anam afịm afịme ke ederimbod, ndin mmọọñ amaasuuhọ. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Idaha ntoro, emaebet mme udem idịm inyañ ibom ye mmọọñ inuaatob mme hefịn, ndin edịm amaatre adidep nto ikpaanyọñ. <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />Mmọọñ amaakaa iso asuuhọ ke ederimbod. Ke utịd usen ikie mme aba mme duob mmọọñ amaateek, <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />ndin ke ayọhọ usen duob mme itiaba ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba, ubom amaadibeghe ke mme ikpọabod Ararad. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Mmọọñ amaakaa iso asuuhọ tutu ke ayọhọ afiọñ duob. Ndin ke akpa usen ke ayọhọ afiọñ duob emaetọọñọ adikịt mme anyọñ ikpọabod.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Ke usen aba amaakeboiyo Nua amaabeere ubenafịm a-anye akenamma ke ubom <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />anyʌñ asio ekọọñebʌkayob adọñ, anye amaanyʌñ akaiso afuurọ, aka iso atịmme edem tutu mmọọñ asat ke ederimbod. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Akema anye amaasio ibiom adọñ nọ akese me mmọọñ asat ke iso isọñ. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Ado ibiom ikikịtte itie se asọrọ, sia mmọọñ amaayọhọ afịd ederimbod. Ke ntoro anye amaatịmme abịne Nua ke ubom. Nua amaasio ubọk anyan amʌm ibiom ado asịn ke ubom. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Anye amaatie usen itiaba mfen mbemiso anye amaana asio ibiom ke ubom adọñ. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Ke ini ibiom atịmmeke adibịne anye ke ndubiayio, ibiom amaafịbe nsek mfañ ọlif ke inua! Ndin Nua amaadiọọñọ ke mmọọñ asat ama ke isọñ. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Anye amaabet usen itiaba mfen ndin atịmme asio ibiom adọñ, ado isañ anye ami, ibiom ikitịmmeke inyọñ ibịne anye aba.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Ke akpa usen afiọñ ke akpa afiọñ ke ayọhọ isua Nua ikie itiokeed mme keed, mmọọñ amaasat ke ederimbod. Nua ndin amaafʌkkọ ufʌkñkpọ ke ubom anyʌñ akịt ke iso isọñ amaasat. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Ke usen afiọñ edịb mme itiaba ke ayọhọ afiọñ iba, isọñ amaasat ataa afịd-afịd. <verse eid="GEN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Ndin Abasi amaabo Nua, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Wuọ ke ubom di, afo ye anwaan mfo ye nditọ mfo ideen ye ibaan ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Sịññe afịd utọ mme aduuwem ñkpọ e-ebaaha ye afo: Mme inuen, mme unam, ye afịd ñkpọ se inyọọn ke isọñ, nọ ammọ ediitọt ke ederimbod enyʌñ enwịm mfịd, enyʌñ ewak ke ibad.”<verse eid="GEN 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Ndin Nua amaawuọ adi ye nditọ ye anwaan ye ibaan nditọ amọ. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Afịd unam ye afịd ñkpọ se inyọọn ke isọñ ye afịd inuen, afịd ñkpọ se isaña ke isọñ, emaewuọñọ ke ubom, ke mme aduuk ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Ndin Nua amaabọp itie uwa anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ akoono mme unam se isana ye mme inuen se isana anam ufọfọb uwa anọ Abasi. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakop inemufịk uwa ado anyʌñ abo ke esịd amọ ate: “Tutu amama, ami ndiisuuñọke isọñ aba ke ntak ubonawo, akpesʌkado afịd akikere esịd awo adooho idiọọk tọọñọ ke uyịn ammọ. Ñko tutu amama ami ndiisoboke afịd mme aduuwem ñkpọ aba, naña ami ñkenam.<verse eid="GEN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />“Adaña nte ederimbod abaaha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">ini utọ ye ini idọk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">ndedeñ ye ufiob,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">ndaayio ye ukwọedịm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">uweemeayio ye akonayio</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">idiitreke.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Edioomo Abasi ye Nua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Akema Abasi amaadiọñ Nua ye nditọ amọ ideen ate, “Inwịm mfịd inyʌñ itọt ke ibad iyọhọ ederimbod. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Ndịk ye uteeñe ndufo ayaamʌm afịd mme afai unam ke ederimbod, ye afịd mme inuen ke ikpaanyọñ ye afịd mme ñkpọ se inyọọn ke isọñ, ye afịd mme iyak ke akpainyañ, sia e-eyaak ammọ esịn ke ubọk ndufo. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Afịd ñkpọ se idu uwem inyʌñ isaaña ayaado ndidia inọ ndufo. Kpa naña ami ñkinọọ ndufo mme awawa ñkọñ, idahami ami mminọ ndufo afịd ñkpọ.<verse eid="GEN 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />“Ado inaaha ndufo eta unam i-iyiib uwem asʌkkọ asesịne ke idem. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Ñko, ami ñyaayem enam ibad ke abaña iyiib uwem ndufo. Ami ñyaayem enam ibad ebaña afịd unam. Ye mme awo keedekeed. Ñko, ñyaayem enam ibad uwem awo mfen ito ndufo.<verse eid="GEN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />“Awo akeedodo aduọkkọ iyiib awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:6">kpa awo adiiduọk iyiib ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:6">sia ke mbid Abasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:6">ke Abasi akebot awo.<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Ama ado ndufo, inwịm mfịd inyʌñ iwak ke ibad; isakka ke ederimbod inyʌñ itọt.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Ndin Abasi amaabo Nua ye nditọ amọ ideen e-ekebaaha ye anye ate: <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Idahami ami mmesọọñọ edioomo mmi ye ndufo ye nditọ ubon ndufo se idiimana inọ ndufo ke ini iso <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />ye afịd mme aduuwem ñkpọ e-ekebaaha ye ndufo: Mme inuen, mme ufene ye afịd mme unam ikọd, afịd se ikiwuọ ke ubom ye ndufo, afịd mme aduuwem ñkpọ ke ederimbod. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Ami mmesọọñọ edioomo mmi ye ndufo: Tutu amama, afịd uwem idiitakka aba ke mmọọñ ukwọ; tutu amama ukwọ idiisoboke ederimbod aba.”<verse eid="GEN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Abasi amaanyʌñ abo, “Idiọọñọ edioomo a-ami nnamma ke ufọọd mmi ye ndufo ye afịd aduuwem ñkpọ e-ebaaha ye ndufo ado ami, edioomo afịd emana se idiidi: <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Ami mmenịm akpara mmi ke ntọñanyọñ, ñko anye adiido idiọọñọ edioomo ke ufọọd mmi ye ederimbod. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Ini akeedodo a-ami mbenne ntọñanyọñ mfʌk ederimbod ndin akpara awuọ ke ntọñanyọñ, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />ami ñyaatoiyo edioomo mmi ke ufọọd mmi ye ndufo ye afịd ñkpọ se idu uwem ke utọ ke utọ. Tutu amama mmọọñ idiidooho ukwọ aba isobo afịd ñkpọ se idu uwem. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Ini akeedodo a-akpara awuọhọ ke ntọñanyọñ, ami ñyaakịt ñnyʌñ ntoiyo nsi-nsi edioomo ke ufọọd Abasi ye afịd aduuwem ñkpọ ke ederimbod.”<verse eid="GEN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Ke ntoro, Abasi amaabo Nua “Ami ado idiọọñọ edioomo a-ami nnamma ke ufọọd mmi ye afịd se inie uwem ke ederimbod.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nditọ Nua Ideen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Nditọ Nua ideen e-ekewuọhọ ke ubom ekedo Sem, Ham ye Yafed. (Ham akedo ete Kenan.) <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Mbon ami ekedo nditọ ideen Nua ita, ñko aketo ke ammọ ke afịd awo ekesuana eyọhọ ederimbod. <verse eid="GEN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Nua, awo isọñ, amaatọọñọ atọ inwañ fain. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Ke anye amaakenwọñ usʌk ukọd amọ, ukọd amaanaam anye ndin anye amaanaa ifed ke esịd atayad amọ. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Ham, ete Kenan, amaakịt ifed ete amọ anyʌñ akedọkkọ nditọeka amọ ideen awo iba ako ke esiin. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Ado Sem ye Yafed emaeben ewịra edot ke afara ammọ; ndin emaesaña ñkpaedem ekefʌk ifed ete ammọ. Iso ammọ akewọt edem uko mbaak ammọ edikịt ete ammọ ifed. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Ke ini Nua akedemmeke ke ukpa mmịn adikịt se akpatre ayịn amọ awodeen akenam anye, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />anye amaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">“Adọdiọọk anọ Kenan!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:25">Anye adiido nsịbñkan ke atu mme ifʌn anọ nditọeka amọ ideen”<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Anye anyʌñ abo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:26">Itooro anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Sem!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:26">Yak Kenan ado afʌn anọ Sem.<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Abasi akpekap atat abio Yafed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Yafed aka adiba nte aditiat</char></note>;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:27">yak Yafed adʌñ ke mme atayad Sem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:27">ñko yak Kenan ado afʌn anọ Yafed.<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Ke ukwọ amaakekweeñe Nua amaadu uwem isua ikie ita mme aba mme duob (350). <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Ke afịd, Nua akedu uwem isua ikie usʌkkeed mme aba mme duob (950), ndin anye akpa.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Udịm mme Idịd</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Ami ado mbʌk Sem, Ham ye Yafed, nditọ ideen Nua, e-ekenyʌññọ enieñe nditọ ammọ ideen ke ukwọ amaakekweeñe.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubon Yafed</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Nditọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nditọ akeme ido ubon; se ke Yenesis 10:3, 4, 6, 7, 20-23, 29 ye 31</char></note> Yafed ideen:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:2">Koma, Makọk, Madai, Yafan, Tubal, Mesek ye Tiras.<verse eid="GEN 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Nditọ Koma ideen:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:3">Askenas, Rifad ye Tokama.<verse eid="GEN 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Nditọ Yafan ideen:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:4">Elisa, Taasis, mbon Kid ye mbon Rodan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se ke 1 Krọnikịd 1:7</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />(Aketo ammọ ke mbon unyam udua mmọọñ ekesuana edọñọ abio ammọ ke aduuk ke mme idịd ammọ, afịd ye usem ammọ.)<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubon Ham</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Nditọ Ham ideen:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:6">Kuus, Iyib, Pud ye Kenan.<verse eid="GEN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Nditọ Kuus ideen:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:7">Seba, Hafila, Sabta, Raama ye Sabteka.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 10:7">Nditọ Raama ideen:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:7">Seba ye Dedan.<verse eid="GEN 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kuus akedo ete<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ete akemeido ntịppe me asiak ubon; se ke Yenesis 10:13, 15, 24 ye 26.</char></note> Nimrọd, a-akedidooho akpọsọñ awo uko ekọñ ke ederimbod. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Anye akedo akpọsọñ atautob ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ntak ado anam nọ esibo, “Nte Nimrọd, akpọsọñ atautob ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Mme akpa ntọọñọ itie ubọọñ amọ ekedo Babilọn, Uruk, Akad ye Kalne ke Sina. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Anye aketo isọñ ado akaa Asiria, itie a-anye akebọppọ Ninife, Rehobod Ir, Kala <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />ye Resen, a-asịneke ke ufọọd Ninife ye Kala, a-adooho ataa ekamba abio.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Iyib akedo ete anọ</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:13">mbon Lud, mbon Anam, mbon Lehab, mbon Naftu, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />mbon Patrus, mbon Kaslu (a-mbon Filistia eketooho ewuọọñọ) ye mbon Kaftọ.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kenan akedo ete</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:15">Sidọn a-akedooho akpa ayịn amọ, ye mbon Hed, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />mbon Yebus, mbon Amọọ, mbon Keekasi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />Mbon Hif, mbon Akaid, mbon Sin, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />mbon Afaad, mbon Sema ye mbon Hamad.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:18">(Akema mbon ubon Kenan emaesuana, <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />ndin adaña Kenan aketọọñọ ke Sidọn a-akaaha Kera tutu akewuọ Kasa, ye ke ubeñ Sọdọm, Komora, Adma ye Seboyịm, aben tutu akewuọ Lasa.)<verse eid="GEN 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Nditọ ideen Ham ekedo ami ke aduuk ye usem ammọ, ke isọñ ye idịd ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubon Sem</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Emaenyʌñ eman nditọ ideen enọ Sem, e-ekamba ayịneka amọ akedooho Yafed. Sem akedo etebom anọ afịd nditọ ideen Ebee.<verse eid="GEN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Nditọ ideen Sem:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:22">Elam, Asọọ, Afasad, Lud ye Aram.<verse eid="GEN 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Nditọ ideen Aram:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:23">Us, Hul, Keta ye Mesek.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se Septuakin ye 1 Krọnikịd 1:17</char></note><verse eid="GEN 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Afasad akedo ete anọ Sela,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:24">ndin Sela ado ete anọ Ebee.<verse eid="GEN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Nditọ ideen iba ke ekeman enọ Ebee:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:25">Keed akekere Pelek, sia idaha a-anye akemanake ke ekebakka ederimbod; ndin ekesio ayịneka amọ awodeen Yoktan.<verse eid="GEN 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yoktan akedo ete anọ</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:26">Almodad, Selef, Hasamafed, Yera <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadoram, Usal, Dikla, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obal, Abimel, Seba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ọfia, Hafila ye Yobab. Afịd ami ekedo nditọ ideen Yoktan.<verse eid="GEN 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />(Efaak a-ammọ ekedʌññọ amaatara atọọñọ ke Mesa akaa Sefa, ke usakkautịn idịd etəkabod.)<verse eid="GEN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Mbon ami ekedo nditọ ideen Sem ke aduuk ye usem ammọ, ke idʌñ ye idịd ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Mme aduuk nditọ ideen Nua edo ami, akeene naña ammọ ekemana, ke mme idịd ammọ. Aketo ke ammọ, mme idịd etaara eyọhọ ederimbod ke ukwọ amaakekweeñe.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Tọwa Babel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Ke ini ado, afịd ederimbod ekenie usem keed ye edeme ikọ keed. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Nte mme awo ekesuanake ekaiya ukañ usakkautịn, ammọ emaekịt unaisọñ ke Sina enyʌñ edʌñọ do.<verse eid="GEN 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Ammọ emaebo emọ-emọ, “Idi, yak ñnyịn inam itiad ubọbufọk, inyʌñ ifọp ammọ nọ anekke afọn.” Ammọ ekekama mbad ke itie itiad, enyʌñ ekama itai ke itie mbad. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Ndin ammọ emaebo, “Idi yak ñnyịn ibọp abio inọ idem ñnyịn, yak anie tọwa a-akesịmme mme hefịn, nọ ñnyịn inịm anyịñ inọ idem ñnyịn; imiidooho ntoro ñnyịn iyaisuana ikanna afịd iso isọñ.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasọiyọ adi adikịt abio ye tọwa a-mme awo ekebọppọ. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “Adieke adooho nte idịd keed a-asemme usem keed ammọ etọọñọ enam ñkpọ ami, ibaaha se ammọ eduak adinam a-adiisọñ ammọ adinam. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Idi, yak ñnyịn isọiyọ ika ikitịmede usem ammọ mbaak ammọ edikop usem emọ-emọ.”<verse eid="GEN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Ke ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasuan ammọ asio ke ndo adọñ ke afịd iso isọñ, ndin ammọ emaetre adibọp abio ado. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Ntak ado anam ekoot anye Babel sia do ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketịmede usem afịd ederimbod. Tọọñọ ke itie ado ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akesuan ammọ ayọhọ afịd iso isọñ.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tọọñọ ke Sem Tutu Awuọ Ebram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Ami ado mbʌk emana ubon Sem.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 11:10" />
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 11:10">Isua iba ke ukwọ amaakeweeñe, ke ini Sem akesọññọ isua ikie, anye amaabon Afasad. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Ndin anye amaakebon Afasad, Sem amaadu uwem isua ikie ition anyʌñ abon nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Idaha Afasad akedooho isua edịb mme duob mme ition, anye akedo ete anọ Sela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Ndin ke anye amaakebon Sela, Afasad amaadu uwem isua ikie inaañ mme ita (403), anyʌñ anieñe nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Ke Sela amaakeyọhọ isua edịb mme duob, anye amaado ete anọ Ebee. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Ndin anye amaakedo ete inọ Ebee, Sela amaadu uwem isua ikie inaañ mme ita (403), anyʌñ anieñe nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen. <verse eid="GEN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Ke ini Ebee amaakeyọhọ isua edịb mme duob mme inaañ, anye amaabon Pelek. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Ke anye amaakebon Pelek, Ebee amaadu uwem isua ikie inaañ mme edịb mme duob (430), anyʌñ anieñe nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Ke ini Pelek akeyọhọke isua edịb mme duob, anye amaabon Reu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Ndin ke anye amaakebon Reu, Pelek amaadu uwem isua ikie iba mme usʌkkeed (209), anyʌñ anieñe nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Ke ini Reu akeyọhọke isua edịb mme duob mme iba, anye amaabon Seruk. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Ndin ke anye amaakebon Seruk, Reu amaadu uwem isua ikie iba mme itiaba (207), anyʌñ anieñe nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Ke ini Seruk amaakeyọhọ isua edịb mme duob, anye amaabon Nahọ. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Ndin ke anye amaakebon Nahọ, Seruk amaadu uwem isua ikie iba (200), anyʌñ anieñe nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Ke ini Nahọ amaakeyọhọ isua edịb mme usʌkkeed, anye amaabon Tera. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Ndin ke anye amaakebon Tera, Nahọ amaadu uwem isua ikie mme duob mme usʌkkeed (119), anyʌñ anieñe nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Ke Tera amaakeyọhọ isua ata mme duob (70), anye amaabon Ebram, Nahọ ye Haran.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubon Ebram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Ami ado mbʌk ubon emana Tera.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 11:27" />
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 11:27">Tera akedo ete Ebram, Nahọ ye Haran. Ndin Haran akedo ete Lọọd. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Ke ini ete amọ Tera akesʌkkọ aba ke uwem, Haran amaakpa ke Ọọ mbon Kaldi, ke isọñ emana amọ. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Ebram ye Nahọ emaedọ ibaan. Anwaan Ebram akekere Serai, anwaan Nahọ akenyʌñ akere Milka; anye akedo ayịn awonwaan anọ Haran, ete Milka ye Iska. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Ado Serai akedo ada, sia anye ikikanna iyommo idịb.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Tera amaaben ayịn amọ Ebram, ayeyịn amọ Lọọd ayịn Haran, ye anwaan ayịn amọ Serai, anwaan Ebram. Ndin ammọ emaedaaña ekpọñ Ọọ, abio mbon Kaldi ekaiya Kenan. Ado ke ammọ emaekedisịm abio Haran, ammọ emaedʌñọ do.<verse eid="GEN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tera amaadu uwem isua ikie iba mme ition (205), ndin anye akpa ke Haran.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ikood Ebram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Ebram, “Wuọ kpọñ idịd mfo, ubon ye ufọk ete mfo kaa ke isọñ a-ami ñyemme aduwọt fiin.”<verse eid="GEN 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />“Ndin ami ñyaanam afo ado ekamba idịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:2">ami ñyaanyʌñ udiọñ fiin;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 12:2">Ami ñyaanam anyịñ mfo akpon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:2">afo ayaanyʌñ ado adidiọñ.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Ami ñyaadiọñ mbon u-udiọññọ fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">ndin awo akeedodo u-usuuñọke fiin ami ñyaasuuñọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">ndin afịd awo ke iso isọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">eyaebọ adidiọñ uto fiin.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Ndin Ebram amaadakka kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo anye; Lọọd amaanyʌñ akeene anye. Ebram akedo isua ata mme duob mme ition idaha a-anye akekpọññọ Haran. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Ebram amaaben anwaan amọ Serai, ayịn ayịneka amọ Lọọd, afịd inie a-ammọ ekenieñeke ye afịd awo se ammọ ekenie ke Haran edaaña ekaa isọñ Kenan.<verse eid="GEN 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Ebram amaasaña ke isọñ ado tutu akewuọ itie ekamba eto Mọre ke Sekem. Idaha ntoro, mbon Kenan mmọdo ekebañña ke isọñ ado. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawọt Ebram idem anyʌñ abo, “Ubon mfo ke ami ndiinọ isọñ ami.” Ke ntoro anye amaabọp itie uwa ke ndo anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-akeyaarake idem awọt anye.<verse eid="GEN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Akema anye amaadakka do akaa edem ntəkabod Beteel ke usakkautịn, anyʌñ akewuuk atayad amọ do. Beteel akeba ke usobutịn ndin, Ai aba ke usakkautịn. Ke ndo ke anye akebọp itie uwa anyʌñ akoot anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Ndin Ebram amaakaiso asaña akaa ukañ Nekef.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebram ke Iyib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Akema akañ amaaba ke isọñ ado, Ebram amaadakka akaa Iyib adikidʌñ do ke etək ini, sia akañ amaasọñ ubọk eti-eti. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Ke ini anye akeyemme adidʌk Iyib, anye amaabo anwaan amọ Serai, “Ami mmediọọñọ ke afo ado ataa uyaiya awonwaan. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Mbon Iyib emaukịt fiin, ammọ eyaebo, ‘Anwaan amọ ado ami.’ Ndin ammọ eyaeñwot miin, ado unịm fiin uwem. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Bo ke afo ado ayịneka mmi, nọ ami ñkịt mfọn ke iso ammọ ke ntak mfo, nọ ammọ enyʌñ ennịm miin uwem ke ntak mfo.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Ke ini Ebram amaakedisịm Iyib, mbon Iyib emaekịt ke Serai akedo ataa uyaiya awonwaan. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Ndin ke ini mme ikpọ mbon utom Fero ekekịtte anye, ammọ emaetooro anye ke iso Fero, ndin emaeben anye edʌk esa ubọọñ Fero. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Fero amaakama Ebram ke eti usʌñ ke ntak Serai, Ebram amaanyʌñ anie mme edọñ ye mme enañ, ñyaara ye mme uman dọñki, nditọufọk ideen, ye ibaan ye mme kamel.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatọ Fero ye ufọk amọ ataa ndiọi udọñọ ke ntak Serai, anwaan Ebram. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Ndin Fero amaadọñ ekoot Ebram, anyʌñ abo anye ate, “Nsoo ke afo annam miin ami?” “Ntak a-afo uduukuundọkkọke miin ke anye ado anwaan mfo-o? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Ntak a-afo akebooho ‘Anye ado ayịneka mmi,’ nọ ami mben anye nte anwaan mmi-e? Idahami ndin, se anwaan mfo mi. Ben anye nyọñ!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Ndin Fero amaanọ nditọufọk amọ ewʌhọ abaña Ebram, ndin ammọ emaesio anye unyọñ, ye anwaan amọ, ye afịd se anye akenie.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ebram ye Lọọd Ediañña</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Ndin Ebram amaawuọ akpọñ Iyib akaa Nekef, ye anwaan amọ ye afịd se anye akenie, Lọọd amaanyʌñ akeene anye. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Ebram amaanekke amọinyọ ke ufene ye ke silfa ye kold. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Tọọñọ ke Nekef anye amaakaiya mme itie mme itie tutu anye akewuọ Beteel, akewuọ itie akesịneke ke ufọọd Beteel ye Ai, a-anye akebemme iso adaaha atayad amọ <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />ye itie a-anye aketooho abọp itie uwa. Ke itie ado, Ebram amaakoot anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Ndin Lọọd, a-akesisañake ye Ebram, amaanyʌñ anieñe udịmedọñ ye udịmenañ ye mme atayad. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Ado isọñ ado ikikemme ammọ ke ini ammọ ekesʌkkọ eba keed, sia inie ammọ emaewak tutu ammọ ikikanna idʌñọ keed. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Ñko utọk amaatịppe ke ufọọd mme akpeme ufene Ebram ye ake Lọọd. Idaha ntoro, mbon Kenan ye mbon Peris mmọdo ekedʌñ ke isọñ ado.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Ke ntoro, Ebram amaabo Lọọd, “Yak utọk akuuba ke ufọọd mmi ye afo, me ke ufọọd nditọufọk mmi ye ake mfo, sia ñnyịn ido nditọ ete keed. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Nte afịd isọñ ami unaaha fiin ke iso? Yak ñnyịn idiañña nsaña. Adieke afo akaaha ufiin, ami ñyaakaa nnasia; adieke afo akaaha nnasia, ami ñyaakaa ufiin.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Lọọd amaabenne anyen ase akanna afịd unaisọñ Yọdan ke mbeñ ukañ Soa akịt ke mmọọñ anekke aba ke esịd, nte inwañ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nte isọñ Iyib. (Ami akedo mbemiso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akesobo isọñ Sọdọm ye Komora.) <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Ke ntoro Lọọd amaadiañña afịd unaisọñ Yọdan adat anọ idem amọ anyʌñ atara akaa ukañ usakkautịn. Ndin ideen iba ado emaediañña nsaña. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Ebram amaadʌñ ke isọñ Kenan, ke ini Lọọd akedʌññọ ke abio unaisọñ ado anyʌñ awuuk mme atayad amọ akpere Sọdọm. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Idaha ntoro mbon Sọdọm emaebak ibak enyʌñ enekke enam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Ebram ke ini Lọọd amaakediañña akpọñ anye, “Se kanna tọọñọ ke itie a-afo adaaha do, ke adoro ye ke usuuk, ke usakkautịn ye usobutịn. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Afịd isọñ a-afo akịtte do, ami ñyaunọ fiin ye nditọnditọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asʌk ado ubon; se ñko ke Yenesis 13:16</char></note> mfo ke nsi-nsi. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Ami ñyaanam ubon mfo ewak nte ntan isọñ, nọ ato do awo akpekan abat ntan isọñ, anye ayaakan abat ubon mfo. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Kaa ke saaña ke unyọọñ ye ke ubom isọñ ami, sia ami ñyaayaak anye unọ fiin.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Ndin Ebram amaadakka akedʌñ ke ñkpere ikpọ eto Mamre ke Hibrọn, ke itie a-anye akedaahake mme atayad amọ. Anye amaabọp itie uwa anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ndo.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ebram Afak Lọọd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Ke ini Amrafel akedooho adidem ke Sina,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Babilonia; se ñko ke Yenesis 13:9</char></note> Ariọk ado adidem ke Elasa, Kedoloma ado adidem ke Elam, ndin Tidal ado adidem Koyim, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />mme ndidem ami emaekaiya ekọñ ye Bera adidem Sọdọm, Beesa adidem Komora, Sinab adidem Adma, Semeba adidem Seboyịm, ye adidem Bela (a-adooho Soa). <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Afịd mme ndidem ami ekedidiana keed ke itịkke Siddim (a-adooho Abedeñ Ñkpaikpa Akpainyañ). <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Ke isua duob mme iba, ammọ emaenam ñkpọ enọ Kedoloma, ado ke ayọhọ isua duob mme ita, ammọ emaenam nsọñiwuod.<verse eid="GEN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Ke ayọhọ isua duob mme inaañ, Kedoloma ye ndidem e-ekedaaha ye anye emaewuọ ekaa ekekan mbon Refaim ke Asterọd Kaanaim, mbon Susịm ke Ham, mbon Emịm ke Safe Kiriataim <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />ye mbon Hori ke ukañ idịd abod Sei tutu akesịm El Paran ke ñkpere akpautatan. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Ndin ammọ emaetịmme edem enyʌñ ekaa En Mispad (a-adooho Kades). Ammọ ndin emaedikan afịd ñkanñkʌk mbon Amalek ye mbon Amọọ e-ekedʌññọ ke Hasesọn Tama.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Ndin adidem Sọdọm, adidem Komora, adidem Adma, adidem Seboyịm ye adidem Bela (a-adooho Soa) emaenam isañ ewuọñọ edidʌt ukpa ekọñ ammọ ke itịkke Siddim <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />ye Kedoloma adidem Elam, Tidal adidem Koyim, Amrafel adidem Sina ye Ariọk adidem Elasa, ndidem inaañ enwana ye ition. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Ndin itịkke Siddim akeyọhọ ye mme ube akeyọhọke ye itai, ñko ke ini mme ndidem Sọdọm ye Komora ekefeeñeke, usʌk ideen emaeduọññọ edọñọ ube ado, ndin usʌk emaefeeñe edọọk mme abod. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Ndidem inaañ ado emaekoono afịd inie Sọdọm ye Komora ye afịd ndidia ammọ; ndin ammọ emaenyọñọ. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ eben Lọọd a-akedooho ayịn ayịneka Ebram ye mme inie amọ, sia anye akedʌññọ ke Sọdọm.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Awodeen keed a-akebọkkọke afeghe amaaditañ anọ Ebram awo Hibru. Idaha ntoro, Ebram akedʌñ akpere mme ekamba eto Mamre awo Amọọ, ayịneka awodeen Eskol ye Anee, ndin afịd ammọ emaedʌk edioomo adidiana keed ye Ebram. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Ke ini Ebram akekoppo ke e-emʌm ayịn ayịneka amọ nte ifʌn, anye amaakoot ideen ikie ita mme duob mme itiaita (318), e-ekebọọhọ ukpeeb, e-ekenyʌññọ emana ke ufọk amọ, ndin ammọ emaekaa adinyaaña Lọọd tutu akewuọ Daan. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Ke akonayio Ebram amaabakka ideen amọ anyʌñ abana ammọ idem nọ ekenwana ye mbon e-ekemʌmmọ Lọọd, ndin ammọ emaebịne ammọ tutu ekewuọ Hoba, ke adoro Damaskọs. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Anye amaabọi ammọ afịd mme inie a-ammọ ekekoonoke anyʌñ aben Lọọd ayakka amọ ye afịd inie amọ ye afịd ibaan ye mbon mfen anyọñ adi. <verse eid="GEN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Ke Ebram amaakenyọñ adikan Kedoloma ye ndidem e-ekedianake ye anye idi, adidem Sọdọm amaawuọ adisoobo ye anye ke itịkke Safe (a-adooho Itịkke Adidem). <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Ndin Melkisedek adidem Salem amaasio uyo ye ukọd adi. Anye akedo aku Abasi Andikoñ Ñkan, <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />ndin anye amaadiọñ Ebram, abo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 14:19">“Adidiọñ anie Ebram ato Abasi Andikoñ Ñkan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 14:19">Andinam anyọñ ye isọñ.<verse eid="GEN 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Ñko, itooro anie Abasi Andikoñ Ñkan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 14:20">a-akeyaaha mme asua mfo usịn fiin ke ubọk.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 14:20">Ke ntoro Ebram amaanọ anye mbakka keed ke itie duob afịd ñkpọ.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Adidem Sọdọm amaabo Ebram, “Saana mme awo ado nnọ miin, ndin dat mme inie nịm nọ idem mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Ado Ebram amaabo adidem Sọdọm, “Ami mmedịppe ubọk ñnwọñọ unwọñọ nnọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Andikoñ Ñkan, andinam anyọñ ye isọñ, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />ke ami ndiibọọhọ ñkpọ ndomokeed u-unieghe fiin, ñkpọ nte udʌk me ñkpaha ikpaukod, mbaak afo udubo, ‘ami ñkenam Ebram amọinyọ.’ <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Ami ndiibọọhọ ñkpọ ndomokeed ibọhọke se ideen mmi ekedia ye udeeme a-anieghe ideen e-ekesañake ye ami eka Anee, Eskol ye Mamre. Yak ammọ edat udeeme ammọ.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye Ebram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Ke ami amaakeboiyo, ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Ebram ke ñkukịd:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 15:1">“Ebram, kuufeghe ndịk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 15:1">Ami ndo atuekọñ mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 15:1">ataa ekamba utịb mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Ado Ebram amaabo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, nsoo ke afo adiinam innọ miin, sia ami nnieghe ayịn ndin awo se idiidia akpa mmi ado Eliesa a-atooho Damaskọs?” <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Ebram amaanyʌñ abo, “Afo unnọọhọ miin ayịn ndomokeed; ke ntoro ayịnufọk ke ufọk mmi adiido adiaakpa mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Ndin ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm anye idem ate: “Awo ami idiidooho adiaakpa mfo, ado ayịn a-adooho abʌk ye iyiib mfo adiido adiaakpa mfo.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Anye amaaben anye awuọ anwaesiin anyʌñ akebo anye, “Benne anyen se ikpaanyọñ nyʌñ bat mme ntantaafiọñ; adieke adooho afo ayaakan abat ammọ.” Ndin anye amaabo Ebram, “Ntoro ke ubon mfo adiiba.”<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Ebram amaanịm <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke akpanikọ, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabat ado anọ anye nte adinenido. <verse eid="GEN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Anye amaanyʌñ abo anye ate, “Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-akusioho fiin ke Ọọ, abio mbon Kaldi adunọ fiin isọñ ami nọ adat anie.” <verse eid="GEN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Ado Ebram amaabo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, ami ndiisaña die ndiọọñọ ke ami ñyaadat isọñ ado nnie?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo anye, “Ben ñyịn umanenañ, ebod ye akukịmedọñ e-edoññoke isua ita nsọk, ñko saña ye ibiom ye abomoñkuku.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Ebram amaakoono afịd mme ñkpọ ami asọk anye, akpok ammọ ke itie iba anyʌñ aneeñe mme mbaak ado abono nọ ammọ esak iso ese emọ-emọ; ado anye ikikpokko mme inuen ke mbakka iba. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Akema mme inuen utañkpọ emaesọiyọ edita mme akpo ado, ado Ebram amaabịn ammọ asịññe.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Ke ayio amaaketọọñọ adikịm, akpọsọñ idab amaayeet Ebram, ndin ekamba ndịk ye ekịm amaafʌk anye. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Ebram ate, “Diọọñọ ke ataa akpanikọ ke isua ikie inaañ ke ubon mfo ediido isenawo ke idịd i-imiidooho ake ammọ, ndin ke eyaesịn ammọ ufʌn enyʌñ etʌkkọ ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Ado ami ñyaamia idịd a-ammọ ediido ifʌn inọ ufen, ndin ke ado amaaboiyo ammọ eyaewuọñọ edi ye uwak inie. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Ado ke akpanikọ afo ayaanyọñ abịne mme eteete mfo ke emem, enyʌñ ubuuk fiin ke umaunekke usọñ ke isua. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Ayọhọ emana mfo inaañ eyaetịmme edi mmi, sia ndiọiñkpọ mbon Amọọ iyọhọke iduọi diin.” <verse eid="GEN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Ke ini utịn amaakesop, ayio anyʌñ akịm, akoikañ a-awuọñọke nsʌñikañ ye ñyaayamma emuumikañ emaeboiyo ke ufọọd mme mbai ñkpọ ado. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Ke usen ado, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam edioomo ye Ebram ate, “Ubon mfo ke ami nnọ isọñ ami, tọọñọ ke inyañ Wadi ke Iyib tutu akewuọ ekamba inyañ Yufretis, <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />isọñ mbon Keen, mbon Kenis, mbon Kadmọn, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />mbon Hed, mbon Peris, mbon Refaim <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />mbon Amọọ, mbon Kenan, mbon Keekasi ye mbon Yebus.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s1">Haka ye Ismeel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Ndin Serai, anwaan Ebram, ikimanna ayịn ndomokeed inọ anye. Ado anye amaanie afʌn keed a-akedooho awo Iyib a-akekereke Haka. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Ke ntoro anye amaabo Ebram, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> iyemme nọ ami nnie nditọ. Kaa, ke naa ye afʌn mmi; akeme ido ami ñyaasiak ubon nto anye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:2">Ebram amaanyịmme se Serai aketañ. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Akema ke Ebram amaakedʌñ ke Kenan ñkpọ nte isua duob, Serai anwaan amọ amaaben afʌn amọ a-akedooho awo Iyib a-akekereke Haka anọ ebe amọ nọ adọ. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Anye amaanaa ye Haka, ndin Haka amaayommo idịb.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:4">Ke ini anye akekịtte ke imọ imiiyommo, anye amaatọọñọ imịnne ekaufọk amọ. <verse eid="GEN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Ndin Serai amaabo Ebram, “Afo ado ntak a-ami mbọọhọ usọñanyen. Ami ñkeben afʌn mmi unọọ fiin, ndin sia anye akịtte ke imọ imiiyommo, ayense miin ke ndek. Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpe ikpe annọ miin ye afo.”<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Ndin Ebram amaabo Serai ate, “Afʌn mfo usịne fiin ke ubọk, nam ye anye se afo akịt ke u-ufọn fiin.” Ke ntak ado, Serai amaafʌnnọ Haka; ndin anye amaanyʌñ afeghe awuọ akpọñ Serai.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakịt Haka ke ñkpere ube mmọọñ ke akpautatan; akedo ube mmọọñ a-akekpereke usʌñ Sọọ. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Ndin anye amaabịp ate, “Haka afʌn Serai, afo ato uke adi, anyʌñ akaa uke?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:8">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami mfeghe ñkpọñ ekaufọk mmi Serai.” <verse eid="GEN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Ndin enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo anye, “Tịmme nyọñ bịne ukaufọk ke suuhọ iwuood nọ anye.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Enyere Abọọñ amaanyʌñ adian do ate, “Ami ñyaanam ubon mfo anekke atọt tutu idooho se awo akan abat.”<verse eid="GEN 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanyʌñ abo anye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:11">“Idahami, afo amenyommo idịb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:11">afo ayaanyʌñ aman ayịn awodeen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:11">Afo uduukoot anye Ismeel,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ismeel awuọñọ Abasi akop</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:11">sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-akop ntuañña ukuud mfo.<verse eid="GEN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Anye adiido awodeen a-atieghe nte dọñki ikọd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">ubọk amọ ayaadoro afịd awo ke idem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">ndin ubọk afịd awo ayaanyʌñ adoro anye ke idem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:12">ndin anye adiidʌñ afai-afai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">ye afịd nditọete amọ ideen.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Ndin Haka amaanọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-aketañña ikọ ye anye anyịñ ate: “Afo ado Abasi añkịtte miin, sia idahami ami mmekịt Anye añkịtte miin.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Ntak ado anam ekekoot ube mmọọñ ado Bee Lahai Rọi;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bee Lahai Rọi awuọñọ udu a-anieghe Aduuwem a-añkịtte miin</char></note> a-adooho mmọdo asʌk ababa tutu mfịn ami, ke ufọọd Kades ye Bered. <verse eid="GEN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Akema Haka amaaman ayịn awodeen anọ Ebram, ndin Ebram amaasio anye añyịn Ismeel. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Ebram akedo isua anaañ mme itiokeed idaha a-Haka akemanna Ismeel.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Edioomo Ufọọrọ Edʌd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Ke Ebram amaakeyọhọ isua anaañ mme duob mme usʌkkeed, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayaara idem anọ anye anyʌñ abo anye ate, “Ami ndo Abasi Andikponñkan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Abasi Andikponñkan ado El-Sadai</char></note>; saña mfọn-mfọn ke iso mmi nyʌñ nana ndo. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Ndin ami ñyaanam edioomo ke ufọọd mmi ye afo ñnyʌñ nnam nọ afo atọt ke ibad.”<verse eid="GEN 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Ebram amaaduọ afʌk iso ke isọñ, ndin Abasi amaabo anye ate, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“Ama ado ami, edioomo mmi ye afo ado ami: Afo ayaado ete uwak idịd. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Afo uduukereke Ebram aba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebram awuọñọ ekamba ete</char></note>; anyịñ mfo adiido Ebraham,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atie nte Ebraham awuọñọ ete uwak awo</char></note> sia ami mmenam afo ado ete uwak mme idịd. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Ami ñyaanam afo anekke atọt; ñyaanyʌñ nnam uwak idịd esakka uto fiin, ñko ndidem eyaewuọñọ eto ke idem mfo. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Ami ñyaasọọñọ edioomo mmi nte nsi-nsi edioomo ke ufọọd mmi ye afo ye ubon mfo se ukeene fiin ye emana ini iso mfo; ndin ami ñyaado Abasi mfo ye Abasi mme ubon e-eduukeene fiin. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Afịd isọñ Kenan, a-afo adʌññọ nte asenawo idahami, ami ñyaunọ fiin ye ubon mfo nte nsi-nsi inie; ñko ami ñyaado Abasi ammọ.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Ndin Abasi amaabo Ebraham, “Amaado afo, ana afo anịm edioomo mmi, afo ye ubon mfo se iduukeene fiin ke emana ini iso. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Edioomo mmi ye ubon mfo u-ukeeneke fiin ado ami, ndin ana afo anịm edioomo ami: Afịd ideen ke atu mfo ana efọọrọ edʌd<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">efọọrọ edʌd </char><char style="ft" closed="false">awuọñọ adidiọọñ idem ideen</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Ana afo afọọrọ edʌd, ndin ami adiido idiọọñọ edioomo ke ufọọd mmi ye afo. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Ke mme emana se idiidi, afịd ideen ke atu ndufo e-eyọhọke usen itiaita ana efọọrọ edʌd, ye ke adooho mbon e-emanake ke ufọk mfo me mbon e-edeppedep ke akʌk eto mbon i-imiidooho aduuk mfo. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Me ado awo a-amanake ke ufọk mfo me anye a-afo adeppe ke akʌk mfo, ana efọọrọ ammọ edʌd. Edioomo mmi ke abʌkidem mfo ana ado nsi-nsi edioomo. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Awodeen akeedodo i-imiifọọrọke edʌd, awo imiifọọrọke edʌd ke abʌkidem, eyaediañña anye ekpọñ ubon amọ; sia anye a-abiat edioomo mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Abasi amaanyʌñ abo Ebraham, “Ama ado Serai anwaan mfo, inaaha afo akoot anye Serai aba; anyịñ amọ adiido Sera. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Ami ñyaadiọñ anye ñnyʌñ unọ fiin ayịn nto anye. Ami ñyaadiọñ anye nọ anye ado eka uwak idịd; ndidem mme idịd eyaewuọññọ eto anye.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Ebraham amaaduọ afʌk iso ke isọñ; ndin anye amaasak anyʌñ abo idem amọ, “Awo isua ikie akeme ibon ayịn? Sera akeme iman ayịn ke isua anaañ mme duob?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Ebraham amaanyʌñ abo Abasi, “Ubaha akpedooho Ismeel ado adiakpa mmi!”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Ndin Abasi amaabo Ebraham, “Ado ntoro, ado anwaan mfo Sera ayaaman ayịn awodeen unọ fiin, ndin afo ayaasio anye anyịñ Aisik. Ami ñyaanam edioomo mmi ye anye nte nsi-nsi edioomo nnọ ubon amọ se idiikeene anye. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Ado amaado Ismeel, ami mmekop se afo atañ. Ana ami ndiọñ anye; ami ñyaanam anye atọt ñnyʌñ nnam anye awak ke ibad. Anye ayaado ete anọ mme adaukara duob mme iba, ndin ñyaanam anye ado ekamba idịd. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Ado ami ndiinam edioomo mmi asu ye Aisik, a-Sera adiiman unọ fiin isua mfen idaha ntom.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Ke ini Abasi amaaketañ ikọ ama ye Ebraham, amaadakka akpọñ anye.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Ke usen ado Ebraham amaaben ayịn amọ Ismeel ye afịd mbon se ikimana ke ufọk amọ ye mbon se ekedep ke akʌk amọ, afịd se ikido ideen ke ufọk amọ, akefọọrọ ammọ edʌd, kpa naña Abasi akebo anye anam. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Ebraham akesọñ isua anaañ mme duob mme usʌkkeed idaha e-ekefọọrọke anye edʌd. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Ayịn amọ Ismeel ñko akedo isua duob mme ita ke ini ekefọọrọke anye edʌd. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Kpa ke usen ado ke ekefọọrọ Ebraham ye Ismeel ayịn amọ edʌd. <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />Emaefọọrọ afịd ideen se ikiba ke ufọk Ebraham, ye mbon se ikimana do, ñkọrọ mbon e-ekedeppe eto awo asenidịd edʌd.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Isenawo Ita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayaara idem awọt Ebraham ke ñkpere ñkpoon eto Mamre idaha a-anye aketieghe ke inuausʌñ atayad amọ ke ufọọd uweemeayio usen keed. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Ebraham amaadịppe anyen, ndin amaakịt ideen ita naña eda ekpere. Anye akekịt ammọ, amaasọp adakka abịne ammọ akenyuuk iwuod ke isọñ.<verse eid="GEN 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />Ndin anye amaabo, “Adieke ami ñkịtte mfọn ke iso ndufo, mbọọñ mmi, ikiiboiyo ikpọñ ayịnufọk ndufo. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Yak eben etək mmọọñ edi nọ ndufo eyie ukod enyʌñ eduọk adudu ke idak eto ami. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Yak ami ñyem ñkpọ inọ ndufo nọ edia, nọ idem amaana isọọñ mbemiso ndufo e-eboiyo ekaa iso ke isañ ndufo, sia ndufo imaikidi ibịne ayịnufọk ndufo.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 18:5">Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “A-afọn, nam naña afo abo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Ebraham amaasọp idem adʌk atayad abịne Sera akebo anye, “Sọp idem, ben ndomuyo se ifọn ikan ke udomoñkpọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 16</char></note> ita nuakka kama nam uyo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Akema Ebraham amaafeghe akaa atu ufene akesio ñyịn enañ se ifọn, anọ ayịnufọk amọ, ndin anye amaanyʌñ asọp idem atem. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Ndin Ebraham amaaben iboro-iboro mmọọñeba ye ataa ñkaña mmọọñeba ye ñyịn enañ e-eketemme, adinịm ke iso ammọ. Ke ini ammọ ekesʌkkọ edia ñkpọ, anye amaada ke idak eto akpere ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Ammọ emaebịp anye ete, “Sera anwaan mfo-o?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 18:9">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Mmọdo ke atayad.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Ndin awo ammọ keed amaabo, “Ke akpanikọ ami ñyaatịmme ubịne fiin ke ukem ini ami isua mfen idaha ntom, ndin Sera anwaan mfo ayaaman ayịn awodeen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Idaha ntom Sera mmọ akediana ke inuausʌñ ke edem ammọ asʌk akpañ utọñ. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Ebraham ye Sera emaenekke esọọñ, ñko Sera amaaboiyo ini uman ayịn. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Ke ntoro, Sera amaasak ke esịd amọ anyʌñ akere abo, “Idahami ndin ke ami ndiinie utọ inemesịd ami, ke mmaaketaha mma, ndin abọọñ mmi a-asọñ?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Ebraham, “Nsoo inam nọ Sera asak anyʌñ abo ‘Me ami ñyaasʌk nnie ayịn idahami, a-adooho ami mmesọñ?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Me a-aba ñkpọ se isọñ ikan <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>? Ami ñyaatịmme ndi ubịne fiin ke ukem ini ami isua mfen, ndin Sera ayaaman ayịn.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Idem amaanyeñ Sera, ndin anye amaasʌhọ nsu ate, “Ami ñkisakka.” Ado anye amaabo, “Afo amaasak.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebraham Anam Ñkpeubọk Abaña Sọdọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Ke ini ideen ado ekedaañake eda edinyọñọ, ammọ emaewuuk anyen ese Sọdọm, ndin Ebraham amaasaña ye ammọ adat ammọ isañ akaa usʌñ unyọñọ ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “Mme ami ñkpaadịp Ebraham se ami ñyem adinam? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Ebraham idiitreke adido ekamba ye akpọsọñ idịd, ñko afịd idịd ke isọñ eyaebọ adidiọñ eto anye.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido adidat anyịñ amọ nnọọ adidiọñ (se Yenesis 48:20)</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Sia ami mmemek anye, nọ anye adiidat nditọ amọ ye afịd ufọk amọ e-ediikeene anye usʌñ nọ ekpeme usʌñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke adinam se ifọn ye se inen, nọ ato do <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiinam se anye akenwọñọ anọ Ebraham.” <verse eid="GEN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “Akpọsọñ ñkpo aseeme ke ntak Sọdọm ye Komora anekke akpon ndin idiọọkñkpọ ammọ anyʌñ anekke adoppo, <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />ke ntak ami ñyaasọiyọ ñkese me se ammọ enam a-adiọọk naña ami ñkop. Imiidooho ntoro, ami ñyaadiọọñọ.” <verse eid="GEN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Ideen ado emaewọññọ iso ekaa Sọdọm, ado Ebraham amaatuak ada ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Ndin Ebraham amaasaña akpere anye anyʌñ abo, “Nte Afo ayaasobo ndinen awo ye mbon ibak? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Adieke eyọhọke awo aba mme duob se inen ke abio ado-o? Afo ayaasʌk asobo anye me ayaadakka anọ abio ado ke ntak awo aba mme duob ado? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Nsaa mfo-o, afo adinam utọ ñkpọ ado, adiwot ndinen awo ye mbon ibak ukem-ukem, adinam ye ndinen awo ukem naña anam ye mbon ibak. Nsaa mfo-o! Afo nte akpeikpe afịd ederimbod uduunamma se ifọn?” <verse eid="GEN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọọrọ, “Adieke ami ñkịtte ndinen awo aba mme duob ke abio Sọdọm, ami ñyaadakka nnọ afịd abio ado ke ntak ammọ.” <verse eid="GEN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Ebraham amaamaana asio uyio abo: “Idaha a-adooho ami mmenie uko aditañ ikọ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akpesʌkado ami ndooho ñkpọ ñkan abu ye ntọñ, <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />adieke ibad ndinen awo asịppe akan aba mme duob ke ñkpọ nte awo ition-o? Afo ayaasʌk asobo afịd abio ke ntak awo ition adisiọọd?” Anye amaabo “Adieke ñkịtte awo aba mme ition do, ami ndiisoboke anye.” <verse eid="GEN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Ini keed mfen Ebraham amaatañ ikọ ye anye abo, “Akpedo anam anye ado awo aba ke afo akịt do-o?” Anye amaabo, “Ke ntak awo aba ado, ami ndiinamma.” <verse eid="GEN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Ndin anye amaabo, “Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akuuyat esịd, ado yak ami ntañ ikọ. Adieke akịtte awo edịb mme duob kpọd do-o?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 18:30">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami ndiinamma adieke ñkịtte awo edịb mme duob do.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Ebraham amaabo, “Idahami sia ami mmenie uko aditañ ikọ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, adieke adooho awo edịb kpọd ke afo akịt do-o?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 18:31">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami ñkpekịt awo edịb do, ami ndiisoboke anye.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Ndin anye amaabo, “Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akuuyat esịd, ado yak ami ntañ akañ keed ami. Adieke adooho awo duob kpọd ke akịt do-o?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 18:32">Anye amaabọọrọ “Ke ntak awo duob ado, ami ndiisoboke anye.”<verse eid="GEN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaketañ ikọ ama ye Ebraham, anye amaadakka, ndin Ebraham amaanyọñ ufọk.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Esobo Sọdọm ye Komora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Enyere iba emaekewuọ Sọdọm ke ndubiayio, ndin Lọọd aketie ke inuaatob abio. Ke ini anye akekịtte ammọ, anye amaadakka ada akesoobo ye ammọ, anyʌñ asuuk iso amọ ke isọñ. <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />Ndin anye amaabo, “Mbọọñ mmi, mbọk ikanna iso idi ufọk ayịnufọk ndufo. Ndufo ekpaediyie ukod enyʌñ esuuk enaa akonayio ami, ndin ñkpọñ ubakusen ndufo ekaa iso ke isañ ndufo.” Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Iyoo, ñnyịn idiina ke afe abio akonayio ami.” <verse eid="GEN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Ado Lọọd amaanekke ayiire ndin ammọ emaekeene anye ekedʌk ufọk amọ. Anye amaanam ndidia anọ ammọ, uyo se yiis imiisịneke, ndin ammọ emaedia. <verse eid="GEN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Mbemiso ammọ ekedaiya, afịd ideen ke afịd efaak ke abio Sọdọm, iwaad ye ñkpoonawo, emaekanna ufọk ado ekʌk. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Ammọ emaekoot Lọọd ebo, “Mmọ ideen e-ekedʌkkọ ubịne fiin akonayio ami? Sịññe ammọ inọ ñnyịn nọ inaa ye ammọ.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Lọọd amaawuọ akekịt ammọ ke esiin, abet usʌñ <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />anyʌñ akebo, “Iyoo, mme ufan mmi. Ikiinam utọ ibak ami. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Se, ami mmenie nditọ ibaan iba a-adooho tọọñọ anam inaaha ye awodeen. Yak nsio ammọ isọk ndufo nọ enam ye ammọ se ndufo ema. Ado ikiinam ideen ami ñkpọ ndomokeed, sia ammọ edo isenawo mmi, ndin ana ami ñkpeme ammọ.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ anye. “Dakka ke usʌñ ñnyịn, awo ami akedi mmi nte asenawo, ndin idahami anye ayem adido abiideikpe! Ñnyịn iyainam nọ adiọọk ye afo akan ammọ.” Ammọ emaekaa iso efaaña ye Lọọd enyʌñ edaaña ekaa edibiat udọk.<verse eid="GEN 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Ado ideen ado ke esịd ufọk emaenyan ubọk edʌt Lọọd esịn ke ufọk enyʌñ ebet usʌñ. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Ndin ammọ emaetọ afịd ideen ekedaaha ke inuausʌñ ufọk ado nnan, anam ammọ ikimọọnọke inuausʌñ ufọk aba.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Ideen iba ado emaebo Lọọd, “Amenie awo ndomokeed mfen mi, mme ebe ayịn, nditọ ideen me nditọ ibaan, me awo ndomokeed ke isọñabio ami a-adooho ake mfo? Sio ammọ kpọñ abio ami, <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />sia ñnyịn iyaisobo abio ami. Akpọsọñ aseeme a-atooho abio ami abịne Abọọñ a-akpon eti-eti, ado asịn anye idọñ ñnyịn nọ idisobo anye.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Ke ntoro, Lọọd amaawuọ aketañ ikọ ye mme ukod amọ, e-ekeyemme edidọ nditọ ibaan amọ. Anye amaabo ammọ, “Isọp idem iwuọ ikpọñ abio ami, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaasọp asobo isọñ abio ami!” Ado mme ukod amọ ekekere ke anye atọ ndọk.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Ke usiere, mme enyere emaekpak Lọọd, ete, “Sọp idem! Ben anwaan mfo ye nditọ mfo ibaan iba e-ebaaha mi wuọ, imiidooho eyaisobo ndufo idaha ediimia abio ami ufen.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Ke ini anye akemeeñeke, ideen ado emaemʌm anye ubọk ye ubọk anwaan amọ ye ubọk nditọ ibaan amọ iba, enyʌñ edat ammọ esio ke abio ado ke ifuuro, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanie mbọm abaña ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Ideen ado ekesʌk esosio Lọọd ye mbon ufọk amọ, awo ammọ keed amaabo, “Ifeeñe iyem itọñ uwem ndufo! Ikiise edem, ikiinyʌñ ituak ida ke itie ndomokeed ke unaisọñ! Ifeeñe ikaa mme ikpọabod, imiidooho eyaisobo ndufo!”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Ado Lọọd amaabo ammọ, “Iyoo, mbọk, mbọọñ mmi! <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Ayịnufọk mfo a-akịt mfọn ke iso ndufo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru ado afo</char></note>, ndin ndufo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru ado afo</char></note> emeñwọt miin uwak mfọnido ke ndufo edinnịm miin uwem. Ado ami ndiikanna mfeghe ñka mme ikpọabod; nsobo ami ayansịm miin, ndin ami ñyaakpa. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />A-ba etək-etək abio a-adaaha akpere akem se ñkpefeghe ñka. Yak ami mfeghe ñka do, ndin eyaenyaaña uwem mmi.” Anye ado ataa etək-etək abio.<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Ndin enyere amaabo anye, “A-afọn, ami mmenyịmme ebeeñe mfo; ndiisoboke abio a-afo atañña abaña do. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Ado sọp idem feghe kaa do, sia ami ñkemeke adinam ñkpọ ndomokeed tutu afo asịm do.” Ntak ado anam ekekoot abio ado Soa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soa awuọñọ etək</char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Lọọd atikisịm Soa, utịn amaasakka ke abio ado. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam ikañ adep nte edịm ke Sọdọm ye Komora, ikañ a-atooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> awuọ ke mme hefịn. <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />Ke ntoro anye amaasuan mme isọñabio ado ye afịd unaisọñ, asobo afịd se idu uwem ke isọñabio ado, dian ye afịd se ikitịppe ke isọñ. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Ado anwaan Lọọd amaakanna anyen ase edem, anyʌñ akappa ado adaaha inʌñ.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Ubakusen edem usen Ebraham amaademme anyʌñ atịmme akaa itie a-anye akedaaha ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Anye amaakanna anyen ase ukañ Sọdọm ye Komora, utịd afịd isọñ unaisọñ, ndin anye amaakịt nte akpọsọñ nsʌñikañ awuọ ato isọñabio ado nte nsʌñikañ a-atooho ñkpọdiọhọ ikañ.<verse eid="GEN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Ke ini Abasi akesoboke mme abio unaisọñ, anye amaatoiyo Ebraham, amaanyʌñ asio Lọọd ke afanekọñ a-akedisịmme mme abio a-Lọọd akedʌññọ.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lọọd ye Nditọ Amọ Ibaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Lọọd ye nditọ amọ ibaan emaekpọñ Soa ekedʌñ ke mme ikpọabod, sia anye akekoppo ndịk adidʌñ ke Soa. Anye ye nditọ amọ ibaan iba ekedʌñ ke abaitiad. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Usen keed adiaha Lọọd amaabo ñnwaeka ate, “Ete ñnyịn a-asọñ, ndin awodeen ibaaha mi se isịn ñnyịn idịb nọ iman nditọ naña ido ado ke afịd iso isọñ. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Yak inam nọ ukọd anaam ete ñnyịn, ndin ñnyịn ina ye anye, ke ntoro ñnyịn iyaimʌm anyịñ ubon ñnyịn ikama ito ete ñnyịn.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Akonayio ado, ammọ emaenọ ete ammọ ukọd, ndin adiaha amaadʌk akena ye ete amọ. Lọọd ikidiọọñọke idaha a-adiaha amọ akedinaaha ye anye me idaha anye akedakkake ada.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Edem usen adiaha ado amaabo ñnwaeka, “Akonayio a-akeboiyoke ami ñkenaa ye ete ñnyịn. Yak ñnyịn imaana inọ anye ukọd akonayio ami, ndin afo ayaakaa akena ye anye nọ ato do anyịñ ubon ñnyịn asʌk aba ato ete ñnyịn.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Ndin akonayio ado, ammọ emaemaana enọ ete ammọ ukọd, ndin ñnwa Lọọd amaakena ye ete amọ. Lọọd ikidiọọñọke idaha a-ñnwa amọ akenaaha ye anye me idaha anye akedakkake ada.<verse eid="GEN 19:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Ndin nditọ ibaan Lọọd iba emaeyommo idịb enọ ete ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Adiaha ado amaaman ayịn awodeen, anyʌñ asio anye Mọb;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mọb atie nte ikọ Hibru a-adooho ete</char></note> anye ado ete mbon Mọb ayio mfịn. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Ñnwa amaanyʌñ aman ayịn awodeen, anyʌñ asio anye Ben-Ammi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ben-Ammi awuọñọ ayịn awodeen ubon ete mmi</char></note>; anye ado ete mbon Amọn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru mbon Amọn ado Bene-Ammọn</char></note> ayio mfịn.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ebraham ye Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Ebraham amaakpọñ ndo akaa ubeñ ukañ Nekef akedʌñ ke ufọọd Kades ye Sọọ. Anye amaadʌñ etək ini ke Kera, <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />ndin ke udo ke Ebraham aketañ abaña Sera anwaan amọ, ate, “Anye ado ayịneka mmi awonwaan.” Ndin Abimelek adidem Kera amaadọñ ekekoot Sera anyʌñ adat anye anie. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Ado Abasi amaabịne Abimelek ke ndab akonayio keed akebo anye, “Afo amekama ñkpa isọn ke ntak awonwaan a-afo abenne do, sia anye ado anwaan ufọk ndọ.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Idaha ntoro, Abimelek ikisañake ikpere anye, ndin anye amaabo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, afo ayaasobo idịd i-miidueghe isob? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Ado nte Ebraham ikimbooho miin, ‘Anye ado ayịneka mmi awonwaan,’ Sera ñko anyʌñ ambo miin, ‘Anye ado ayịneka mmi awodeen’? Ami ñkenam ñkpọ ami ke eti esịd ye afia ubọk.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Ndin Abasi amaabọọrọ anye ke ndab ate, “Ntoro ke ado, ami mmediọọñọ ke afo akenam ñkpọ ami ke eti esịd, ado anam ami ñyemme nọ afo andue miin. Ntak ado anam ami ñkiyakka afo atuuk anye. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Idahami saana anwaan awo yaak nọ anyọñ abịne andinie, sia ebe ado prọfed, ndin anye ayaabọñ akam unọ fiin ndin afo ayaadu uwem. Ado adieke afo umuuyakka anye anyọñ, ana afo adiọọñọ ke afo ye afịd se afo anie eyaekpañña.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Ubakusen edem usen, Abimelek amaakoot afịd mme adaaha amọ abono, ndin ke anye amaakedọkkọ ammọ se ikitịppe, idem amaanekke anyeñ ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Ndin Abimelek amaakoot Ebraham asịn ke ufọk abo, “Nsoo ke afo inam ñnyịn ntom? Ami udue die fiin nọ afo aben utọ ekamba ufen ami ansọk miin ye abio mmi? Afo amennam miin mme ñkpọ se imiikpinaaha annam.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Abimelek amaanyʌñ abịp Ebraham, “Ntak afo akenamma utọ ñkpọ ami-e?” <verse eid="GEN 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Ebraham amaabọọrọ, “Ami ñkebo idem mmi nte, ‘Ke akpanikọ mbaak Abasi ibaaha ke itie ami, ndin ammọ eyaeñwot miin ke ntak anwaan mmi.’ <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Ke adinekke ntañ, anye ado ayịneka mmi, ete mmi abon anye, ado idooho eka mmi aman anye; ndin anye adido anwaan mmi. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Ndin ke ini Abasi akebooho ñkpọñ ufọk ete mmi, ami mmaabo anye, ‘Naña afo akeme adiñwọt miin ima mfo ado ami: Afịd itie se ñnyịn ikaa, ana afo abo, “Anye ado ayịneka mmi awodeen.” ’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Ndin Abimelek amaaben edọñ ye enañ ye ifʌn ideen ye ibaan akenọ Ebraham, anyʌñ ayaak Sera anwaan amọ anọ anye. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Abimelek amaadian do abo, “Se isọñ mmi do ke iso mfo, dʌñ ke nte afo ama.”<verse eid="GEN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Ke ukañ Sera anye amaabo, “Ami ñyaanọ ayịneka mfo awodeen mbaak silfa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 12</char></note> tọsịn keed. Ami ado ke ntak ndudue e-ekenamma ye afo ke iso afịd awo e-ekebaaha ye afo; ikpe u-utoppo fiin afịd-afịd.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Ndin Ebraham amaabọñ akam anọ Abasi, ndin anye amaakọk Abimelek, anwaan amọ ye mme ifʌn ibaan amọ nọ ammọ emaana eman nditọ, <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam ibaan ke ufọk Abimelek etre uyommo idịb ke ntak Sera, anwaan Ebraham.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Emana Aisik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaafọn ido ye Sera, kpa naña anye aketañ; ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam se anye akenwọñọ anọ Sera. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Sera amaayommo idịb anyʌñ aman ayịn awodeen anọ Ebraham ke anye amaakesọñ ke isua, kpa ke ukem ini A-Abasi akenwọñọke anọ anye. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Ebraham amaasio ayịn a-Sera akemanna anọ anye Aisik<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisik awuọñọ anye asak</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Ke ini Aisik ayịn amọ akeyọhọke usen itiaita, Ebraham amaafọọrọ anye edʌd, naña Abasi akebo anye anam. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Ebraham akedo isua ikie idaha a-ayịn amọ Aisik akemanake anọ anye.<verse eid="GEN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Sera amaabo, “Abasi annọ miin imam nọ nsak, ndin afịd awo e-ekoppo ebaña ñkpọ ami eyaesak ye ami.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Anye amaadian do abo, “Anie awo ikpikibo Ebraham ke Sera akpaanie nditọ? Ado ami mmeman ayịn awodeen nnọ anye ke ayio usọñ amọ.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebịne Haka ye Ismeel Esio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Ayịn ado amaakpon enyʌñ efịppe anye ke eba, ndin ke usen e-ekefịppeke Aisik ke eba, Ebraham amaanam ekamba usọrọ. <verse eid="GEN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Ndin Sera amaakịt ke ayịn ake Haka a-awo Iyib akemanna anọ Ebraham akesʌk asak. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Anye amaabo Ebraham, “Bịne afʌn awonwaan ado ye ayịn awodeen amọ sio, sia ayịn afʌn awonwaan ado idiikemekekeme adiwana udeemeñkpọ adiaakpa ye Aisik ayịn mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Ñkpọ ado amaafịna Ebraham eti-eti, sia akebañake ayịn amọ awodeen. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Ado Abasi amaabo Ebraham, “Kuunekke ufịna idem ubaña etəkayịn awodeen ado ye afʌn awonwaan mfo. Kpañ utọñ kop se Sera atañ unọọ fiin, sia adiito ke Aisik ke ubon mfo adiisakka. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Ami ñyaanyʌñ nnam ayịn afʌn awonwaan ado ñko akappa ado idịd sia anye ado mfịd mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Ubakusen edem usen Ebraham amaaben ndidia ye mmọọñ ke ekpadikpa anọ Haka. Anye amaadịppe mme ñkpọ ado adot anye ke afara anyʌñ asio anye ye ayịn amọ unyọñ. Anye amaakaa uwa amọ akeyooñ ke Akpautatan Beeseba.<verse eid="GEN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Ke mmọọñ a-akesịneke ke ekpadikpa amaakekweeñe, anye amaayaak ayịn anịm ke ikọd keed. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Ndin anye amaadakka asaña akaa nsan-nsan akesuuk atie, sia akikere amọ akedo, “Ami ndiikanna ntie nse naña ayịn mmi akpa.” Ndin ke anye akesʌkkọ atie do, anye amaatọọñọ adifok.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Abasi amaakop naña ayịn ado atua, ndin enyere Abasi amaato ke hefịn akoot Haka anyʌñ abo anye ate, “Haka nsoo ido? Kuunyeñ idem; Abasi a-akop naña ayịn ado atua ke itie a-anye anaaha do. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Mʌm ayịn ado ubọk dịppe ke anyọñ, sia ami ñyaanam anye ado ekamba idịd.”<verse eid="GEN 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Abasi amaatat anye anyen ndin anye amaakịt ube mmọọñ. Anye amaadakka akekoi mmọọñ ayọhọ ekpadikpa ado adinọ ayịn amọ nọ anwọñ.<verse eid="GEN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Abasi amaaba ye ayịn ado tutu anye akpon. Anye amaadʌñ ke akpautatan anyʌñ akappa atautob. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Ke ini anye akesʌkkọ adʌñ ke Akpautatan Paran, eka amọ amaadọ awonwaan Iyib anọ anye.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edioomo ke Beeseba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Ke ini ado, Abimelek ye Fikol adaiso ekọñ amọ emaebo Ebraham, “Abasi a-ada ye afo ke afịd ñkpọ se afo anam. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Ndin nwọñọ nnọ miin mi ke iso Abasi bo ke imọ idiinamma ñkpọ ye ami me ye nditọ mmi me ubon mmi ke abiaña. Ñwọt miin ye afịd idịd abio mmi a-afo adʌññọ nte asenawo mfọn, kpa naña ami nnam ye afo.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Ebraham amaabo, “Ami mmenwọñọ ntoro.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Akema Ebraham amaadọkkọ Abimelek abaña ube mmọọñ a-nditọufọk amọ ekebọọhọ anye ke ñkanubọk. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Ado Abimelek amaabo, “Ami ndiọọñọke awo a-anamma ñkpọ ami. Afo ukundọkkọke, mfịn ke ñnyʌñ ñkop.”<verse eid="GEN 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Ebraham amaaben udịmedọñ ye udịmenañ asọk Abimelek, ndin ammọ awo iba emaenam edioomo. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Ebraham amaasio abaak umanedọñ itiaba ke atu udịmedọñ anịm, <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />ndin Abimelek amaabịp Ebraham ate, “Nsoo ke abaak umanedọñ itiaba a-afo asioho asaña-asaña anịm mi awuọñọ?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Anye amaabọọrọ, “Mbọ miin abaak umanedọñ itiaba ami nte ntiense antooho miin ke ami ñkedọk ube mmọọñ ami.”<verse eid="GEN 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Ado anam ekekoot itie ado Beeseba,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beeseba akeme iwuọñọ udu ake itiaba ye udu ake unwọñọ</char></note> sia ideen iba ado emaenwọñọ unwọñọ do.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Ke emaekenam edioomo ema ke Beeseba, Abimelek ye Fikol adaiso ekọñ Abimelek, emaetịmme enyọñ ekaa isọñ mbon Filistia. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Ebraham amaatọ eto tamaris ke Beeseba, anyʌñ akoot anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Nsi-nsi Abasi ke ndo. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Ndin Ebraham amaadʌñ akpeene ke isọñ mbon Filistia ke anyan ini.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s1">Edomo Ebraham Idomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Akekaa koo, Abasi amaadomo Ebraham idomo. Abasi amaabo anye, “Ebraham!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:1">Anye amaabọọrọ “Se miin mi.”<verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Ndin Abasi amaabo, “Ben ayịn mfo, ukweeñe ayịn mfo Aisik, a-afo anekkeke ama kaa ke utịd ukañ Moria. Kaa kewa anye do nte ufọfọb uwa ke anyọñ abod a-ami nduuwọt fiin.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Ke usiere edemusen Ebraham amaadakka ada abeeñe dọñki amọ idem anịm. Anye amaakoot nditọufọk amọ iba ye ayịn amọ Aisik ate esaña ye imọ. Ke anye amaakekpịkke ifia nọ akem se ediinam ufọfọb uwa, anye amaatọọñọ isañ akaa itie A-Abasi akedọkkọke anye. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Akedo ke ayọhọ usen ita, Ebraham amaabenne anyen ase anyọñ ndin amaada akịt itie ado ke anyan usʌñ. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Ebraham amaabo nditọufọk amọ, “Itie mi ye dọñki yak ami ye ayịn mmi idọọk ikaa uko, no iyaikikpono Abasi ndin iyaitịmme ibịne ndufo.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Ebraham amaadịppe ifia ufọfọb uwa anọ ayịn amọ Aisik abiom; anye ke idem amọ amaanyʌñ akama ikañ ye ikwa. Ke ammọ ekesʌkkọ esaña keed ekaiya, <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Aisik amaasio uyio akoot ete amọ ate, “Ete!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Ebraham amaabọọrọ, “Ii, ayịn mmi, ado die?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Aisik amaabịp, “Ifia ye ikañ mmọ mi, ado ayịnedọñ uwa aba ke mmọọ?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Ebraham amaabọọrọ, “Ayịn mmi, Abasi ke idem amọ ayaanọ ayịnedọñ se ekama enam uwa.” Ndin ammọ emaekaa iso esaña keed ekaa.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Ke ammọ emaekedisịm itie A-Abasi akedọkkọke anye abaña, Ebraham amaabọp itie uwa do, anyʌñ aneeñe ifia abono. Anye amaamʌm ayịn amọ Aisik abọp ubọk ye ukod adot ke itie uwa, ke anyọñ ifia. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Ndin Ebraham amaanyanna ubọk aben ikwa adiwot ayịn amọ. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Ado enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatie ke anyọñ akoot anye ke akpọsọñ uyio ate, “Ebraham! Ebraham!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Se miin mi.”<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Anye amaabo, “Kuuyak ubọk mfo atuuk ayịn ado. Kuunam anye ñkpọ ndomokeed. Idahami ami mmediọọñọ ke afo amebaak Abasi, sia afo uñnyịmme miin ayịn mfo, ukweeñe ayịn mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Ebraham amaabenne anyen ase ndin anye amaakịt akukịmedọñ, a-nnʌk amọ akekọbọke ke mfuud ikọd. Ndin anye amaakaa akemʌm akukịmedọñ ado akama anam ufọfọb uwa utu ke ayịn amọ. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Ke ntoro Ebraham amaakoot itie ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Ayaanọ. Ndin tutu asịm mfịn ami esʌk ebo, “Eyaenọ ke Abod <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaamaana atie ke hefịn akoot Ebraham ayọhọ akañ iba <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />anyʌñ abo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo “ami mmenwọñọ ke anyịñ mmi, sia afo amenam ami, unyʌññọ uñnyịm miin ayịn mfo, ukweeñe ayịn mfo, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />ami ñyaudiọñ fiin, ñnyʌñ nnam ubon mfo awak nte ntantaafiọñ ke ikpaanyọñ ye nte ntan ke mben akpainyañ. Ubon mfo eyaedat abio mme asua ammọ enie, <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />ndin adiito ke ubon mfo ediọñ afịd idịd, sia afo amenam uyio mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Ndin Ebraham amaatịmme abịne nditọufọk amọ, enyʌñ ekesaña keed enyọñ Beeseba. Ndin Ebraham amaadʌñ ke Beeseba.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nditọ Ideen Nahọ</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Akema emaedọkkọ Ebraham ete, “Milka ñko ado eka nditọ; anye a-aman nditọ ideen anọ ayịneka mfo Nahọ:<verse eid="GEN 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Us ado akpan, ayịneka amọ awodeen ado Buus,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 22:21">Kemuel (ete Aram),<verse eid="GEN 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Kesed, Haso, Pildas, Yidaf ye Betuel.”<verse eid="GEN 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Betuel akedo ete Ribeka.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 22:23">Milka akeman nditọ ideen itiaita ami anọ Nahọ, ayịneka Ebraham.<verse eid="GEN 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Anwaan esa amọ a-akekereke Ruma amaanyʌñ aman nditọ ideen e-ekedooho:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 22:24">Teba, Kaham, Tahas ye Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Sera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Sera amaadu uwem asọñ ayọhọ isua ikie mme edịb mme itiaba. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Anye akekpa ke Kiriad Aaba (a-adooho Hibrọn) ke abio Kenan, ndin Ebraham amaakaa akefʌhọ anyʌñ atua abaña Sera.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Akema Ebraham amaadakka akpọñ akpo anwaan amọ aketañ ikọ ye mbon Hed,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ubom Hed; se ñko Yenesis 23:5, 10, 16, 18 ye 20</char></note> ate, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />“Ami ndo awo asenidịd ye asenawo ke atu ndufo. Inyam isọñ innọ nọ ñkama mbuuk mme akpañkpa mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Mbon Hed emaebọọrọ Ebraham, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Abọọñ awo, kpañ utọñ inọ ñnyịn. Afo ado akpọsọñ ayịn abọọñ ke atu ñnyịn. Buuk mme akpañkpa mfo ke uyaiya udi ñnyịn akeedodo a-afo amaaha. Awo ñnyịn ndomokeed iduukpanna fiin adibuuk mme akpañkpa mfo ke udi ñnyịn.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Ndin Ebraham amaadakka ada anyuuk iwuod ke iso mbon Hed. <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />Anye amaabo ammọ, “Adieke ndufo emaaha nọ ami mbuuk mme akpañkpa mmi, ikpañ utọñ innọ miin inyʌñ itañ ikọ ke iwuod mmi ye Efrọn ayịn Soha <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />nọ anye anyam abaitiad Makpela, a-anye anieghe a-anyʌññọ aba ke adaña inwañ amọ. Ibo anye anyam annọ miin ke ayọhọ udua a-adotto nte itie ubuuk awo ke atu ndufo.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Efrọn awo Hed mmọdo aketie ke atu mbon amọ, ndin anye amaabọọrọ Ebraham ke iso afịd mbon Hed e-eketieghe ke inuaatob abio ate, <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />“Iyoo abọọñ mmi. Kpañ utọñ nnọ miin; ami mmunọ fiin inwañ ado, mmenyʌñ unọ fiin abaitiad a-abaaha ke esịd. Ami unọ fiin ke iso mbon mmi. Buuk mme akpañkpa mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Ini keed mfen Ebraham amaanyuuk iwuod ke iso mbon abio <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />anyʌñ abo Efrọn ke iso ammọ ate, “Kop se ami ntañ, adieke afo anyịmmeke, ami ñyaakpe ekọmudua isọñ ado. Nyịmme nnọ miin nọ ado se ami ñkama mbuuk mme akpañkpa mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Efrọn amaabọọrọ Ebraham ate, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Kop se ntañ, abọọñ mmi; isọñ ado adot se ekpedep sekel silfa ikie inaañ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 4.6</char></note> ado akʌk ado idooho ñkpọ ndomokeed ke ufọọd mmi ye afo. Buuk mme akpañkpa mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Ebraham amaanyịmme se Efrọn akebo. Anye amaanyʌñ adomo ekọmudua se Efrọn akesiak ke iso mbon Hed anọ anye. Akedo Sekel silfa ikie inaañ, akeene udomo naña mme anyam udua ekesidomo ñkpọ idaha ntoro.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Ndin emaenọ Ebraham inwañ Efrọn, ye abaitiad a-akebaaha ke esịd, ye afịd eto e-ekebaaha ke adaña inwañ ado ke Makpela akekpereke Mamre. Emaeyaak afịd ado enọ <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />Ebraham nte inie amọ ke iso mbon Hed e-ekewuọhọ edi inuaatob abio. <verse eid="GEN 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Akema Ebraham amaabuuk Sera anwaan amọ ke abaitiad ke inwañ Makpela a-akpereke Mamre (a-abaaha ke Hibrọn) ke isọñ Kenan. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Ke ntoro, mbon Hed emaeyaak inwañ ado ye abaitiad ado enọ Ebraham nte itie ubuuk mme akpañkpa.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s1">Aisik ye Ribeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Idaha ntoro, Ebraham amaanekke asọñ, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadiọñ anye ke afịd usʌñ. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Ebraham amaabo ekamba ayịnufọk ke atu nditọufọk amọ, anye a-akekarake afịd se anye akenie, “Sịn ubọk mfo ke idak ifʌkkọ mmi. <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />Ami ñyem nọ afo anwọñọ ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-adooho Abasi anyọñ ye Abasi isọñ, ke afo uduukuyemme anwaan unọ ayịn mmi ke atu nditọ ibaan mbon Kenan, a-ami ndʌññọ ke atu ammọ, <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />ado ke ayaakaa abio mmi ke atu mbon ekpək mmi anyʌñ akeyem anwaan anọ Aisik ayịn mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Ayịnufọk amaabịp anye, “Akpedo awonwaan ado inyịmmeke iñkeene miin ndi abio ami-e? A-ado se ami mmaana mben ayịn mfo ñka abio a-afo aketooho adi?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Ebraham amaabo, “Kịt bo ke afo uduubenne ayịn mmi utịmme ukaa do.” <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi anyọñ, a-akensioho miin ke ufọk ete mmi ye ke atu mbon ekpək mmi ye anye a-aketañña ikọ ye ami a-anam unwọñọ abo, ‘Nditọ mfo ke ami ndiinọ isọñ ami,’ ayaadọñ enyere amọ ubem fiin iso akesịm nọ afo akịt anwaan anọ ayịn mmi ke udo. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Akpedo anam awonwaan ado imaaha ukeene fiin ndi umi, afo ayaabọkkọ unwọñọ mmi ami. Ado kuuben ayịn mmi ukaa udo.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Ndin ayịnufọk ado amaasịn ubọk ke ñkpatiañ ukod Ebraham eteufọk amọ anyʌñ anwọñọ unwọñọ anọ anye ke abaña ñkpọ ami.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Akema, ayịnufọk ado amaaben kamel eteufọk amọ duob adọñ nsio-nsio ñkpọ se eteufọk akenọọ anye adakka isañ. Anye amaakaa Aram Naharaim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Adoro usobutịn Mesopotemia</char></note> anyʌñ anam isañ akewuọ abio Nahọ. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Ke ndubiayio, idaha ibaan esikikoiyo mmọọñ ke ube, anye amaanam mme kamel ado etọọñọ edọñ ke ñkpere ube mmọọñ ke edem abio ado.<verse eid="GEN 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Ndin anye amaabọñ akam abo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi eteufọk mmi Ebraham, nam nnie mfọniso mfịn, nyʌñ wọt eteufọk mmi Ebraham mfọn. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Se ami ndaaha mi ke mben mmọọñ, ndin nditọ ibaan abio ami esʌk ewuọ edi edikoi mmọọñ. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Yak ado ke ami mmaabo abọikpa, ‘Mbọk biommo abañ mfo nnọ mmọọñ ñnwọñ,’ anye abo, ‘Nwọñ, nyʌñ yak nnọ mme kamel mfo mmọọñ ñko,’ yak anye ado anwaan a-afo amekke anọọ ayịnufọk mfo Aisik. Ukpunam ami ñyaadiọọñọ ke afo amefọn mfọn ye eteufọk mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Mbemiso anye abọñ akam ami ama, Ribeka amaadot abañ ke afara asaña adi. Anye akedo ayịn Betuel a-akedooho ayịn Milka, a-akedooho anwaan Nahọ ayịneka awodeen Ebraham. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Anye amaanekke ayaiya, idiọọñọke awodeen kpaanam; sia akenam awodeen ibaaha ye anye. Anye amaatịkke akaa mben mmọọñ, akekoi mmọọñ amaana adidọọk.<verse eid="GEN 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Ayịnufọk ado amaafeghe abịne anye akebo, “Mbọk tọkkọ etək mmọọñ ke abañ mfo nnọ ñnwọñ.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Anye amaabo, “Abọọñ mmi nwọñ,” anyʌñ asọp idem abiommo abañ akama ke ubọk anọ anye mmọọñ.<verse eid="GEN 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Anye amaakenọ anye mmọọñ ama, anye amaabo, “Ami ñyaakoi mmọọñ nnọ mme kamel mfo ñko, nọ ammọ enwọñ yak ayʌkkọ.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Ke ntoro anye amaasọsọp anwañña mmọọñ ke atu amọ adọñ ke akwa, atịmme afeghe akaa ube mmọọñ akekoi mmọọñ se ikem afịd mme kamel amọ. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Ayịnufọk Ebraham amaadop ada, ase anye usʌk-usʌk nọ adiọọñọ me <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-anam me inamma isañ imọ afọn.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Ke ini mme kamel emaekenwọñ mmọọñ ema, ete ado amaasio ñkpannuun kold e-esisịneke ke iwuo ake udob amọ akedooho beka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 5.7</char></note> keed ye ñkpaha ubọk kold iba ake udob amọ akedooho sekel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 115</char></note> duob. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Ndin anye amaabịp anye ate, “Afo ado ayịn anie? Mbọk ndọkkọ miin, ubeed aba ke ufọk ete mfo se ñnyịn ikpinaa akonayio ami?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami ndo ayịn Betuel, a-adooho ayịn Milka akemanna anọ Nahọ.” <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Anye amaadian do abo, “Ñnyịn iminie uwak ñnyanyaha ye ikịm se enọ ufene, dian ye ubeed se afo anaa akonayio ami.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Awodeen ado amaanyuuk iwuod anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ukpono, <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />anyʌñ abo, “Itooro anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi eteufọk mmi Ebraham, i-imiifreke mfọn ye akpanikọ amọ ye Ebraham eteufọk mmi. Amaado ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> andat miin usʌñ ke isañ mmi adiwuọ ufọk awo ekpək mme eteufọk mmi.” <verse eid="GEN 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Akema, abọikpa ado amaafeghe akedọkkọ mbon ufọk eka amọ mme ñkpọ ami. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Ndin Ribeka amaanie ayịneka awodeen a-akekereke Leban, ndin anye amaasọp awuọ abịne awo ado ke mben idịm. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Ke ini anye akekịtte ñkpannuun iwuo ye ñkpahaubọk ado ke ubọk ayịneka amọ, anyʌññọ akop se Ribeka akebo naña ete ado aketañ ye imọ, anye amaawuọ abịne ete ado anyʌñ akekịt anye naña ada akpere mme kamel ke ñkpere mben idịm. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Anye amaabo, “Di, afo <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> amaakediọñ. Ntaha afo adaaha do ntoro-o? Ami mmetʌm ufọk ye itie nnọ mme kamel mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Ke ntoro, ete ado amaakeene akaa ufọk, emaenyʌñ edooño mbiomo ke anyọñ kamel ebon. Emaeben ñnyanyaha ye ikịm esọk mme kamel, ndin emaenọ anye ye ideen e-ekesañake ye anye mmọọñ nọ eyie ukod. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Ndin emaenọ anye ndidia, ado anye amaabo, “Ami ndiidiaha ñkpọ tutu ami udọkkọ fiin se nnie aditañ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Leban amaabo, “Idọkkọ ñnyịn.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Anye amaabo, “Ami ndo ayịnufọk Ebraham. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-anekke adiọñ eteufọk mmi, ndin anye akappa ado imọawo. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-anọ anye mme edọñ ye enañ, silfa ye kold, nditọufọk ideen ye ibaan, mme kamel ye mme dọñki. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Sera anwaan eteufọk mmi amaaman ayịn awodeen anọ anye ke ayio usọñ amọ, ndin afịd se anye anie ayaak anọ ayịn ado. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Ndin eteufọk mmi amaanam ami ndat unwọñọ, amaanyʌñ abo, ‘Inaaha afo adọ anwaan ke atu ibaan Kenan anọ ayịn mmi, <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />ado kaa ke ekpək ete mmi ye ke ubon mmi, nyʌñ kedọ anwaan nọ ayịn mmi.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 24:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />“Ndin ami mmaabịp eteufọk mmi, ‘Awonwaan ado imiimaaha iñkeene miin ñnyọñ-ọ?’ ”<verse eid="GEN 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />“Anye amaabọọrọ, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-ami nsañake ke iso amọ ke ataa akpanikọ, ayaadọñ enyere amọ nọ asaña ye afo anyʌñ anam usʌñisañ mfo afọn, nọ ato do afo akan akịt anwaan anọ ayịn mmi ke ubon mmi ye ke ekpək ete mmi. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Afo ayaabọkkọ unwọñọ mmi adieke adooho afo akeka ubon mmi, ammọ esịn ediyaak awonwaan ado unọọ fiin.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />“Mfịn ami ñkediwuọ mben idịm, ami mmaabo, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi eteufọk mmi Ebraham, akpunem fiin esịd, mbọk nnọ miin mfọniso ke isañ a-ami ndiighe mi. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Se ami ndaaha mi ke mben idịm. Abọikpa ndomokeed akpedi adikoi mmọọñ ami ñyaabo anye, “mbọk nnọ miin etək mmọọñ ke abañ mfo nọ ñnwọñ,” <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />ndin anye akpembo miin, “Nwọñ, yak ñnyʌñ ñkoi nnọ mme kamel mfo,” yak anye ado anwaan <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> amekke anọ ayịn eteufọk mmi.’<verse eid="GEN 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />“Mbemiso ami mbọñ akam mma ke esịd mmi, Ribeka amaawuọ adi, adot abañ ke afara. Anye amaatịkke akaa usuuk idịm akekoi mmọọñ, ndin ami mmaabo anye, ‘Mbọk nnọ mmọọñ ñnwọñ.’<verse eid="GEN 24:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />“Usọp-usọp, anye amaabiommo abañ amọ anịm anyʌñ abo, ‘Nwọñ, ndin ñyaanyʌñ nnọ mme kamel mfo enwọñ.’ Ami mmaanwọñ ndin anye amaanyʌñ anọ mme kamel mmi mmọọñ.<verse eid="GEN 24:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />“Ami mmaabịp anye, ‘Afo ado ayịn anie?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:47">“Anye amaabọọrọ, ‘Ayịn Betuel a-adooho ayịn Nahọ, a-Milka akemanna anọ anye.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:47">“Ndin ami mmaasịn anye ñkpannuun iwuo ye ñkpahaubọk ke ubọk, <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />ñko ami mmaatuak iwuod ñkpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ami mmaakọọm <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi eteufọk mmi Ebraham, a-akendatta miin nọ nsaña nnen-nnen usʌñ ñkekịt ayeyịn ayịneka eteufọk mmi nte anwaan nnọ ayịn eteufọk mmi. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Idahami, adieke ndufo ediiwọt eteufọk mmi mfọn ye akpanikọ, indọkkọ miin; imiidooho ntoro, indọkkọ miin, nọ ami ndiọọñọ ubeñ nte nda.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Leban ye Betuel emaebo, “Anye ami ato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ñnyịn idiikanna itañ ñkpọ ndomokeed isịn ke se ñnyịn ikop ami. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Se Ribeka adaaha mmi; ben anye kaa, yak anye anyʌñ akedo anwaan ayịn eteufọk mfo, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akudat usʌñ.”<verse eid="GEN 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Ke ayịnufọk Ebraham akekoppo se ammọ eketañ, anye amaatuak iwuod ke isọñ anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Ayịnufọk ado amaasịññe mme ñkpọ mbanaidem e-enamma ke kold ye silfa, mme ñkpọ se esịne ke idem ayaak anọ Ribeka. Anye amaanyʌñ anọ eka ye ayịneka awodeen amọ mme nsọñudua enọ. <verse eid="GEN 24:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Ndin anye ye mbon se ikisaña ye anye emaetie edia ñkpọ, enyʌñ enwọñ ñkpọ, enyʌñ eba do tutu ayio asiere.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:54">Ammọ emaekedemme idab ubakusen, anye amaabo, “Nsio miin unyọñ nọ mbịne eteufọk mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Ado ayịneka Ribeka awodeen ye eka amọ emaebọọrọ ete, “Yak abọikpa ami atie etək ye ñnyịn ke ñkpọ nte usen duob; ndin ndufo emekeme adinyọñ.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Ado anye amaabo ammọ, “Ikimmʌm miin inịm, idaha <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakenam nọ ñkịt unen ke usʌñisañ mmi do. Insio miin unyọñ nọ ami ñka mbịne eteufọk mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Ammọ emaebo, yak ikoot idem abọikpa ikop ito anye se anye ayem enam. <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Ndin ammọ emaekoot Ribeka ebịp, “Afo ayaakeene ete ami anyọñ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami ñyaakeene.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Ke ntoro, ammọ emaeyaak Ribeka ayịneka awonwaan ammọ akeene, dian adeb amọ ye nditọufọk Ebraham ye ideen amọ. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Ndin ammọ emaediọñ Ribeka enyʌñ ebo anye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">“Ayịneka ñnyịn, afo ayaatọt</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">ke tọsịn ke tọsịn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">yak nditọ mfo edat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">mme abio mme asua ammọ enie.”<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Ndin Ribeka ye mme adeb amọ emaebeeñe idem edọọk kamel ekeene ete ado enyọñ. Ndin ayịnufọk Ebraham amaaben Ribeka anyọñ.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Idaha ini ntom, Aisik amaato Bee Lahai Rọi adi, sia anye akedʌñ ke Nekef. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Ndubiayio usen keed, Aisik amaawuọ akaa inwañ adikibọñ akam, ndin anye akedịppe iso, anye amaakịt nte mme kamel edi. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Ribeka ñko amaabenne anyen akịt Aisik, ndin anye amaatịkke ke kamel amọ <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />anyʌñ abịp ayịnufọk ado abo, “Anie awodeen ido ako ke inwañ a-asañake ibịne ñnyịn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Ayịnufọk amaabọọrọ, “Anye ado eteufọk mmi.” Ribeka amaaben afọñ ufʌkidem amọ afʌk idem amọ.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Akema ayịnufọk amaadọkkọ Aisik afịd se anye akenam. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Aisik amaaben Ribeka adʌk atayad eka amọ Sera, ndin Ribeka amaakappa ado anwaan amọ. Aisik amaanyʌñ ama anye, anyʌñ akop ndọñesịd ke ñkpa eka amọ.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Ebraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Ebraham amaadọ anwaan mfen; anyịñ amọ akedo Ketura. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Anye amaaman Sịmran, Yoksan, Medan, Midian, Isbak ye Sua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yoksan akedo ete Seba ye Dedan; mme ubon Dedan ekedo mme mbon Asurim, mbon Letus ye mbon Lumịm. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Nditọ ideen Midian ekedo Efa, Efe, Hanọk, Abida ye Elda. Afịd ubon ami ekedo ntịppe Ketura.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Ebraham amaayaak afịd inie amọ anọ Aisik. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Ado idaha a-anye akesʌkkọ ababa ke uwem, Ebraham amaanọ nditọ ideen ibaan esa amọ inie, ndin adiañña ammọ akpọñ Aisik ayịn amọ nọ ammọ eka edem usakkautịn.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Ebraham akesọñ isua ikie mme ata mme duob mme ition. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Ndin Ebraham amaaduọk akpatre ibifịk anyʌñ akpa ke usọñ, akaanadeen a-amaakedu uwem akpeene; ndin emaeben anye ekebuuk ye aduuk amọ. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Nditọ ideen amọ Aisik ye Ismeel emaebuuk anye ke abaitiad Makpela a-akpereke Mamre, ke inwañ Efrọn ayịn Soha awo Hed, <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />inwañ E-Ebraham akebọọhọ awo Hed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ubon Hed</char></note> adep. Do, ke ekebuuk Ebraham ye anwaan amọ, Sera. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Ke Ebraham amaakekpa, Abasi amaadiọñ ayịn amọ Aisik, a-akedʌññọ idaha ado akpere Bee Lahai Rọi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nditọ ideen Ismeel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Ami ado mbʌk emana ekpək Ismeel ayịn Ebraham, ake Haka awo Iyib, afʌn Sera, akemanna anọ Ebraham.<verse eid="GEN 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Anyịñ nditọ ideen Ismeel, e-ekewette ekeene naña ammọ ekemana edo ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 25:13" />
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 25:13">Nebaiyọd akedo akpan anọ Ismeel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 25:13">Keda, Adbeel, Mibsam,<verse eid="GEN 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Misma, Duma, Masa<verse eid="GEN 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadad, Tema, Yetọọ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 25:15">Nafis ye Kedema.<verse eid="GEN 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Mme mbon ami ekedo nditọ ideen Ismeel, ndin ami ado anyịñ mme adaukara abio duob mme iba akeene nte ammọ ekedʌñọ ye ke mme itie nnaa ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ismeel akedu uwem isua ikie mme edịb mme duob mme itiaba. Akema, anye amaanweek akpatre inweek amọ anyʌñ akpa, ndin emaebuuk anye ye mbon amọ. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Ubon amọ ekedʌñọ ke ubeñ ukañ a-aketọọñọke ke Hafila akesịm Sọọ, ñkpere edem usakkautịn a-anieghe adaña ye Iyib, ke ekaaha Asọọ. Ndin ammọ ekedʌñọ utọk-utọk ye afịd mbon ubon ewuanake ñkpọ ye ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yekọb ye Isọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Ami ado mbʌk emana ubon Aisik, ayịn Ebraham.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 25:19" />
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:19">Ebraham akedo ete Aisik, <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />ndin Aisik akedo isua aba idaha a-anye akedọọhọ Ribeka ayịn Betuel awo Aram a-aketooho Padan Aram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Adoro usobutịn Mesopotemia</char></note> ye ayịneka Leban awo Aram.<verse eid="GEN 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Aisik amaabọñ akam anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ntak anwaan amọ, sia anye ikimanna ayịn. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọọrọ akam amọ ndin anwaan amọ Ribeka amaayommo idịb. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Nditọ ado emaenwana ye emọ-emọ ke esịd idịb Ribeka, ndin anye amaabo, “Nsoo ido ntak a-ñkpọ ami atịppeke annọ miin?” Ndin anye amaadakka adikibịp <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo anye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">“Idịd iba udọñọ fiin ke idịb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">ndin ibon iba u-utooho fiin eyaebakka eda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">ibon keed eyaesọñ adudu ekan anye ako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">ndin andisọñ ñkan adiinam ñkpọ inọ andisịb ñkan.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Ini akekem anye adiman ayịn, amanamba nditọ ideen ekedọñọ anye ke idịb. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Akpa a-akewuọhọ adi akedo ndad-ndad, idem amọ akedo ided-ided nte afọñidem; ke ntoro emaesio anye Isọ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido Isọ awuọñọ ided-ided.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Akema udọ eka amaawuọ adi, ubọk amọ anyʌñ amʌm itịghitịghi akpaneka, Isọ; ke ntoro emaesio anye Yekọb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yekọb awuọñọ anye amʌm itighitighi, awuọñọke anye abiaña ke usem Hibru.</char></note>. Aisik akesọñ isua ata idaha Ribeka akemanna nditọ anọ anye.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Nditọ ideen ado emaekpoon, ndin Isọ amaakappa ata atautob ye awo inwañ, ke ini Yekọb akeyʌkkọke ke aditie ke ufọk ke mme atayad ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Aisik a-amaakesima unamikọd, amaama Isọ, ado Ribeka akema Yekọb.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Usen keed Yekọb akesʌk abọk abak, Isọ amaato inwañ anyọñ adi ye akpọsọñ abiọọñ. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Anye amaabo Yekọb, “Sọp idem nnọ miin etək ndad-ndad abak mfo nọ ndia! Abiọọñ a-anekke andọñ miin!” (Ntak ado akenam nọ ekekoot Isọ, Edọm<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edọm awuọñọ ndad-ndad.</char></note>.)<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yekọb amaabọọrọ, “To nyam itie akpan mfo nnọ miin.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Isọ amaabo, “Ami ñyaakpa abiọọn, nsoo ufọn ke itie akpan ado annọọ miin?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Ado Yekọb amaabo, “Nwọñọ nnọ miin diin.” Ke ntoro anye amaanwọñọ anọ anye, anyʌñ anyam itie akpan amọ anọ Yekọb.<verse eid="GEN 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Ndin Yekọb amaanọ Isọ uyo ye abak nsama. Anye amaata anyʌñ anwọñ, ndin adakka ada akpọñ ndo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:34">Ntom ke Isọ akesịn itie akpan amọ ke ndek.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s1">Aisik ye Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Idaha ntoro akañ amaaba ke isọñ, adian ye anye a-akebaaha ke ini Ebraham, ndin Aisik amaakaa abịne Abimelek adidem Filistia ke Kera. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayaara idem anọ Aisik anyʌñ abo, “Kuusọiyọ ukaa ke Iyib; dʌñ ke isọñ a-ami mbooho afo adʌñ. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Dʌñ ke isọñ ami ke ibio-ibio ini, ndin ami ñyaaba ye afo, ñyaanyʌñ udiọñ fiin. Sia ami ñyaunọ fiin ye afịd ubon mfo afịd isọñ ami, ñyaanyʌñ nsọọñọ enwọñọ añkenwọñọke nnọ ete mfo Ebraham. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Ñyaanyʌñ nnam ubon mfo awak nte ntantaafiọñ ke ikpaanyọñ, ñnyʌñ nnọ afịd ammọ isọñ ami. Ndin ayaato ke mfịdidịb mfo afịd mme idịd ke ederimbod ebọ adidiọñ, <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />sia Ebraham amaakop item annọ miin anyʌñ anam afịdñkpọ se ami ñkeyem anye anam, anịm mme ewʌhọ mmi, mme mbed ye mme item mmi.” <verse eid="GEN 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Ndin Aisik amaadʌñ ke Kera.<verse eid="GEN 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Ke ini ideen ke idʌñ ado ekebịppe anye ebaña anwaan amọ, anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Anye ado ayịneka mmi awonwaan,” sia ndịk amaanam anye adibo, “Anye ado anwaan mmi.” Anye amaakere abo, “Ideen idʌñ ado ekeme ediñwot miin ke iwuod Ribeka, sia anye a-ayaiyake.”<verse eid="GEN 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Ke ini Aisik amaakedʌñ do akpeene, Abimelek adidem Filistia amaasuuk anyen ke ubenafịm anyʌñ akịt Aisik naña abre mbre ima ye Ribeka. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Ndin Abimelek amaadọñ ekekoot Aisik anyʌñ abo anye ate, “Anye ado ataa anwaan mfo! Ntak afo akebooho, ‘Anye ado ayịneka mmi awonwaan-a?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Aisik amaabọọrọ anye ate, “Sia ami ñkekere ke mmekeme iduọọk uwem mmi ke iwuod amọ.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Ndin Abimelek amaabo, “Nsoo inam nọ afo anam ñkpọ ami ye ñnyịn? Keed ke atu ideen ami akpaakenaa ye anwaan mfo, ndin afo akpaakeben ubiomikpe idot ñnyịn ke iwuod.”<verse eid="GEN 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Ndin Abimelek amaanọ ewʌhọ asịm afịd awo: “Awo ndomokeed a-anamma ete ami me anwaan amọ idiọọk ana ewot anye.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Aisik amaatọ mme mfịd inwañ ke isọñ ado, ndin kpa isua ado anye amaadọk utịm ikie, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadiọñ anye. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Anye amaakappa amọinyọ, ndin inie amọ amaakaiso atọt tutu anye akappa ado ataa imoawo. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Anye amaanie ataa uwak udịmedọñ ye ufene ye nditọufọk e-ekenamma mbon Filistia efịbe ufịb ebaña anye. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Ndin mbon Filistia emaesiit afịd ube mmọọñ a-nditọufọk ete amọ eketịppeke ke ayio ete amọ Ebraham. <verse eid="GEN 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Akema Abimelek amaabo Aisik, “Dakka nyọñ diaña ikpọñ ñnyịn, sia afo amesọñ adudu ikan ñnyịn.”<verse eid="GEN 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Ndin Aisik amaadakka akpọñ itie ado, anyʌñ akaa akenam itie idʌñ ke Itịkke Kera, anyʌñ adʌñ do. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Aisik amaatịmme asịtte mme ube mmọọñ e-eketịppeke ke ini ete amọ Ebraham, a-mbon Filistia ekesiide ke Ebraham amaakekpa; anye amaanyʌñ anọ ukem-ukem anyịñ e-ete amọ akenọọhọ ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Nditọufọk Aisik emaetịppe isọñ ke itịkke ado enyʌñ ekịt ube a-akenieghe anyen mmọọñ a-afọnnọ. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Ado mme akpemeenañ ke Kera emaetịppe utọk ye nditọufọk Aisik enyʌñ ebo, “Mmọọñ ado ado ake ñnyịn!” Ndin Aisik amaanọ ube mmọọñ ado anyịñ, Esek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esek awuọñọ utọk.</char></note>, sia ammọ eketọhọketọhọ ye anye. <verse eid="GEN 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Akema ammọ emaemaana etịppe ube mmọọñ mfen, ado mbon ado emaetịmme etịppe utọk ebaña anye ado ñko; ndin anye amaasio anye ado anyịñ Sitna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sitna awuọñọ mfaaña.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Anye ndin amaadakka akpọñ itie ado aketịppe ube mfen, ndin awo ndomokeed ikitọhọke ibaña anye aba. Anye amaakoot ube anye ado Rehobod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rehobod awuọñọ ubeed</char></note>, ate “Idahami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> i-inọ ñnyịn ufañ, ndin ñnyịn iyaiseghe inyʌñ itọt ke isọñ anye ami.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Ndin anye amaakpọñ do adọọk akaa Beeseba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Ke akonayio ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabiọññọ anọ anye anyʌñ abo, “Ami ndo Abasi ete mfo Ebraham. Kuuyak ndịk unam fiin, sia ami mmọdo ye afo; ami ñyaudiọñ fiin ndin ñyaanam ubon mfo atọt ke ibad ke ntak ayịnufọk mmi Ebraham.”<verse eid="GEN 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Ndin Aisik amaabọp itie uwa do anyʌñ akoot anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Anye amaanyʌñ awuuk atayad amọ ke ndo; ke ndo ñko ke nditọufọk amọ eketịppe ube mmọọñ.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Idaha ntoro, Abimelek amaato ke Kera adi, asaña ye Ahusad akpan anọitem amọ ye Fikol a-akedooho adaiso ekọñ. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Aisik amaabịp ammọ ate, “Nsoo inam ndufo edi umi eñkeene miin, sia ndufo ekensuahasua miin enyʌñ embịne miin esio ke idʌñ ndufo.”<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Ñnyịn iminekke ikịt ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmọdo ye afo; anam ñnyịn ibo, ‘Akpena uta unwọñọ aba ke ufọọd ñnyịn,’ ke ufọọd ñnyịn ye afo. Yak ñnyịn ñko idʌk edioomo ye afo <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />ke afo uduunamma ñnyịn idiọọk, kpa naña ñnyịn imuukunamma fiin idiọọk, ado afịd ini inam afọn ye afo inyʌñ inam afo anyọñ ke ifuuro ye emem. Ndin idahami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> u-udiọñ fiin.”<verse eid="GEN 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Aisik amaanam usọrọ anọ ammọ, ndin ammọ emaedia enyʌñ enwọñ ñkpọ. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Usiere ubakusen edem usen ideen ado emaedat unwọñọ enọ idem ammọ. Akema Aisik amaaben ammọ akesuuk ke usʌñ, ndin ammọ emaenyọñọ ke ifuuro ye emem.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Kpa ke usen ado nditọufọk Aisik emaedi edidọkkọ anye ebaña ube mmọọñ a-ammọ eketịppeke ete, “Ñnyịn imikịt mmọọñ!” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Akema anye amaasio itie ado anyịñ Siba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siba akeme iwuọñọ unwọñọ me itiaba</char></note>, ndin anyịñ abio ado tutu usen mfịn ado Beeseba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beeseba akeme iwuọñọ udu ake unwọñọ ye udu ake itiaba</char></note><verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yekọb Abọ Adidiọñ A-akenaaha Anọ Isọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Ke Isọ amaakesịm isua aba, anye amaadọ Yudid ayịn Beeri a-aketooho Hed, ye Basemad ayịn Elọn a-aketooho kpa Hed. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Ammọ ekedo ntak mfʌhọ enọ Aisik ye Ribeka.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Ke ini Aisik amaakesọñ, anyen amọ anyʌñ ameem ndin anye ikikịtte ñkpọ aba, anye amaakoot Isọ akpan ammọ anyʌñ abo anye ate, “Ayịn mmi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">Ndin anye amaabọọrọ, “Se miin mi.”<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Aisik amaabo anye, “Ami mmekappa akaanadeen, ñnyʌññọ ndiọọñọ usen ñkpa mmi. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Ben ñkpọ utom mfo, utịgha ye idañ mfo, nyʌñ wuọ kaa esịd ikọd kewot unam ikọd nsọk miin. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Ndin di tem inem-inem ndidia se ami mma, nyʌñ ben nsọk miin nọ ami ndia ñnyʌñ unọ fiin adidiọñ mmi mbemiso ami ñkpa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Naña anye akesʌkkọ atañ ikọ ye Isọ, Ribeka akesʌk akpañ utọñ akop se Aisik aketañ. Isọ amaakedakka akaa ikọd aditop unam, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Ribeka amaabo ayịn amọ Yekọb ate, “Ami mmaakop naña ete mfo abo Isọ ayịneka mfo ate, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />‘Ben unam ikọd di nyʌñ dinam inem-inem ndidia nnọ ndia, nọ ami unọ fiin adidiọñ mmi ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mbemiso ami ñkpa.’ <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Idahami, ayịn mmi, nekke kpañ utọñ nyʌñ nam se ami utemme fiin: <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Kaa ke itie ufene nyʌñ dat mfọọn abaak ebod iba nsọk miin, nọ ami ntem inem-inem ndidia nnọ ete mfo, ke usʌñ se anye ama. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Ndin amaakem afo ayaaben asọk ete mfo adia, nọ anye unọ fiin adidiọñ amọ mbemiso anye akpa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Ndin Yekọb amaabo Ribeka eka amọ, “Ado ayịneka mmi Isọ ado ided-ided awo ke ini ami nnieghe ndọnọ-ndọnọ ikpaidem. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Nsoo iditịppe adieke ete mmi antuuhọ miin? Ami ñyaakappa ndo awo ñkara ke iso amọ, ndin mben isuuñọ nnọ idem mmi utu ke adidiọñ.” <verse eid="GEN 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Ndin eka amọ amaabo anye, “Ayịn mmi, yak isuuñọ ado andoro miin ke idem. Kap nam se ami udọkkọ; kaa ke koono mme ñkpọ ado nsọk miin.”<verse eid="GEN 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Ndin anye amaakaa akekoono mme ñkpọ ado asọk eka amọ, ndin Ribeka amaanyʌñ atem inem-inem ndidia ke usʌñ se ete amọ akema. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Ndin Ribeka amaakesio ataa nti afọñ Isọ akpan amọ a-anye akenieghe ke ufọk, asịn Yekọb, udọ amọ ke idem. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Anye amaanyʌñ aben ikpa ebod afʌk anye ke ubọk ye ke aboditọñ amọ. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Akema anye amaaben inem-inem ndidia ado ye uyo a-anye akenamma anọ ayịn amọ Yekọb.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Yekọb amaakaa abịne ete amọ anyʌñ akebo anye, “Ete mmi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Ndin anye amaabọọrọ “Ii, ayịn mmi. Anie ado ami?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yekọb amaabo ete amọ, “Ami ndo Isọ, akpan mfo. Ami mmaakenam naña afo akendọkkọ miin. Mbọk dakka tie-tie nyʌñ ta mme unam ikọd añketoppo, nọ afo annọ miin adidiọñ mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Ndin Aisik amaabịp ayịn ammọ ate, “Ayịn mmi, afo akenam die akịt unamikọd ataa usọp-usọp ntom?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo akennọọ miin mfọniso.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Ndin Aisik amaabo Yekọb, “Ayịn mmi, sịkke di ise yak ami utuuk fiin, nọ ndiọọñọ me afo ado ayịn mmi Isọ, me udooho.”<verse eid="GEN 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Yekọb amaasịkke akpere ete amọ Aisik, ndin ete amọ amaatuuk anye anyʌñ abo, “Uyio ado uyio Yekọb, ado ubọk ado ubọk Isọ.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Anye ikidiọọñọke anye, sia ubọk amọ ekedooho ided-ided nte ubọk ayịneka amọ Isọ; ndin anye amaakaa iso adidiọñ anye. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Ndin Aisik amaabịp, “Afo anekke ado ayịn mmi Isọ ke akpanikọ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Ndin Yekọb amaabọọrọ, “Ami ke ado.”<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Akema anye amaabo, “Ayịn mmi, dat mme unam ikọd mfo nsọk miin yak nta, nọ ami unọ fiin adidiọñ mmi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:25">Yekọb amaaben asọk anye, ndin anye amaata; amaanyʌñ aben ukọd anọ anye, anye anyʌñ anwọñ. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Akema ete amọ Aisik amaabo anye, “Di mi, ayịn mmi, nyʌñ ntʌm miin inua.”<verse eid="GEN 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Ndin Yekọb amaasaña akpere anye anyʌñ atʌm anye inua. Ke ini Aisik amaakekop ufịk afọñidem a-anye akesịneke, anye amaadiọñ anye ate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:27">“Sai, ufịk idem ayịn mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:27">aba nte ufịk ikọd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:27">ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakediọñ.<verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Yak Abasi unọ fiin mbara a-atooho hefịn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">ye inie ederimbod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">ataa uwak abakpa ye ufa ukọd.<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Yak mme idịd enam ñkpọ unọ fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">mbon awo enyʌñ etuak iwuod unọ fiin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Do abọọñ nọ nditọuka ideen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">ndin yak nditọ e-eka mfo amanna enyʌñ etuak iwuod unọ fiin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Eyaesuuñọ mbon u-usuuñọke fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">enyʌñ ediọñ mbon u-udiọññọ fiin.”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Ke ini Aisik amaakekweeñe adidiọñ anye, ndin ke imiikikpeeneke Yekọb akekpọñ iso ete amọ, ayịneka amọ Isọ amaanyọñ utob adi. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Anye ñko amaanyʌñ atem inem-inem ndidia aben asọk ete amọ. Ndin anye amaabo anye, “Ete mmi, mbọk dakka tie-tie nyʌñ ta mme unam ikọd añketoppo, nọ afo annọ miin adidiọñ mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Ete amọ Aisik amaabịp anye ate, “Afo ado anie?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami ndo ayịn mfo, akpan mfo, Isọ.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Idem amaanyeñ Aisik akpọsọñ-akpọsọñ, ndin anye amaabo, “Anie akedo andikitop unam ikọd iben insọk miin? Akedo ami nta mma ikpeenekekpeene afo anyọñ adi. Ami mmaadiọñ anye, ndin ke akpanikọ eyaediọñ anye!”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Ke ini Isọ akekoppo mme ikọ ete amọ, anye amaasio ñkpo atua ndod-ndod ayịd, anyʌñ abo ete amọ, “Ndiọñ miin, ndiọñ miin ñko, Ete mmi!”<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Ndin Aisik amaabo, “Ayịneka mfo amaasaña ke ñkara adibọ adidiọñ mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Isọ amaabo, “Nte awo ikoodo anye Yekọb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yekọb awuọñọ anye amʌm itighitighi, awuọñọke anye abiaña ke usem Hibru.</char></note>? Ayọhọ akañ iba ado ami a-anye abreke ñkara ye ami. Anye amambọ miin itie akpan; ndin idahami anye a-aben adidiọñ mmi!” Ndin anye amaabịp ete amọ ate, “Nte afo ukusʌhọke adidiọñ ndomokeed unnọ miin?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Aisik amaabọọrọ Isọ ate, “Ami mmenam anye ado andukara fiin ñnyʌñ nnam afịd nditọete amọ edo nditọufọk amọ, ndin ke mfọn ye ntadubọk ami mmenyʌñ nnọ anye ndidia ye ufa ukọd. Ndin nsoo mfen isʌhọ a-ami ñkpenamma unọọ fiin, ayịn mmi?”<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Isọ amaabo ete amọ, “Ete mmi, ado nte afo anie adidiọñ keed kpọd? Ete mmi, ndiọñ miin ñko!” Ndin Isọ amaadịppe uyio atua.<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Ete amọ Aisik amaabọọrọ anye ate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">“Itie idʌñ mfo adiiba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">nsan-nsan akpọñ inie isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">awuọ akpọñ mbara a-atooho hefịn ke anyọñ.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Afo uduudu uwem mfo ke akañkañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">ndin afo uduunam utom unọ ayịneka mfo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Ado ke ini afo umuuduunieghe emem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">afo ayaatop akpọnọ amọ adooro ke itọñ mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Isọ amaanie udu abaña Yekọb ke ntak adidiọñ e-ete amọ akediọññọ anye. Isọ amaabo idem amọ ate, “Mme usen ufʌhọ ikpo ete mmi akpere; ndin ami ñyaawot ayịneka mmi Yekọb.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Ke ini Ribeka amaakekop se akpan amọ Isọ aketañ, anye amaadọñ ekoot udọ amọ Yekọb anyʌñ abo anye, “Isọ ayịneka mfo asʌk aduak adusio usiene ke aduwot fiin. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Idahami ndin, ayịn mmi, nam se ami ntañ. Feghe ini keed kaa bịne ayịneka mmi Leban ke Haran. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Tie ye anye ke etək ini tutu iyadesịd ayịneka mfo asuuhọ. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Ke ini ayịneka mfo imiiyatta esịd aba ye afo anyʌñ afre se afo akenam anye, ami ñyaadọñ edudọkkọ fiin nọ afo anyọñ adi. Nsoo ikpido ntak nọ ndufo awo iba entak miin ke usen keed?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Akema Ribeka amaabo Aisik ate, “Uwem andooro miin ato ke ntak nditọ ibaan Hed ami. Adieke Yekọb adọọhọ anwaan ke atu mme ibaan idʌñ ami, ke atu ibaan Hed e-ebaaha ntom, uwem mmi idiibaha ufọn ndomokeed.”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Ndin Aisik amaakoot Yekọb adiọñ, anyʌñ anọ anye item ate, “Kuudọ awonwaan Kenan. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Kaa ini keed ke Padan Aram,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ke Adoro usobutịn Mesopotemia</char></note> ke ufọk ete eka mfo Betuel. Dat anwaan nọ idem mfo ke udo, ke atu nditọ ibaan Leban, ayịneka eka mfo. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Yak Abasi Andikponñkan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Abasi Andikponñkan ado El-Sadai</char></note> udiọñ fiin anyʌñ anam afo atọt anyʌñ awak ke ibad tutu afo akappa ado atutu awo. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Yak Abasi unọ fiin ye nditọ mfo adidiọñ e-ekenọọhọ Ebraham, nọ ato do afo adat isọñ a-afo adʌññọ ke esịd nte asenawo nte inie mfo, isọñ A-Abasi akenọọhọ Ebraham.” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Akema Aisik amaanam Yekọb adakka akaa isañ amọ, ndin anye amaanyʌñ akaa Padan Aram, akaa abịne Leban ayịn Betuel awo Aram, ayịneka Ribeka, a-akedooho eka Yekọb ye Isọ.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Isọ amaadidiọọñọ ke Aisik amaadiọñ Yekọb anyʌñ anam anye akaa Padan Aram nọ akedọ anwaan ke udo, ndin ke ini anye akediọññọ anye ama, anye amaanyʌñ anọ anye item ate, “Kuudọ awonwaan Kenan,” <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />ndin ke Yekọb amaakop item ete ye eka amọ anyʌñ adakka akaa Padan Aram. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Isọ ndin amaadidiọọñọ ke ibaan Kenan ikinemme ete amọ Aisik esịd; <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />ndin Isọ amaadika Ismeel anyʌñ akedọ Mahalad, ayịneka Nebaiyọd a-akedooho ayịn awonwaan Ismeel ayịn Ebraham, adian ke mme ibaan a-anye amaakenenie.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndab Yekọb ke Beteel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Ndin Yekọb amaakpọñ Beeseba akaa ke Haran. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Ke anye amaakewuọ itie keed, anye amaatre isañ anyʌñ anaa ke ndo ke akonayio, sia utịn amaasop. Anye amaanyʌñ aben itiad keed ke itie ado, asịn nte udodiwuod anyʌñ anaa ke ndo adaiya. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Ndin anye amaadappa ndab, anyʌñ akịt abeed naña ada ke isọñ, anyọñ abeed ado anyʌñ awuọ hefịn, ndin mme enyere Abasi ekesʌk edọdọọk, usʌk esọsọiyọ. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Ke anyọñ abeed ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaada, anyʌñ abo, “Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi ete mfo Ebraham ye Abasi Aisik. Ami ñyaunọ fiin ye nditọ mfo isọñ a-afo abaaha ke esịd. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Ubon mfo adiitie nte ntọñ ke isọñ, ndin afo ayaatara awuọ usobutịn ye ke usakkautịn, awuọ adoro-adoro ye usuuk-usuuk. Ndin afịd mme awo ke ederimbod eyaenie adidiọñ uto fiin ye nditọ mfo. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Ami mmọdo ye afo, ñyaanyʌñ ukpeme fiin ke afịd itie nte afo akaa, ñyaanyʌñ udat fiin ntịmme ndi ke itie isọñ ami. Ami nduukpọññọ fiin tutu ami nnam se ñnwọñọ unọọ fiin.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Ke ini Yekọb amaakedemme ke idab, anye amaakere ate, “Ke akpanikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmọdo ke itie ami, ndin ami ñkidiọọñọke mbaña.” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Ndịk amaanam anye ndin anye amaabo, “Itie ami anie ataa ndịk! Itie ami idooho itie mfen ikan ufọk Abasi; anye ami ado inuaatob hefịn.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Ke usiere edem usen Yekọb amaaben itiad a-anye akedatta nte udodiwuod awuuk nte adaaha, anyʌñ aduọk adan ke anyọñ itiad ado. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Anye amaasio itie ado anyịñ Beteel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beteel awuọñọ ufọk Abasi</char></note>, akpesʌkado abio ado a-anye akesikereke Luus.<verse eid="GEN 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Ndin Yekọb amaanam akaaña, ate, “Adieke Abasi adiiba ye ami inyʌñ iñkpeme miin ke usʌñ isañ a-ami ñkaaha mi, inyʌñ innọ miin ndidia ye afọñ se nsịne; adieke anye <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />anamma ami ntịmme ñnyọñ ufọk ete mmi ke ifuuro, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaado Abasi mmi, <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />ndin itiad a-ami ñwuuhọ mi nte adaaha ayaado ufọk Abasi, ndin ami ñyaanọ Abasi itie keed ke mbaak duob ke afịd se anye annọọ miin.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s1">Yekọb Adisịm Padan Aram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Akema Yekọb amaamaana atọọñọ isañ amọ anyʌñ adiwuọ isọñ usakkautịn. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Anye amaakịt ube mmọọñ ke mben abioinwañ, ndin udịmedọñ ita emaenaa ke mben mmọọñ ado, sia ekenọ ammọ mmọọñ ke ube ado. Itiad ekedatta ekʌp ke ube mmọọñ ado amaakpon. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Emaesitañ afịd udịmedọñ ebon itie keed, mme akpemeedọñ eyaekpat itiad esio ke inua ube mmọọñ enyʌñ enọ mme ufene mmọọñ enwọñ. Ndin emaema, ammọ eyaemaana eben itiad ekʌp ke inua ube mmọọñ ado.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yekọb amaabịp mme akpemeedọñ ate, “Nditọeka mmi, ndufo eto uke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Ñnyịn ito Haran.”<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Anye amaabo ammọ, “Emediọọñọ Leban, ayeyịn Nahọ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Ii, ñnyịn imidiọọñọ anye.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Akema Yekọb amaabịp ammọ, “Idem a-asọñ anye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Ammọ emaebo, “Ii, idem asọñ anye, ndin se Ratiel, ayịn amọ awonwaan, adiighe mi ye mme edọñ.”<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yekọb amaabo ammọ, “Se, utịn asʌk afofiop; ini ikemme se etañ udịmedọñ ebon itie keed. Nọ ammọ mmọọñ enwọñ nyʌñ tịmme ben ammọ kaa ke nọ mbid eta.”<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ ete, “Ñnyịn idiikanna inam ntoro, tutu emaebono afịd udịmedọñ ke itie keed enyʌñ ekpat itiad esio ke inua ube mmọọñ. Idaha ado ndin ke ñnyịn idiinọ mme edọñ mmọọñ.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Ke anye akesʌkkọ atatañ ikọ ye ammọ, Ratiel amaadi ye mme edọñ ete amọ, sia anye akedo akpemeedọñ. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Ke ini Yekọb akekịtte Ratiel ayịn ayịneka eka amọ Leban, ye mme edọñ Leban, anye amaawọññọ akaa akekpat itiad asio ke inua ube mmọọñ, anyʌñ anọ mme edọñ ayịneka eka amọ mmọọñ. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Ndin Yekọb amaatʌm Ratiel inua anyʌñ adịppe uyio atua ayịd. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Yekọb amaadọkkọ Ratiel ke imọ ido ayịn ayịneka ete amọ Ribeka. Ndin Ratiel amaafeghe akaa aketañ anọ ete amọ.<verse eid="GEN 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Leban akesʌk akokop etob abaña Yekọb, ayịn ayịneka amọ, anye amaasọsọp awuọ akesoobo ye anye. Leban amaafat Yekọb, atʌm anye inua, anyʌñ adat anye anyọñ ufọk amọ, ndin Yekọb amaatañ afịd mme ñkpọ ami anọ anye. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Ndin Leban amaabo anye, “Afo ado abʌk ye iyiib mmi.”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="GEN 29:14">Yekọb adọ Lia ye Ratiel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:14">Ke Yekọb amaakedʌñ ye anye ke ukpa afiọñ keed, <verse eid="GEN 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Leban amaabo Yekọb, “Sia adooho afo ado imaan mmi, ado ana nte afo anam utom annọ miin ke mfọn? Tañ se idiido utịb utom mfo nnọ miin.”<verse eid="GEN 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Ndin Leban amaanie nditọ ibaan iba; anyịñ adiaha akedo Lia, ndin anyịñ ñnwa akedo Ratiel. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Lia akenie mmeem-mmeem anyen, ado Ratiel akenie uyaiya idem anyʌñ ayaiya adise. <verse eid="GEN 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Yekọb amaama Ratiel anyʌñ abo, “ñyaanam utom unọ fiin ke isua itiaba ke iwuod etək abọikpa mfo Ratiel.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Leban amaabo Yekọb, “A-anekke afọn ami adiben anye unọọ fiin utu ke mben anye nnọ awodeen mfen. Dʌñ mi ye ami.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Ndin Yekọb amaanam utom ke isua itiaba nọ ato do anye adọ Ratiel, ado anye akekịt mme isua ado nte ibad-ibad usen ke ntak ima a-anye akenieghe anọ Ratiel.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Akema Yekọb amaabo Leban, “Nnọ anwaan mmi. Ini mmi ayọhọ akem, sia mmeyem adinam ima ye anye.”<verse eid="GEN 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Ndin Leban amaakoot afịd mbon abio abon anyʌñ anam usọrọ. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Ado ke ndubiayio amaakedisịm, anye amaaben ayịn amọ Lia asọk Yekọb, ndin Yekọb amaanam ima ye anye. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Leban amaanyʌñ aben ayịnufọk amọ Silpa anọ ayịn amọ Lia nte ayịnufọk.<verse eid="GEN 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Ayio akesiere, se Lia mi! Ndin Yekọb amaabo Leban, “Nsoo ñkpọ ke afo annam miin ntom? Ami ñkenam utom unọ fiin ke iwuod Ratiel, ikidooho ntoro? Nsoo ido ntak a-afo akembiañake miin?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Leban amaabọọrọ anye ate, “Idooho ido ñnyịn mi adinọ ñnwa ndọ mbemiso adiaha. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Kweeñe ñkpọndọ ayịn awonwaan ami udua anyem; amaakem ñnyịn iyaunọ ñnwa ikọrọ, ke aditịmme nnam utom ke isua itiaba mfen.” <verse eid="GEN 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Ndin Yekọb amaanam ado. Anye amaakweeñe udua anye ado ye Lia, ndin Leban amaanọ anye ayịn amọ Ratiel nte anwaan amọ. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Leban amaanyʌñ aben ayịnufọk amọ Bilha anọ ayịn amọ Ratiel nte ayịnufọk. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Yekọb amaanam ima ye Ratiel ñko, ado ima a-anye akenieghe anọ Ratiel amaakpon akan ima a-anye akenieghe anọ Lia. Ndin anye amaanam utom anọ Leban ke isua itiaba mfen.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nditọ Yekọb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akekịtte ke ima ikibaaha inọ Lia, anye amaanọ anye ukeme adiyommo idịb, ado Ratiel ikiinieghe ayịn. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Lia amaayommo idịb anyʌñ aman ayịn awodeen. Anye amaasio anye anyịñ Rubịn,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru, Rubịn atie nte awuọ anye a-akịt ukuud mmi</char></note> ndin anye amaabo, “Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakịt ukuud mmi. Ke akpanikọ ebe mmi ayamma miin idahami.”<verse eid="GEN 29:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Anye amaamaana ayommo idịb, ndin ke ini anye amanna ayịn awodeen anye amaabo, “Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakop ke awo immaaha miin, anye annọ miin anye ami ñko.” Ndin anye amaasio anye anyịñ Simiọn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Simiọn awuọñọ andikob</char></note>.<verse eid="GEN 29:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Anye amaatịmme ayommo idịb, ndin ke ini anye amanna ayịn awodeen anye amaabo, “Idahami ebe mmi ayaanekke adiana ye ami, sia mmeman nditọ ideen ita nnọ anye.” Ndin emaesio anye anyịñ Lifai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lifai atie nte ado a-ayịreke</char></note><verse eid="GEN 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Anye amaatịmme ayommo idịb, ndin ke ini anye akemanna ayịn awodeen anye amaabo, “Ini anye ami ami ñyaatooro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.” Ndin anye amaasio anye anyịñ Yuda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yuda atie nte a-anyʌñ akeme adiwuọ itooro ke usem Hibru.</char></note> Ndin anye amaatre uman nditọ.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Ke ini Ratiel akekịtte ke imọ imanna ayịn inọ Yekọb, anye amaafịbe ufịb ye ayịneka amọ. Ndin anye amaabo Yekọb, “Nnọ miin nditọ imiidooho ami ñyaakpa!”<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Yekọb amaayat esịd ye anye anyʌñ abo, “Nte ami ndo Abasi, a-anamma nọ afo umuumanna nditọ?”<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Akema Ratiel amaabo, “Se Bilha mi, ayịnufọk mmi. Naa ye anye nọ anye aman nditọ annọ miin nọ ami ñko ñnyʌñ ntọọñọ ubon nto anye.”<verse eid="GEN 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Ndin anye amaaben ayịnufọk amọ Bilha anọ Yekọb nte anwaan. Yekọb amaanaa ye anye, <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />ndin Bilha amaayommo idịb anyʌñ aman ayịn awodeen anọ Yekọb. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Akema Ratiel amaabo, “Abasi amaakpe ikpe mmi; amaanyʌñ akop ebeeñe mmi anyʌñ annọ miin ayịn awodeen.” Ke ntak ami anye amaasio anye anyịñ Daan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daan awuọ anye atoppo</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Bilha ayịnufọk Ratiel amaatịmme ayommo idịb anyʌñ aman ayọhọ ayịn awodeen iba anọ Yekọb. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Akema Ratiel amaabo, “Ami mmenwana akpọsọñ anwan ye ayịneka mmi, ndin mmenwana ñkan.” Ndin anye amaasio anye anyịñ Naftali.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naftali awuọñọ anwan mmi</char></note><verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Ke ini Lia akekịtte ke imọ imaitre uman nditọ, anye amaanyʌñ aben ayịnufọk amọ Silpa anọ Yekọb nte anwaan. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Silpa ayịnufọk Lia amaanyʌñ aman ayịn awodeen anọ Yekọb. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Akema Lia amaabo, “Nsoo utọ ekamba mfọniso!” Ndin anye anọ anye anyịñ Kad.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kad akeme adiwuọñọ mfọniso me udịmekọñ</char></note><verse eid="GEN 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Silpa ayịnufọk Lia amaaman ayọhọ ayịn awodeen iba anọ Yekọb. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Akema Lia amaabo, “Esịd annem miin die ntom! Ibaan eyaeñkoot miin inemesịd.” Ndin anye amaasio ayịn anyịñ Asaa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asaa awuọñọ daara</char></note><verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Akema ke ini idọk, Rubịn amaawuọ akaa inwañ anyʌñ akekịt mme eto mandrek a-adooho ibọk ima, a-anye akebenne asọk eka amọ Lia. Ratiel amaabo Lia, “Mbọk nnọ miin ubaak eto mandrek ayịn mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Ado Lia amaabo anye, “Ado nte ikuyʌkkọke fiin adikimbọọ miin ebe? Nte afo ayambọ eto mandrek ayịn mmi ñko?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Ratiel amaabo anye, “A-afọn, Yekọb akeme adina ye afo akonayio mfịn ke mandrek ayịn mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Ndin Yekọb akenyọñ inwañ adi ndubiayio ado, Lia amaawuọ abịne anye, anyʌñ akedọkkọ Yekọb ate, “Ana afo ana ye ami. Ami mmudat fiin utom ke ntak mandrek, ibọk ima ayịn mmi.” Ndin anye amaanaa ye anye ke akonayio ado.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Abasi amaakpañ utọñ anọ Lia, ndin anye amaayommo anyʌñ aman ayọhọ ayịn awodeen ition anọ Yekọb. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Akema Lia amaabo, “Abasi annọ miin utịb, sia ami mmaben ayịnufọk mmi nnọ ebe mmi.” Ndin anye amaasio anye anyịñ Isaka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isaka awuọñọ utịb</char></note><verse eid="GEN 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Lia amaamaana ayommo idịb anyʌñ aman ayọhọ ayịn awodeen itiokeed anọ Yekọb. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Akema Lia amaabo, “Abasi ayaak nsọñudua enọ annọ miin. Idahami ebe mmi ayañkama miin ke ukpono, sia ami mmeman nditọ ideen itiokeed nnọ anye.” Ndin anye amaasio anye anyịñ Sebulọn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sebulọn awuọñọ ukpono</char></note><verse eid="GEN 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Akemaana anye amaaman ayịn awonwaan keed anyʌñ asio anye anyịñ Daina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Akema Abasi amaatoiyo Ratiel, akpañ utọñ anọ anye anyʌñ anam anye adʌk idịb. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Ndin anye amaayommo anyʌñ aman ayịn awodeen anyʌñ abo, “Abasi aben asuenne mmi afep.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Ndin anye amaasio anye anyịñ Yosef,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yosef awuọñọ yak anye adian</char></note> anyʌñ abo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpekap adian ayịn awodeen mfen annọ.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udịmedọñ Yekọb Atọt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Ke Ratiel amaakeman Yosef, Yekọb amaabo Leban, “Nsio miin unyọñ ndin nọ ntịmme ñnyọñ isọñidʌñ mmi. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Nnọ miin ibaan ye nditọ mmi, ke utom a-ami ñkenamma unọọ, ndin ami ñyaanyọñ. Afo amediọọñọ ibad utom añkenamma unọọ fiin.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Ndin Leban amaabo anye, “Adieke adooho ami mmekịt mfọn ke iso mfo, mbọk suuk tie. Ami mmekịt ke ñkukịd ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> andiọñ miin ke ntak mfo.” <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Anye amaadian, “Siak ekọmudua mfo, ke ami ñyaukpe.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yekọb amaabo anye, “Afo amediọọñọ naña ami ñkenam utom unọ fiin ye naña ufene mfo akeba ke idak ukpeme mmi. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Etək se afo akenie mbemiso ami ndi amaaditọt anekke awak, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaudiọñ fiin ke mme itie akeedodo a-ami ñkebaaha. Ado idahami, ini akee ke ami ndiinam ñkpọ nnọ ufọk mmi?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Ndin Leban amaabịp, “Nsoo ke ana nte ami unọ fiin?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Yekọb amaabọọrọ anye, “Kunnọọ ñkpọ ndomokeed, ado adieke adooho afo ayaanam ñkpọ keed ami annọ miin, ñyaakaa iso mbọọk mme udịmedọñ mfo, ñnyʌñ ñkpeme ammọ: <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Yak ami nsaña ke atu udịmedọñ mfo mfịn ami ñnyʌñ nsịññe afịd edọñ se inie ñkem me ntọi ke idem, afịd mbubịd nditọ edọñ ye afịd ebod ye ntọi me ñkem ke idem. Ammọ ediido utịb utom mmi. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Ndin akpanikọ mmi ayaado ntiense annọ miin ke ayioiso, ini keed akeedodo a-afo adiighe adise utịb a-afo akeñkpeeghe miin. Ebod akeedodo a-annieghe miin i-imiinieghe ñkem me ntọi, me ñyịn edọñ akeedodo i-imiinieghe abubịd ñkem, yak edat nte ekeyeeyịp.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Leban amaabo anye, “Ami mmenyịmme, yak ado naña afo atañ.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Kpa ukem usen ado anye amaasịññe afịd akpoebod se ikinie ñkem me ntọi ke idem ye afịd uman ebod se ikinie ñkem me ntọi ke idem (afịd se ikinie mfia ke idem) ye afịd nditọ edọñ se idoñño mbubịd, ndin abon ammọ anọ nditọ amọ nọ ese anyen. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Ndin anye amaanam isañ usen ita ke ufọọd amọ ye Yekọb, ke ini Yekọb akaaha iso abọọk nsʌhọ ufene Leban.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Akema, Yekọb amaaben nsek ñkọk eto pọpla, eto mmansañ mbakara ye ñkaña eto anam mfia udʌk ato ammọ ke adiyaara ñkpa edem ñnyʌñ nsioño mfia esịd ñkọk eto ado. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Ndin anye amaadọñ mme nsiib ado ke udiọhọ mmọọñ, nọ ana nnen-nnen ke iso mme ufene ke ini ammọ ediighe edinwọñ mmọọñ. Ke ini mme ufene eyemme ayaara ndin enyʌñ edi adinwọñ mmọọñ, <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />mme ufene emaeyịre enyʌñ eyommo ke iso mme ñkọk eto ado. Ndin ammọ emaeman nditọ e-ekenieñeke ntọi me nduud me e-ekedọọñọke ñkem ke idem. <verse eid="GEN 30:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Yekọb amaasịññe nditọ ufene ami abon ke idem ammọ, ado ayaak mbon ako esaña nnen-nnen ebịne mbon e-enieñeke ñkem ye abubịd idem e-ekedoññoke ake Leban. Ke ntom anye amaabakka ufene anọ idem amọ anyʌñ atre isịn ammọ ke atu mme ufene Leban. <verse eid="GEN 30:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Ini akeedodo a-mme asọñ idem uman eyemme ayaara, Yekọb ayaaben mme ñkọk eto adot ke usịnudia a-anaaha ke iso mme ufene nọ ato do ammọ eyịre enyʌñ eyommo ke ñkpere mme ñkọk eto ado, <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />ado adieke mme ufene edooho mbon se idem amem, anye idiinịmme ammọ ke itie ado. Ke ntoro mme unam se idem amem ekenie Leban ke ini mbon se isọñ idem ekenieghe Yekọb. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Ke usʌñ ami Yekọb amaakaa iso anekke aforo anyʌñ anie uwak ufene, nditọufọk ibaan ye ideen, ye mme kamel ye dọñki.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s1">Yekọb Afeghe Akpọñ Leban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Yekọb amaakop ke nditọ ideen Leban ekebo, “Yekọb akoono afịd ñkpọ se ete ñnyịn akenie anyʌñ anie inie ato ñkpọ se ete ñnyịn akenie.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Yekọb amaanyʌñ akịt ke iso Leban ikinekkeke aba ye imọ nte naña akesiba.<verse eid="GEN 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yekọb, “Tịmme nyọñ kaa isọñ mme ete mfo ye ufọk emana mfo, ami ñyaaba ye afo.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Ndin Yekọb amaadọñ ekekoot Ratiel ye Lia ate ammọ ewuọñọ edi esịd inwañ ke itie u-ufene amọ ekebaaha. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Anye amaabo ammọ, “Ami mmekịt ke iso ete ndufo inekkeke ye ami aba nte ini akpa, ado Abasi ete mmi mmọdo ye ami. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Ndufo emediọọñọ ke mmaanam utom nnọ ete ndufo ke afịd adudu mmi, <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />ado ete ndufo antʌk miin ke anye adikpəho akʌk utom mmi akañ duob. Kpayeado, Abasi iyakka anye annam miin ibak. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Adieke anye akebooho ate, ‘Mme anie ntọi ufene eyaedo utịb mfo,’ afịd ufene emaeman nditọ ye ntọi; ndin adieke anye akebooho ate, ‘Mme anie ñkem ufene eyaedo utịb mfo,’ afịd ufene emaeman nditọ ye ñkem. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Ndin Abasi amaaben afịd ufene ete ndufo akappa annọ miin.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />“Ke ini mme ufene ekeyommoke idịb ami mmaadappa ndab akañ keed, ndin ke ndab ado ami mmaabenne anyen ke anyọñ ñnyʌñ ñkịt ke mme akpoebod e-ekewereke udịm, eweere ñkem ye mme anie ntọi ekedọọk mme ufene. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Akema enyere Abasi amandọkkọ miin ke ndab abo, ‘Yekọb.’ Ami mmaabọọrọ, ‘Se miin mi.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Ndin anye amaabo, ‘Dịppe anyen mfo se ke afịd akpoebod se idọọk mme ufene edoñño mme awere udịm, ñkem ye ntọi, sia ami mmaakịt afịd se Leban akenam ye afo. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Ami ndo Abasi Beteel, itie a-afo akeyette adaaha adan anyʌñ anam akaaña annọ miin. Idahami kpọñ itie ami inikeed nyʌñ tịmme nyọñ isọñ emana mfo.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Akema Ratiel ye Lia emaebọọrọ anye ete, “Nte ñnyịn isʌk inie udeeme ke udeemeñkpọ a-atooho ufọk ete ñnyịn? <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Nte anye idatta ñnyịn nte mme adidʌñ? Idooho ke adinyam ñnyịn ikpọọñ, ado anye amaadia afịd se ekekpe anye ke iwuod ñnyịn. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Ke ataa akpanikọ, afịd inie se Abasi asio akpọñ ubọk ete ñnyịn ado ñnyịn inie ye nditọ ñnyịn. Ke ntoro nam se adodo A-Abasi abooho afo anam.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Akema Yekọb amaatañ nditọ ye ibaan amọ adoot ke mme kamel, <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />ndin anye amaanyʌñ asịññe afịd mme ufene asịn ke iso, diana ye afịd inie se anye akenie ke Padan Aram,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Adoro usobutịn Mesopotemia</char></note> anyọñ abịne ete amọ Aisik ke isọñ Kenan.<verse eid="GEN 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Ke ini Leban amaakekaa adifat mme ufene ided, Ratiel amaayịp mme abasi ufọk ete amọ. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Mfen-mfen, Yekọb amaabiaña Leban awo Aram ke anye adikitre aditañ nnọọ anye ke imọ iyaifeghe inyọñ. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Ndin anye amaafeghe ye afịd se anye akenie, akaaña inyañ Yufretis, akọñ iso ase idịd abod Kilied.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Leban Abịne Yekọb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Ke ayọhọ usen ita, emaekedọkkọ Leban ke Yekọb amaafeghe. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Anye amaadat nditọete amọ adian idem, anyʌñ abịne Yekọb ke usen itiaba tutu akesịme anye ke idịd abod Kilied. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Akema, Abasi amaabo Leban awo Aram akonayio ke ndab ate, “Tịm kpeme, kuutañ ikọ ndomokeed ye Yekọb, adooho eti me idiọọk.”<verse eid="GEN 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Yekọb amaawuuk atayad amọ ke abod-abod idʌñ Kilied ke ini Leban akebọhọke anye akaa iso, ndin Leban ye nditọete amọ emaebono ke ndo ñko. <verse eid="GEN 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Akema Leban amaabo Yekọb, “Nsoo inam afo anam ntom? Afo amembiaña miin, anyʌñ akoono nditọ ibaan mmi anyọñ nte mbon e-emʌmmọ ke ekọñ. <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Nsoo ido ntak afo akefegheke anyọñ ke ndịbe anyʌñ ambiaña miin? Nsoo inam afo undọkkọke miin, nọ ami ñkpusio fiin unyọñ ke idaara ye ikwọ ñkeene mbiiñe mme ibịdubọk ye mme ndidoudʌk? <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Afo ukuyakka ami ntʌm nditọ ayeyịn mmi ye nditọ ibaan mmi inua ñnyʌñ mbo ammọ esañasʌñ. Afo amenam ndisịme ñkpọ. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Ami mmenie adudu adunọmọ fiin; ado akonayio ñkpọñ a-akeboiyoke Abasi ete mfo amambo miin ate, ‘Tʌm kpeme, kuutañ ikọ ndomokeed ye Yekọb, adooho eti me idiọọk.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Idahami afo amenyọñ sia itọñ aditịmme ñnyọñ ufọk ete mfo amaudọñ fiin ke anyan ini. Ado nsoo ido nọ afo ayịp mme abasi mmi?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yekọb amaabọọrọ Leban abo, “Ndịk akennam miin, sia ñkekere ke afo amekeme adimbọi nditọ ibaan mfo ke adudu. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Ado adieke afo akịtte awo ndomokeed a-akebenne mme abasi mfo, utọ awo ado idiiduuho uwem. Ke iso nditọete ñnyịn, se ke idem mfo me aba ñkpọ a-adooho ake mfo a-abaaha ye ami. Adieke adooho ntoro, dat anye.” Idaha ntoro Yekọb ikidiọọñọke ke Ratiel amaayịp mme abasi Leban.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Ndin Leban amaadʌk akaa atayad Yekọb ye atayad Lia ye atayad nditọufọk ibaan ammọ, ado anye ikikịtte ñkpọ ndomokeed. Ke anye amaakewuọ ke atayad Lia, anye amaadʌk atayad Ratiel. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Ado Ratiel amaaben mme abasi ufọk ete amọ asịn ke edem kamel anyʌñ adọọk atie. Leban amaayeem afịd ñkpọ ke atayad, ado ikikịtte mme abasi ufọk amọ.<verse eid="GEN 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Ndin Ratiel amaabo ete amọ, “Abọọñ mmi, kuuyat esịd ubo ke ami ñkanna ndakka nda ke iso mfo, sia ami mba ke itieisọñ.” Ndin anye amaayem ado ikiikịte mme abasi ufọk amo.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Yekọb amaayat esịd anyʌñ atọhọ ye Leban. Ndin anye amaabịp Leban. “Nsoo ido idiọọkñkpọ mmi? Die ke ami udue fiin a-anamma afo ambịne miin ikañ-ikañ ntom? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Idahami, a-afo amaakeyeem afịd ñkpọ mmi, nsoo ke afo akịt a-adooho ñkpọ ufọk mfo? Nịm anye mi ke iso mbon mfo ye ake mmi, nyʌñ yak ammọ ekpe ikpe inọ ñnyịn awo iba.<verse eid="GEN 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />“Ami mmedʌñ ye afo ke isua edịb idahami. Edọñ mfo ye ebod mfo ibʌññọke idịb akpa, ñko kpaanam ami ntaaha mme akukịmedọñ e-etooho udịmedọñ mfo. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Ami ñkidatta mme unam se ndiọi unamikọd ewai usọk fiin; mmaayọ ntakudua ado ke idem mmi ikpọọñ. Ndin afo amaasinam nọ ami ukpe fiin ekọmudua ke se ekeyịp ke uweemeayio me ke akonayio. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Ami akedo se ikiñwọọñọ miin: Ufiob amamfọp miin ke uweemeayio, ye atueb ke akonayio, idab anyʌñ afeghe akpọñ anyen mmi. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Akeba ntom ke isua edịb a-ami ñkebaaha ke ufọk mfo. Ami mmaanam utom unọ fiin ke isua duob mme inaañ ke nditọ ibaan mfo iba ye isua itiokeed ke ufene mfo, ndin afo amaakpəho akʌk utom mmi akañ duob. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Adieke Abasi ete mmi, Abasi Ebraham ye Mbaak Aisik, imiikpikibaaha ye ami, ke akpanikọ afo akpaakensio miin unyọñ ñkaña ubọk. Ado Abasi amaakịt nsịnifịk mmi ye akpọsọñ utom mmi, ndin akonayio ñkpọñ anye amaasua unọ fiin ke adinam mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Leban amaabọọrọ Yekọb ate, “Ibaan ami edoñño nditọ ibaan mmi, nditọ ami edoñño nditọ mmi, udịmedọñ ami edoñño udịmedọñ mmi. Afịd se afo akịt ami edoñño ake mmi. Ndin nsoo ke ami ñkeme adinam mfịn mbaña nditọ ibaan mmi, me nditọ a-ammọ emanna? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Di idahami, yak ñnyịn inam edioomo, afo ye ami, ndin yak ami atie nte ntiense ke ufọọd ñnyịn.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Ndin Yekọb amaaben itiad awuuk nte adaaha. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Yekọb amaadọkkọ nditọete amọ ate, “Ikoono mme itiad ibok.” Ndin ammọ emaekoono itiad ekọọk ke eboho, emaenyʌñ edia ñkpọ ke mben eboho itiad ado. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Leban amaakoot itie ado Yeka Sahaduta,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeka Sahaduta ye Kaleed ke usem Hibru awuọñọ abod ntiense.</char></note> ndin Yekọb amaanyʌñ akoot anye Kaleed.<verse eid="GEN 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Leban amaabo ate, “Eboho itiad ami ado ntiense ke ufọọd mfo ye ami mfịn ami.” Ami ado ntak e-ekoodo anye Kaleed. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Ekenyʌñ ekoot anye Mispa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mispa awuọñọ itieukpeme</char></note> sia anye akebooho, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpekap ukpeme fiin ye ami ke ini ñnyịn idukpọññọke idem ñnyịn. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Adieke afo adiọọhọ ido ye nditọ mmi ibaan me adieke afo adọọhọ ibaan mfen akọrọ ye nditọ mmi ibaan, akpesʌkado awo ndomokeed imiibaaha ye ñnyịn, toiyo bo ke Abasi ado ntiense ke ufọọd ami ye afo.”<verse eid="GEN 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Leban amaanyʌñ abo Yekọb, “Se eboho ami, tịmme se adaaha a-ami ñkewuuhọ ke ufọọd mmi ye afo. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Eboho ami ado ntiense, adaaha ami anyʌñ ado ntiense, ke ami ndiibọhọke eboho ami ndi ukañ mfo ndunam fiin idiọọk, ndin ke afo uduubọhọke eboho ami ye adaaha ami udi ukañ mmi udunnam miin idiọọk. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Abasi Ebraham ye Abasi Nahọ, Abasi ete ammọ, ayaakpe ikpe ke ufọọd ñnyịn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 31:53">Ndin Yekọb amaata unwọñọ ke anyịñ Mbaak ete amọ Aisik.<verse eid="GEN 31:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Yekọb amaawa uwa ke abod abio, amaanyʌñ akoot nditọ ete amọ edi ndidia. Ke ammọ emaekedia ñkpọ ema, ammọ emaedaiya ke akonayio ke itie ado.<verse eid="GEN 31:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Ke usiere ubakusen Leban amaatʌm nditọ ayeyịn amọ inua ye nditọ ibaan amọ anyʌñ adiọñ ammọ. Akema anye amaakpọñ do atịmme anyọñ idʌñ amọ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed ake mbon Hibru Yenesis 31:55 ewet nte Yenesis 32:1</char></note><verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s1">Yekọb Abeeñe Idem Adisoobo ye Isọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">32:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed ake mbon Hibru Yenesis 32:1-32 ewet nte Yenesis 32:2-33</char>
    </note>Akema Yekọb amaakaa uwa amọ, ndin mme enyere Abasi emaesoobo ye anye. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Ke ini Yekọb akekịtte ammọ, anye amaabo, “Ami ado itie mbono Abasi!” Ndin anye amaanọ itie ado anyịñ Mahanaim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mahanaim awuọñọ ikpeghe iba</char></note><verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Yekọb amaasio mme isʌñutom ebem anye iso ekekịt ayịneka amọ Isọ ke isọñ Sei, ke idịd Edọm. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Anye amaanọ ammọ item ate, “Ami ado se ana nte ndufo edọkkọ abọọñ mmi Isọ: ‘Awo mfo Yekọb abo ate, ami ñkedʌñ ye Leban mmenyʌñ ntie ke udo ñkpeene tutu idahami. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Mmenie mme enañ, mme dọñki, mme edọñ ye mme ebod, ñkọrọ nditọufọk ideen ye ibaan. Idahami ndọñ utom ami nnọ abọọñ mmi, nọ ñkịt mfọn ke iso mfo.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Ke ini mme isʌñutom eketịmmeke ebịne Yekọb, ammọ emaebo, “Ñnyịn imaikaa ikikịt ayịneka mfo Isọ ndin idahami anye asʌk adi adusoobo fiin, ndin ideen ikie inaañ esaña ye anye.”<verse eid="GEN 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Ke ataa ekamba ndịk ye nnananyen Yekọb amaabakka mme awo se ikiba ye anye ke ikpeghe iba, ye udịmedọñ ye ebod ye udịmenañ ye kamel ke ukem usʌñ ado. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Anye akekere abo, “Adieke Isọ adiighe adinwana ikpeghe keed, ikpeghe andisʌhọ akeme adibọkkọ.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Akema Yekọb amaabọñ akam abo, “O Abasi ete mmi Ebraham, Abasi ete mmi Aisik, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, afo a-akembooho miin ate, ‘Tịmme nyọñ abio mfo ye ufọk emana mfo, ndin ami ñyaanam afo aforo,’ <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />ami ndotto adibọ ukeed mfọn a-afo añwọttọ miin ayịnufọk mfo. Esañ mmi kpọd ke ñkekama idaha a-ami ñkekaañake Yọdan ami, ado idahami ami mmekappa ndo atu mboho iba. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Ami mmubeeñe, ñnyaaña miin sio ke ubọk ayịneka mmi Isọ, sia ndịk annam miin ke anye ayaadi adinnọmọ miin, akọrọ ye mme eka ye nditọ ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Ado afo amebo ate, ‘Ke akpanikọ ami ñyaanam afo anekke aforo, ñnyʌñ nnam ubon mfo atie nte ntan ke mben akpainyañ, a-awo imiikanna adibat.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Yekọb amaadaiya ke akonayio ado ke itie ado, ndin ke atu mme ñkpọ se anye akenie anye amaasio enọ anịm anọ ayịneka amọ Isọ: <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />Ebod ikie iba ye akpoebod edịb, umanedọñ ikie iba ye akukịmedọñ edịb, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />uman kamel edịb mme duob ye mme ñyịn ammọ, umanenañ aba ye ñyaaraenañ duob, ye uman dọñki edịb ye ñyaara dọñki duob. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Ndin anye amaayaak ammọ asịn nditọufọk amọ ke ubọk, udịmedọñ keedekeed ke idem amọ, anyʌñ adọkkọ nditọufọk amọ abo, “Imbem miin iso ikaa, inyʌñ inịm ufañ ke ufọọd mme udịmenañ.”<verse eid="GEN 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Anye amaatemme andikiboiyo iso ate, “Ke ini ayịneka mmi Isọ amaadusịme fiin anyʌñ ubịp, ‘Anie awo inie ndufo, ndufo enyʌñ ekaiya uke, anie anyʌñ anie afịd mme ufene ami ke iso ndufo?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Afo ayaabọọrọ ate, ‘Ado Yekọb awo mfo anie ammọ. Ammọ edoñño mme enọ e-enọọhọ esọk abọọñ mmi Isọ, ndin anye asʌk adi ke edem ñnyịn.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Anye amaanyʌñ atemme ayọhọ awo iba, ayọhọ ita ye afịd se ikikeene mme udịmenañ: “Ana ndufo etañ ukem ikọ ami enọ Isọ ke ini esooboke ye anye. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Inyʌñ ikịt ke emetañ ebo, ‘Awo mfo Yekọb asʌk adi ke edem ñnyịn.’ ” Sia anye akekereke abo, “Ami ñyaanam anye anekke iso ye ami ke mme enọ a-ami nnọọhọ nọ ambem miin iso; amaakem, ke ini ami mmaakịt anye, akemeido anye ayandaara miin.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Ndin mme enọ Yekọb emaeboiyo iso, ado anye ke idem amọ amaanaa adaiya ke akonayio ado ke itie nnaa.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yekọb Anwana ye Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Ke akonayio ado Yekọb amaadakka ada anyʌñ adat naña ibaan amọ iba, nditọufọk amọ ibaan iba ye nditọ ideen amọ duob mme keed anyʌñ akaaña idịm Yabọk. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Ke anye amaakenam ammọ ekaaña idịm ado, anye amaanọ afịd inie amọ eboiyo. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Ke ntoro Yekọb akeba ikpọọñ, ndin awodeen keed amaanwana ye anye tutu ayio asiere. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Ke ini awo ami akekịtte ke imọ ikanna anye ubọk, anye amaatuak akpọ akikoi Yekọb ndin akpọ ifʌkkọ amọ amaafekke ke ini anye akenwanake ye awo ado. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Akema awo ado amaabo, “Nsaana miin yaak nọ ñnyọñ, sia ayio asiere.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Ado Yekọb amaabọọrọ anye ate, “Ami nduuyaaha fiin tutu afo andiọñ miin.”<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Awo ado amaabịp anye ate, “Afo akere die?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Yekọb.”<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Akema awo ado amaabo, “Anyịñ mfo idiidooho aba Yekọb, ado Isrel,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atie nte Isrel awuọñọ anye anwana ye Abasi</char></note> sia afo amenwana ye Abasi ye mme awo ndin amenyʌñ akan.”<verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Yekọb amaabo anye, “Mbọk ndọkkọ miin anyịñ mfo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Ado anye amaabọọrọ, “Nsoo ido ntak a-afo ambịppe miin anyịñ mmi?” Akema anye amaadiọñ anye ke itie ado.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Ndin Yekọb amaanọ itie ado anyịñ Peniel,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peniel awuọñọ iso Abasi</char></note> abo, “Sia ami mmaakịt Abasi iso ye iso, ado esaana uwem mmi eyaak.”<verse eid="GEN 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Utịn amaasakka ke ini anye akeboiyoke Peniel,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk ekoot Penuel, asʌkkọ ado ukem ye Peniel.</char></note> ndien anye akekpọkpọi ke ntak akikoi amọ. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Ke ntom tutu usen mfịn ami nditọ Isrel itaaha asịb unam a-adianake ke akpọ akikoi ifʌkkọ, sia emaenọmọ asịb a-akpereke akpọ akikoi Yekọb.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s1">Yekọb Asoobo ye Isọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Yekọb amaadịppe anyen ase ndin se Isọ koo, asʌk adi ye ideen ikie inaañ; ndin Yekọb amaabakka nditọ amọ anọ Lia, Ratiel ye nditọufọk ibaan amọ iba. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Anye amaasio nditọufọk ibaan ye nditọ ammọ asịn ke iso, Lia ye nditọ amọ ekeene, ndin Ratiel ye Yosef esaña ke edem. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Anye ke idem amọ amaaboiyo iso akaa anyʌñ akenyuuk iwuod ke isọñ akañ itiaba ke anye amaakedisịm ayịneka amọ.<verse eid="GEN 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Ado Isọ amaafeghe akaa akesoobo ye Yekọb, anyʌñ afat anye, adịppe ubọk awañ anye ke itọñ, anyʌñ atʌm anye inua. Ammọ emaenyʌñ etuaha. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Ke Isọ amaakedịppe anyen akịt mme ibaan ye nditọ, anye amaabịp abo “Mme anie ido ami ye afo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yekọb amaabọọrọ ate, “Ammọ edo nditọ A-Abasi akenọọhọ ayịnufọk mfo ke mfọn.”<verse eid="GEN 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Akema nditọufọk ibaan ye nditọ ammọ emaesaña ekpere enyʌñ enyuuk iwuod. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Ndin Lia ye nditọ amọ emaenyʌñ edinyuuk iwuod. Ke akpatre Yosef ye Ratiel ñko emaenyʌñ edinyuuk iwuod.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Isọ amaabịp ate, “Afịd udịmedọñ ye udịmenañ añkịtte mi awuọñọ soo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Ndin anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Ado adiyem mfọn uto fiin, abọọñ mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Ado Isọ amaabo, “Ayịneka mmi, ami mmenenie uwak. Nịm se afo anie nọ idem mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Ado Yekọb amaabo, “Iyoo, mbọk!” “Adieke iso mfo anenne ye ami, bọ enọ ami nto miin. Sia adikịt iso mfo atie nte adikịt iso Abasi, sia unemme fiin adindaara miin mfọn-mfọn. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Mbọk bọ enọ ekebenne usọk fiin, sia Abasi annọ miin mfọn adinie afịd se ñyem.” Sia Yekọb amaakeyịre, Isọ amaabọ.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Akema Isọ amaabo, “Yak ñnyịn inyọñọ; ami ñyaasaña ye afo.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Ado Yekọb amaabo anye, “Abọọñ mmi adiọọñọ ke nditọ edoñño nsek-nsek, ndin ke ana nte ami nse mme umanedọñ ye mme umanenañ esʌkkọ enọ ammọ eba anyen. Adieke ebịneke ammọ akpọsọñ-akpọsọñ ke usen keed, afịd mme unam ami eyaekpañña. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Ndin yak abọọñ mmi ambem miin ayịnufọk amọ iso akaa, ke ini ami nsañake usʌk-usʌk ke naña udịmedọñ ye udịmenañ e-ebaaha ye ami esaña, ñko ye naña ntəkayịn esaña, tutu ami ndisịme abọọñ mmi ke Sei.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Isọ amaabo, “Ndin yak ami ñkpọñ usʌk ideen mmi nọ esaña ye afo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Yekọb amaabịp anye ate, “Ntak a-afo anamma ntoro-o? Kap yak ami ñkịt mfọn ke iso mfo, abọọñ mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Kpa ke usen ado Isọ amaatọọñọ isañ anyʌñ atịmme anyọñ Sei. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Ado Yekọb, ke ukañ amọ, akekaa Sukọd,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sukọd awuọñọ adịp</char></note> itie a-anye akekebọppọ ufọk anọ idem amọ anyʌñ anam itie nnaa anọ mme ufene amọ. Ami ado ntak e-ekoodo itie ado Sukọd.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Yekọb amaakewuọ akpọñ Padan Aram,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Adoro usobutịn Mesopotemia</char></note> ke ifuuro anye amaadisịm abio Sekem ke Kenan, anyʌñ anam itiennaa ke nsakiso abio. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Anye amaadep isọñ a-anye akebọppọ atayad amọ ke ekpad akʌk silfa ikie ato nditọ ideen Hamọọ, ete Sekem. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Ke itie ado ke anye akebọp itieukpono anyʌñ akoot ndo El Elohe Isrel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">El Elohe akeme ido El ado Abasi Isrel; akeme inyʌñ ndo andikpon ado Abasi Isrel.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s1">Daina ye Mbon Sekem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Ndin Daina, ayịn awonwaan a-Lia akemanna anọ Yekọb, amaawuọ akaa adikise ibaan ke idʌñ ado. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Ke ini Sekem ayịn Hamọọ awo Hif, adaukara abio ado akekịtte anye, anye amaamʌm anye anaa ke ñkanubọk. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Esịd Sekem amaadiana ye Daina ayịn Yekọb; anye amaama abọikpa ami anyʌñ atañ ikọ ima-ima ye anye. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Ndin Sekem amaabo ete amọ Hamọọ ate, “Dọ ayịn awonwaan ami nnọ miin.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Ke ini Yekọb akekoppo ke emaesappa ayịn amọ Daina, nditọ ideen amọ ekeba ke ikọd ye mme ufene amọ; ndin anye ikinamma ñkpọ ibaña tutu ammọ enyọñ edi ufọk.<verse eid="GEN 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Akema Hamọọ ete Sekem amaawuọ akaa aditañ ikọ ye Yekọb.<verse eid="GEN 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Ke nditọ ideen Yekọb emaekekop se ikitịppe, ammọ emaeto ikọd enyọñ edi. Idem amaakpa ammọ, ammọ emaenyʌñ eyat esịd ufiob-ufiob, sia Sekem amaanam ataa akpatre mbubiam ñkpọ ke Isrel ke anye adina ye ayịn awonwaan Yekọb, ñkpọ i-imiikpinaaha enam.<verse eid="GEN 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Ado Hamọọ amaabo ammọ, “Esịd ayịn mmi Sekem a-ama ayịn ndufo. Mbọk inọ anye nte anwaan amọ. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Iwuaha ke ndọ ye ñnyịn; inọ ñnyịn nditọ ibaan ndufo, inyʌñ idat nditọ ibaan ñnyịn inọ idem ndufo. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Ndufo emekeme edidʌñ ke atu ñnyịn; isọñ anyʌñ ana inọ ndufo. Idʌñọ do, inyam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Awuọñọke esaña naña emama; se ñko ke Yenesis 34:21</char></note> udua do, inyʌñ ikọ inie do.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Akema Sekem amaabo Yekọb, ete Daina ye nditọeka amọ ideen, “Yak ñkịt mfọn ke iso ndufo, ndin ami ñyainọ ndufo se ekpeyeyem. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Inam udua ñkpọ ndọ ye mme enọ a-anaaha nte ami nnọ nọ awak anyʌñ akpon naña ndufo ema, ami ñyaanyʌñ ñkpe se ndufo ekpeyeyem. Ado ikap innọ miin abọikpa ami nte anwaan mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Sia emaekesappa ayịneka ammọ Daina, nditọ ideen Yekọb emaebọọrọ ke abiaña naña ammọ eketañ ikọ ye Sekem ye ete amọ Hamọọ. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Ammọ emaebo ammọ ete, “Ñnyịn idiikanna inam utọ ñkpọ ado; ñnyịn idiiyaaha ayịneka ñnyịn awonwaan inọ awo i-imiifọọrọke edʌd ke ndọ. Ado adiido ñkpọ asuenne inọ ñnyịn. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Ana nte ñnyịn idʌk edioomo ye ndufo ke ñkpọ keed ikpọọñ: Ana nte ndufo ekappa etie nte ñnyịn ke adifọọrọ afịd ideen ndufo edʌd. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Ndin ñnyịn iyainọ ndufo nditọ ibaan ñnyịn inyʌñ idat nditọ ibaan ndufo inọ idem ñnyịn ke ndọ. Ñnyịn iyaidʌñ ye ndufo inyʌñ ido aduuk keed ye ndufo. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Ado adieke ndufo imiinyịmmeke adifọọrọ edʌd, ñnyịn iyaiben ayịneka ñnyịn inyọñ.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Se ammọ ekeduak amaafọn ke utọñ Hamọọ ye ayịn amọ Sekem. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Ndin akparawa ami, a-akedooho andinie ukpono ñkan ke ufọk ete amọ, ikibiatta ini adinam se ammọ eketañ, sia anye amaadat esịd ke ayịn awonwaan Yekọb. <verse eid="GEN 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Ndin Hamọọ ye ayịn amọ Sekem emaekaa ke inuaatob isọñ abio ammọ eketañ ikọ enọ ideen isọñabio ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />Ndin ammọ emaebo ete, “Ideen ami edu ufan-ufan ye ñnyịn. Yak ammọ edʌñọ ke isọñ ñnyịn enyʌñ enyam udua; isọñ a-akpon, anyʌñ anie ekamba ufañ anọ ammọ. Ñnyịn imikeme edidọ nditọ ibaan ammọ, ammọ ñko ekeme edidọ ake ñnyịn. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Ideen ami eyaenyịmme adidʌñ ye ñnyịn nte aduuk keed, ado ñkpọ keed ado ke ana afịd ideen ñnyịn efọọrọ edʌd, kpa naña ammọ enam. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Nte ufene ammọ, mme inie ye mme unam ammọ mfen idiidooho ake ñnyịn? Ndin yak ñnyịn inyịmme ye ammọ, nọ ato do ammọ edʌñ ye ñnyịn.”<verse eid="GEN 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Afịd ideen se ikiwuọ ika inuaatob abio emaenyịmme ye Hamọọ ye ayịn amọ Sekem, ndin afịd ideen ke abio emaefọọrọ edʌd.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Ayọhọ usen ita, ke ini afịd ammọ ekesʌkkọ eba ke ubiak ufọọrọ edʌd, nditọ ideen Yekọb iba, Simiọn ye Lifai, nditọeka Daina, emaeben mme akañkañ ammọ edʌk abio ado, enyʌñ ewoot afịd ideen ke ini awo imiikinieghe mbeeñe idem, ikpeññekpeñ idem.<verse eid="GEN 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Ammọ emaekịm Hamọọ ye ayịn amọ Sekem ke akañkañ ewot, enyʌñ eben Daina esio ke ufọk Sekem edat enyọñ. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Nditọ ideen Yekọb emaedʌk ke ufọk mme akpañkpa enyʌñ etañ mbịme ke abio e-ekesappake ayịneka ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Ammọ emaetañ mme ufene ye mme ebod ye mme dọñki ye afịd ñkpọ mfen a-akenieghe mbon ado ke abio enyʌñ ewuọñọ ekaa ke mme inwañ. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Ammọ emaekoono afịd inie ammọ ye afịd ibaan ammọ ye nditọ esịññe, enyʌñ ekoono afịd ñkpọ ke mme ufọk nte mbịme.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Akema Yekọb amaabo Simiọn ye Lifai ate, “Ndufo emeben mfịna ensọk miin ke adinam ami ndo ñkpọndọk ke atu mbon Kenan ye mbon Peris, mbon e-edʌñọke ke isọñ ami. Ñnyịn iwakka ke ibad, ndin adieke ammọ edianake keed enwana ye ami, eyaensobo miin ye ufọk mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Ndin ammọ emaebọọrọ anye ete, “Nte akena anye anam ye ayịneka ñnyịn awonwaan nte anam ye akpara?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s1">Yekọb Atịmme Akaa Beteel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Akema Abasi amaabo Yekọb, “Dọọk kaa Beteel nyʌñ kedʌñ do, nyʌñ bọp itieukpono do nọ Abasi, a-akeyaarake idem unọọ fiin ke ini afo akefegheke abọkkọ ayịneka mfo Isọ.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Ndin Yekọb amaabo mbon ufọk amọ ye afịd mbon se ikiba ye anye, “Isịññe mme isen abasi ifep ke atu ndufo, inyʌñ inam idem ndufo asana inyʌñ ikpuuño afọñidem ndufo. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Ndin idi, yak ñnyịn idọọk ika Beteel, ke itie a-ami ñyemme ibọp itieukpono nnọọ Abasi, a-akembọọrọke miin ke ini ami ñkebaaha ke nnananyen, a-akenyʌññọ aba ye ami ke afịd itie se ami ñkekaa.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Ndin ammọ emaeyaak afịd isen abasi a-ammọ ekenieghe ye mme ñkpannuun utọñ a-ammọ ekesịneke enọ Yekọb, ndin Yekọb amaabuuk ammọ ke idak eto afriyo ke Sekem. <verse eid="GEN 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Akema Yekọb ye ubon amọ emaedakka isañ, ndin ndịk Abasi amaamʌm afịd abio e-ekekannake ammọ ekʌk, ndin awo ndomokeed ikibịneke ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Yekọb ye afịd mbon se ikiba ye anye emaediwuọ Luus (a-adooho Beteel) ke isọñ Kenan. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Ke ndo ke anye akebọp itieukpono, anyʌñ akoot itie ado El Beteel,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">El Beteel awuọñọ Abasi Beteel</char></note> sia akedo ke itie ado ke Abasi akeyaara idem anọ anye ke ini anye akefegheke abọkkọ ayịneka amọ.<verse eid="GEN 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Ndin Debọra, adeb Ribeka, amaakpa emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ke idak eto afriyo a-awuọhọ akpọñ Beteel. Ndin ekekoot itie ado Alon Bakud.<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Yekọb akenyọñ ato Padan Aram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Adoro usobutịn Mesopotemia; se ñko ke Yenesis 35:26</char></note> adi, Abasi amaatịmme ayaara idem awọt anye anyʌñ adiọñ anye. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Abasi amaabo anye, “Anyịñ mfo ado Yekọb,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yekọb awuọñọ amʌm itịghitịghi ke usem Hibru ado anye abiaña.</char></note> ado afo uduukereke aba Yekọb; anyịñ mfo adiido Isrel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido Isrel awuọñọ anye anwana ye Abasi</char></note>” Ndin anye amaanọ anye anyịñ, Isrel.<verse eid="GEN 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Ndin Abasi amaabo anye ate, “Ami ndo Abasi Andikponñkan;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Abasi Andikponñkan ado El-Sadai</char></note> nwịm mfịd nyʌñ tọt ke ibad. Idịd keed ye abio ke atu mme idịd eyaewuọ uto fiin, ndidem eyaenyʌñ ewuọñọ ke ubon mfo. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Isọñ a-ami ñkenọọhọ Ebraham ye Aisik mmenyʌñ unọ fiin, ami ñyaanyʌñ nnọ ubon mfo u-ukeeneke fiin.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Akema Abasi amaadakka akpọñ anye ke itie a-anye aketañña ikọ ye anye.<verse eid="GEN 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Yekọb amaawuuk adaaha itiad ke itie A-Abasi aketañña ikọ ye anye, anye amaanyʌñ aduọk uwa ukọd ke itiad ado, anyʌñ aduọk adan akọrọ. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Yekọb amaakoot itie A-Abasi aketañña ikọ ye anye Beteel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beteel awuọñọ ufọk Abasi</char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Ratiel ye Aisik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Akema ammọ emaedakka ekpọñ Beteel. Ke ini ammọ ekesañake ekpere Efrad, uman amaatuuk Ratiel ndin anye amaakop akpọsọñ ubiak. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Ndin naña anye akenieghe akpọsọñ mfịna ke uman ayịn, abiauman amaabo anye, “Kuukop ndịk, sia afo amenie ayịn awodeen mfen.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Ke ini anye akenweeghe akpatre sia anye amaakpere ñkpa, anye amaasio ayịn amọ anyịñ Ben-Oni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ben-Oni awuọñọ ayịn mfịna mmi</char></note> Ado ete amọ akesio anye Benyamin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Benyamin awuọñọ ayịn awodeen ubọk nnasia mmi</char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Ndin Ratiel amaakpa emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ke usʌñ e-ekaaha Efrad (ado ado, Betlehem). <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Ndin ke anyọñ udi amọ Yekọb amaawuuk adaaha, ndin tutu mfịn ami adaaha ado asʌk awọwọt udi Ratiel.<verse eid="GEN 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Isrel amaamaana atọọñọ isañ anyʌñ akewuuk atayad amọ ke emaebọhọ Mikdal Eda. <verse eid="GEN 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Ke ini Isrel akesʌkkọ adʌñ ke isọñ ado, Rubịn amaakaa akena ye anwaan esa ete amọ a-akekereke Bilha, ndin Isrel amaakop se anye akenam.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 35:22" />
  <para style="lh" vid="GEN 35:22">Yekọb akenie nditọ ideen duob mme iba:<verse eid="GEN 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Nditọ ideen Lia:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:23">Rubịn akpan Yekọb,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:23">Simiọn, Lifai, Yuda, Isaka ye Sebulọn.<verse eid="GEN 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Nditọ ideen Ratiel:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:24">Yosef ye Benyamin.<verse eid="GEN 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Nditọ ideen ayịnufọk Ratiel Bilha:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:25">Daan ye Naftali.<verse eid="GEN 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Nditọ ideen ayịnufọk Lia Silpa:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:26">Kad ye Asaa</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 35:26" />
  <para style="lf" vid="GEN 35:26">Mbon ami ekedo nditọ ideen Yekọb, e-ekemanna enọ anye ke Padan Aram.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Yekọb amaanyʌñ adiwuọ ufọk ete amọ ke Mamre, a-akpereke Kiriad Aaba (a-adooho Hibrọn), itie E-Ebraham ye Aisik ekedʌñọke. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Aisik akedu uwem isua ikie keed mme anaañ. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Akema Aisik amaanweek akpatre ibifịk anyʌñ akpa, ndin amaanyọñ abịne mbon amọ, ke ini anye amaakesọñ, isua uwem amọ anyʌñ ayọhọ. Ndin nditọ amọ, Isọ ye Yekọb, emaebuuk anye.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s1">Ubon Isọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Ami ado mbʌk ubon Isọ (a-adooho Edọm).<verse eid="GEN 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Isọ akedat ibaan amọ ke atu ibaan Kenan: Ada, ayịn awonwaan Elọn, a-akedooho awo Hed, ye Oholibama ayịn awonwaan Ana a-akedooho ayeyịn Sibiọn a-aketooho Hif, <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />akọrọ ye Basemad ayịn awonwaan Ismeel a-akenyʌññọ ado ayịneka ye Nebaiyọd.<verse eid="GEN 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada amaaman Elifas anọ Isọ, Basemad aman Rewel, <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Oholibama amaanyʌñ aman Yeus, Yalam ye Kora. Mbon ami ekedoñño nditọ ideen Isọ, e-ekemanna enọ anye ke Kenan.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Isọ amaaben ibaan amọ ye nditọ amọ ideen ye ibaan ye afịd mbon ufọk amọ, akọrọ ye ufene amọ ye mme unam mfen ye afịd mme ñkpọ se anye akenie ke Kenan, anyʌñ adakka akaa isọñ akesannake akpọñ ayịneka amọ Yekọb. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Mme ñkpọ se ammọ ekenie emaenekke ewak akan se ammọ ekpedʌñọ keed; sia isọñ a-ammọ ekedʌñọke ikpikemme ammọ awo iba ke ntak ufene ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Ndin Isọ (a-adooho Edọm) amaakedʌñ ke abod abio Sei.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Ami ado mbʌk ubon Isọ a-akedooho ete mbon Edọm ke abod-abod abio Sei.<verse eid="GEN 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Mme anyịñ nditọ ideen Isọ edo ami:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:10">Elifas, ayịn awodeen anwaan Isọ, Ada, ye Rewel, ayịn anwaan Isọ, Basemad.<verse eid="GEN 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Nditọ ideen Elifas ekedoñño:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:11">Teman, Ọma, Sefo, Katam ye Kenas. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Ayịn Isọ, Elifas, amaanyʌñ anie anwaan esa a-akekereke Timna a-akemanna Amalek anọ anye. Mbon ami ekedo ideen nditọ ayeyịn Ada, anwaan Isọ.<verse eid="GEN 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Nditọ ideen Rewel ekedoñño:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:13">Nahad, Seera, Sama ye Misa. Mbon ami ekedoñño nditọ ayeyịn Basemad anwaan Isọ.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Nditọ ideen Oholibama, anwaan Isọ a-akedooho ayịn awonwaan Ana ye ayeyịn Sibiọn, a-anye akemanna anọ Isọ ekedoñño:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:14">Yeus, Yalam ye Kora.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Mbon ami ekedoñño mbọọñ ke atu ubon Isọ:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 36:15">Nditọ ideen Elifas, akpan Isọ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:15">Mbọọñ Teman, Ọma, Sefo, Kenas, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />Kora, Katam ye Amalek. Mbon ami ekedo mbọọñ e-eketooho Elifas ke Edọm; ammọ ekedo nditọ ayeyịn ideen Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Nditọ Rewel, ayịn Isọ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:17">Mbọọñ Nahad, Seera, Sama ye Misa. Mbon ami ekedo mbọọñ e-eketooho Rewel ke Edọm; ammọ ekedo nditọ ayeyịn ideen Basemad anwaan Isọ.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Nditọ ideen Oholibama, anwaan Isọ ekedoñño:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:18">Mbọọñ Yeus, Yalam ye Kora. Mbon ami ekedoñño mbọọñ e-eketooho Oholibama anwaan Isọ a-akedooho ayịn Ana.<verse eid="GEN 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Mbon ami ekedo nditọ ideen Isọ (a-adooho, Edọm), ammọ ekenyʌñ edo mbọọñ ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Mbon ami ekedoñño nditọ ideen Sei a-akedooho awo Hori, e-ekedʌñọke ke isọñ ado:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:20">Lotan, Sobal, Sibiọn, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Disọn, Esa ye Disan. Nditọ ideen Sei ke Edọm ekedoñño mbọọñ Hori.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Nditọ ideen Lotan ekedoñño:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:22">Hori ye Homam. Timna akedo ayịneka awonwaan Lotan.<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Nditọ ideen Sobal ekedoñño:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:23">Alfan, Manahad, Ebal, Sefo ye Ọnam.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Nditọ ideen Sibiọn ekedoñño:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:24">Aiya ye Ana. (Ana ami akedo awo a-akekekịtte mme ufiob idịm ke akpautatan ke ini anye akekpemeke mme dọñki ete amọ ke Sibiọn.)<verse eid="GEN 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Nditọ Ana ekedoñño:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:25">Disọn ye Oholibama, ayịn awonwaan Ana.<verse eid="GEN 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Nditọ ideen Disọn ekedoñño:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:26">Hemdan, Esban, Itran ye Keran.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Nditọ ideen Esa ekedoñño:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:27">Bilhan, Saafan ye Akan.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Nditọ ideen Disan ekedoñño:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:28">Us ye Aran.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Mbon ami ekedoñño mbọọñ Hori:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:29">Lotan, Sobal, Sibiọn, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />Disọn, Esa ye Disan.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="GEN 36:30">Mbon ami ekedoñño mme mbọọñ Hori akeene mme ikpeghe ammọ ke isọñ Sei.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Andikara Edọm</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Mme ndidem se ikikara Edọm mbemiso awo Isrel ndomokeed adikara ekedoñño ami:<verse eid="GEN 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Bela ayịn Beo amaado adidem ke Edọm. Abio amọ akekere Dinhaba.<verse eid="GEN 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Bela akekpa, Yobab ayịn Seera a-aketooho Bosra amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="GEN 36:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Yobab akekpa, Husam a-aketooho isọñ Teman amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="GEN 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Husam akekpa, Hadad ayịn Bedad, a-akekanna Midian ke idịd Mọb, amaadat itie amọ nte adidem. Abio amọ akekere Aafịd.<verse eid="GEN 36:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadad akekpa, Samla a-aketooho Masreka amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="GEN 36:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Samla akekpa, Sọọl a-aketooho Rehobod ke mben inyañ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="GEN 36:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Sọọl akekpa, Baal-Hanan ayịn Akbọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="GEN 36:38" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Baal-Hanan ayịn Akbọ akekpa, Hadad amaadat itie amọ nte adidem. Abio amọ akekere Pau, ndin anyịñ anwaan amọ akedo Mehetabel ayịn, awonwaan Matred, ayịn awonwaan Me-Sahab.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Mbon ami edo anyịñ mme mbọọñ e-eketooho ubon Isọ ke ubonoñkpọ ekpək ye ñkanñkʌk abio ammọ:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 36:40">Timna, Alfa, Yeted,<verse eid="GEN 36:40" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Oholibama, Ela, Pinọn,<verse eid="GEN 36:41" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Kenas, Teman, Mibsa,<verse eid="GEN 36:42" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Makdiel, ye Iram.</para>
  <para style="lf" vid="GEN 36:43">Mbon ami ekedo mme mbọọñ ke Edọm, akeene mme itieidʌñ ammọ ke isọñ a-ammọ ekedʌñọke.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 36:43" />
  <para style="lf" vid="GEN 36:43">Ami ado udịm ubon Isọ, ete mbon Edọm.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Ndab Yosef</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yekọb akedʌñ ke Kenan, a-adooho isọñ e-ete amọ akedʌññọ.<verse eid="GEN 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Ami ado mbʌk ubon Yekọb.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 37:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Yosef, akparawa isua duob mme itiaba, akesʌk abọọk ufene ye nditọete amọ, mme nditọ ideen Bilha ye nditọ ideen Silpa, mme ibaan ete amọ, ndin anye amaaben idiọọk etob a-akebañake ammọ asọk ete amọ.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Ndin Isrel amaama Yosef akan afịd nditọ ideen amọ, sia ekemanna anye ke ini usọñ amọ; anye amaanyʌñ anam uyaiya afọñidem anọ anye. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Nditọete amọ ekekịt ke ete ammọ amaama anye akan afịd ammọ, ammọ emaesua anye, inyʌññọ itañ ikọ emem-emem ye anye.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Akema Yosef amaadappa ndab, ndin anye amaaketañ ndab ado anọ nditọete amọ, ammọ emaenenekke esua anye. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Anye amaabo ammọ ate, “Ikpañ utọñ ikop ndab a-ami ñkedappake: <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Ñnyịn ikisʌk ibọọp mme abek akpọ abakpa ke inwañ, ndin inikeed abek mmi amaadakka ada anyʌñ atuak ada nnen-nnen, ke ini abek ndufo ekannake ake mmi ekʌk, enyʌñ enyuuk iwuod enọ anye.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Ndin nditọete amọ emaebo anye, “Nte afo aduak adikara ñnyịn? Nte afo akpaasọñ esịd ayem adikara ñnyịn?” Ndin ammọ emaenenekke esua anye ke ntak ndab amọ ye se anye aketañ.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Akema anye amaatịmme adappa ndab mfen, anye amaanyʌñ atañ anọ nditọete amọ. Anye amaabo, “Ikpañ utọñ. Ami mmaadappa ndab mfen, ndin ini anye ami utịn ye afiọñ ye ntantaafiọñ duob mme keed emaetuak iwuod ennọ miin.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Ke ini anye aketañña anọ ete amọ ye nditọete amọ, ete amọ amaasua anọ anye anyʌñ abo anye, “Nsoo ndab ke afo akedappa ami? Nte eka mfo ye ami ye nditọete mfo iyaidituak iwuod unọ fiin?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Ndin nditọete amọ emaefịbe ufịb ebaña anye, ado ete amọ amaasịn ikọ ami ke esịd amọ.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nditọeka Yosef Enyam Anye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Akema nditọete amọ emaekaa adibọọk udịmedọñ ete ammọ ke ñkpere Sekem, <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />ndin Isrel amaabo Yosef, “Nte afo adiọọñọke, nditọete mfo esʌk ebọọk edọñ ke ñkpere Sekem. Di, ami ñyaudọñ fiin nọ abịne ammọ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “A-afọn.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Ndin Isrel amaabo Yosef, “Kaa ke se me afịd ñkpọ a-afọn ye nditọete mfo ye udịmedọñ, nyʌñ tịmme dindọkkọ miin.” Ndin anye amaanam Yosef adakka ato Abedeñ Hibrọn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Ke ini Yosef amaakesịm Sekem, <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />awodeen keed amaakịt anye nte adutịn akanna ikọd, anyʌñ abịp anye ate, “Nsoo ke afo ayem?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami ñyem nditọete mmi ideen. Afo akpaakan andọkkọ miin itie nte ammọ eben mme edọñ ammọ eka nọ eketa mbịd?”<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Awo ado amaabọọrọ ate, “Ammọ emaedakka ekpọñ itie ami. Mmaakop naña ammọ ekebo, ‘Yak ñnyịn ika Dotan.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:17">Ndin Yosef amaadakka abịne nditọete amọ, anyʌñ akekịt ammọ ke ñkpere Dotan. <verse eid="GEN 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Ado ammọ emaeda ekịt anye ke anyan usʌñ, ndin mbemiso anye adiwuọ ammọ idem, ammọ emaedʌk edioomo adiwot anye.<verse eid="GEN 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Ammọ emaetañ ye emọ-emọ ete, “Adappa ndab ado asʌk adi! <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Idi, yak ñnyịn iwot anye, inyʌñ itop anye isịn ke ube keed ke atu mbon ebaññake mi ndin ñnyịn iyaibo ke idiọọk unam aketa anye. Ndin iyaikịt se idiwuọ ito mme ndab amọ.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Ke ini Rubịn akekoppo ami, anye amaanwana adifak Yosef nsio ke ubọk ammọ. Ke ntoro anye amaabo ammọ, “Yak ñnyịn ikiiwot anye; <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />ikiiduọk iyiib ndomokeed. Itop anye isịn ke ube ke anaan ami, ado ikiiyak ubọk ndufo ndomokeed atuuk anye.” Rubịn aketañ ami nọ anyaaña anye asio ke ubọk ammọ, anyʌñ atịmme aben anye asọk ete amọ.<verse eid="GEN 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Ndin ke Yosef amaakediwuọ nditọete amọ idem, ammọ emaemʌm anye esịññe afọñ ke idem, ataa asaña-asaña uyaiya afọñidem a-anye akesịneke, <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />enyʌñ eben anye eketop esịn ke ube. Ube ami akedo ukpọk, sia mmọọñ ikisịneke ke esịd.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Ndin ammọ ekesuuk etie eyem edidia ñkpọ, ammọ emaebenne anyen ekịt atu mbon Ismeel naña eto Kilied edi. Mme kamel ammọ emaenyʌñ ebiom mme anemufịk mfiọññọ, asọñufịk adan ye mfịd udat nnam nsọñudua adan, ndin ammọ ekeba ke usʌñ adiben mme ñkpọ ami ñkaa Iyib.<verse eid="GEN 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Ndin Yuda amaabịp nditọete amọ abo, “Nsoo udod ke ñnyịn idiidia adieke ñnyịn iwotto ayịnete ñnyịn inyʌñ ifʌk iyiib amọ? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Idi, yak ñnyịn inyam anye inọ mbon Ismeel, ikiinyʌñ iyak ubọk ñnyịn atuuk anye, sia anye asʌk ado ayịnete ñnyịn ke abʌk ye iyiib.” Mme nditọete ammọ emaenyịmme.<verse eid="GEN 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Ndin ke ini mme anyam udua mbon Midian eketooho edisịm, nditọete amọ emaedʌt Yosef esio ke ube, enyʌñ enyam anye ke mbaak silfa edịb enọ mbon Ismeel, e-ekebenne anye eka Iyib.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Rubịn amaaketịmme akaa ube akekịt ke Yosef isịneke do, anye amaawai afọñ amọ ke idem. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Anye amaatịmme abịne nditọete amọ anyʌñ akebo ammọ ate, “Akparawa ado isịneke do! Nnam die idahado?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Akema ammọ emaeben afọñidem Yosef, ewot ebod keed enyʌñ enyiin afọñ ado ke iyiib ebod. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Ammọ ndin emaeben asaña-asaña afọñ ado esọk ete ammọ, enyʌñ ebo anye, “Se se ñnyịn ikikịt mi. Nekke se ise me ado afọñidem ayịn mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Ndin anye amaadiọọñọ anyʌñ abo, “Afọñ ayịn mmi ke ado! Mme ndiọi unam e-eta anye. Ke akpanikọ, emaewai Yosef mbai-mbai.”<verse eid="GEN 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Ndin Yekọb amaawai afọñidem amọ, anyʌñ aben afọñikpo asịne, afʌhọ abaña ayịn amọ ke uwak usen. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Afịd nditọ amọ ideen ye ibaan emaedi edidọñ anye esịd, ado anye ikikoppo ndọñesịd. Anye amaabọọrọ, “Iyoo. Ñyaakaa iso ntua tutu ami ñkeene ayịn mmi ke udi.” Ndin ete amọ amaatua ke ntak Yosef.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Ke ufọọd ini ami, mbon Midian emaeben Yosef ekenyam ke Iyib enọ Pọtifa, keed ke atu mme adaidaha ke ufọkutom Fero, adaiso mbon ukpeme.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda ye Tama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Ke ini ado, Yuda amaakpọñ nditọete amọ ideen asọiyọ akaa akedʌñ ye awo Adulam a-akekereke Hira. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Do ke Yuda akekịt ayịn awonwaan e-ete amọ aketooho Kenan a-akekereke Sua. Ndin anye amaadọ anye anyʌñ anam ima ye anye; <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />ndin anye amaayommo idịb anyʌñ aman ayịn, e-ekesioho anye anyịñ Er. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Akema anye amaamaana ayommo anyʌñ aman awodeen anyʌñ akoot anye Ọnan. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Anye amaamaana aman kpa awodeen mfen anyʌñ akoot anye Sela. Anye akeman Sela ke Kesịb.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Yuda amaadọ anwaan anọ Er, akpan amọ, a-anyịñ amọ akedooho Tama. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Ado Er, akpan Yuda, akedo awo ibak ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawot anye.<verse eid="GEN 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Akema Yuda amaabo Ọnan, “Naa ye anwaan ayịneka mfo nyʌñ nam ubiọñutom mfo nọ anye nte ayịneka ebe amọ, nyʌñ bon ayịn nọ ayịneka mfo.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Ado Ọnan amaadiọọñọ ke ayịn ado idiidooho ake imọ; ke ntoro ini keed akeedodo a-anye akenaaha ye anwaan ayịneka amọ, anye amaaduọk nsene amọ ke isọñ mbaak anye adibon ayịn anọọ ayịneka amọ. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Se anye akenam akedo ibak ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawot anye ñko.<verse eid="GEN 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Ndin Yuda amaabo anwaan ayịn amọ Tama, “Dʌñ nte ebekpa ke ufọk ete mfo tutu ayịn mmi Sela akpon.” Sia anye akekere ke, “Anye akeme adikpa ñko, kpa nte nditọeka amọ.” Ndin Tama amaakaa akedʌñ ke ufọk ete amọ.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Ke anyan ini amaakeboiyo, anwaan Yuda, ayịn Sua, amaakpa. Ke ini Yuda amaakewuọ ke mfʌhọ, anye amaadakka Timna, abịne mbon ekefatta edọñ amọ ided, ndin ufan amọ Hira awo Adulam amaasaña ye anye.<verse eid="GEN 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Ke ini ekedọkkọke Tama ete, “Ete ebe mfo asʌk adi ke usʌñ Timna adikifat mme edọñ amọ ided,” <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />anye amaasịññe afọñikpo ke idem, ndin amaaben ufʌhọñkpọ afʌk idem amọ mbaak mme awo edidiọọñọ anye, amaanyʌñ awuọ aketie ke inuaatob Enaim, ke usʌñ a-akaaha Timna. Sia anye amaakekịt ke akpesʌkado Sela amaakekpon ayọhọ ndọ, awo ikibenne imọ inọ anye nte anwaan.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Ke ini Yuda akekịtte anye, anye akekere ke anye ado akpara, sia anye amaafʌk iso amọ. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Sia anye imiikidiọọñọke ke ado anwaan ayịn amọ, anye amaaboiyo abịne anye ke mben usʌñ anyʌñ akebo anye, “Di idahami, yak ami ñkena ye afo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Anye amaabịp ate, “Ndin nsoo ke afo udunnọ ke ami adina ye afo?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami ñyaunọ ñyịn ebod ke atu ufene mmi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Anye amaabịp, “Afo ayannọ miin ñkpọ ubiọñ mbemiso afo anọ ebod adi?”<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Anye amaabo, “Nsoo ñkpọ ubiọñ ke ami nduunọ fiin?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ufiikñkpọ mfo ye idʌk amọ, ye esañ ke ubọk mfo.” Ndin anye amaayaak mme ñkpọ ado anọ anye, anyʌñ anaa ye anye; ndin anye amaanyʌñ ayommo idịb anọ anye. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Anye amaakenyọñ, anye amaafʌkkọ ufʌhọñkpọ afep anyʌñ akoono mme afọñikpo amọ amaana asịne.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Ke ufọọd ini ami Yuda amaanọ ñyịn ebod ato ubọk ufan amọ awo Adulam nọ ato do akebọ mme ñkpọ ubiọñ ke ubọk awonwaan akpara ado, ado anye ikikịtte anye. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Ndin anye amaabịp ideen ekedʌñọke ke itie ado, “Mmọ akpara ñwommo a-akesitieghe ke mben usʌñ ke Enaim?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Akenaanam akpara ñwommo ibaaha ke itie ami.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Ndin anye amaatịmme abịne Yuda anyʌñ akebo, “Ami ñkikịtte anye. Ke aboiyoke ado, mme ideen e-ekedʌñọke do emaebo, ‘Akenaanam akpara ñwommo ibaaha ke itie ami.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Akema Yuda amaabo, “Yak anye akama se anye anie, mbaak ñnyịn idido ñkpọnsaha. Sia ami mmaanọ ñyịn ebod ami esọk anye, ado afo ukukịtte anye.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Ke ñkpọ nte afiọñ ita emaekeboiyo emaetañ enọ Yuda ete, “Anwaan ayịn mfo Tama adue ke adisaña akpara, ndin ke ntak ado anye asaña ye idịb idahami.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Yuda amaabo, “Isio anye idi nọ efọp anye ke ikañ nọ akpa!”<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Akema naña nte ebenne anye ewuọ edi, anye amaadọñ utom anọ ete ebe amọ, ate “Ami ñyommo idịb nnọ awo a-anieghe mme ñkpọ ami.” Anye amaatịmme adian do ate, “Se ise me amediọọñọ me anie awo anie ufịkñkpọ ye idʌk ye esañ ami.”<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Ndin Yuda amaadiọọñọ mme ñkpọ ado anyʌñ abo, “Anye a-ado adinen awo añkan miin, sia ami mmeñkebenne anye nnọ ayịn mmi Sela.” Ndin anye ikinaaha ye anye aba.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Ndin ini uman ayịn amaakekem, akedo nditọ ideen iba ekesịne ke idịb amọ. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Naña anye akebooho iman, keed ke atu ammọ amaasio ubọk anyan; ndin abiauman amaaben ndad-ndad udʌk atobo anye ke itọñ ubọk anyʌñ abo ate, “Anye ami aketo awuọ adi.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Akema ke ini anye atịmmeke adʌt ubọk asio, ayịneka amọ amaamana, anye amaanyʌñ abo, “Ndin naña afo abịmme awuọ adi ado ami!” Ndin emaenyʌñ esio anye anyịñ Peres.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peres awuọñọ adisakka ñwuọ.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Akema ayịneka amọ, andikibọbọ ndad-ndad udʌk ke itọñ ubọk, amaawuọ adi. Ndin emaesio anye anyịñ Seera.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seera akeme adiwuọ ndad-ndad me uyamma</char></note><verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s1">Yosef ye Anwaan Pọtifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Idaha ntoro, emaeben Yosef ekesịm Iyib. Pọtifa, awo Iyib a-akedooho keed ke atu mme adaidaha ke ufọk Fero, adaiso mbon ukpeme, amaadep anye ato mbon Ismeel e-ekebenne anye eka do.<verse eid="GEN 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaba ye Yosef, ado amaanam anye aforo, anyʌñ adʌñ ke ufọk awo Iyib, eteufọk amọ. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Ke ini eteufọk amọ akekịtte ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaba ye anye ndin ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam anye anie unen ke afịd se anye akenam, <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Yosef amaakịt mfọn ke iso amọ, anyʌñ akappa ado awo ubọk nnasia amọ. Pọtifa amaanam anye ado andise ñkpọ mbaña ufọk amọ, ndin anye amaayaak afịd se anye anie asịn ke idak ukpeme amọ. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Tọọñọ ke ini a-anye akenamma anye ado andise ñkpọ mbaña ufọk amọ ye afịd se anye akenie, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadiọñ ufọk awo Iyib ke ntak Yosef. Adidiọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịm afịd ñkpọ se Pọtifa akenie ke ufọk ye se ikiba ke inwañ. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Ndin Pọtifa amaayaak afịd ñkpọ se anye akenie asịn ke idak ukpeme Yosef. Ndin sia adooho Yosef akese ñkpọ abaña afịd ñkpọ, anye ikifịnake idem amọ ye ñkpọ ndomokeed, ibọhọke ndidia a-anye akediaha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yosef amaaboro, afọn, anyʌñ ayaiya, <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />ndin ke etək ini amaakeboiyo anwaan Pọtifa amaanie udọñ anọ Yosef anyʌñ abo anye, “Di naa ye ami!”<verse eid="GEN 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Ado Yosef amaasịn. Anye amaadọkkọ anye ate, “Ami nte andise ñkpọ mbaña afịd ñkpọ eteufọk mmi, anye isịnne idem ke ñkpọ ndomokeed ke ufọk; anye amaayaak afịd ñkpọ se anye anie asịn ke idak ukpeme mmi. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Awo ndomokeed ikponno iñkan miin ke ufọk ami. Eteufọk mmi inyʌññọ iñnyịm miin ñkpọ ndomokeed ke imiibọhọke afo, sia afo ado anwaan amọ. Nsaña die ñkpenam utọ ibak ado, ñnyʌñ nnam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso Abasi?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Ndin akpesʌkado a-anwaan Pọtifa aketañña anyʌñ akpeiye Yosef kwa usen, anye amaasịn adika ñkena ye anye, me aditie keed ye anye.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Ado usen keed Yosef amaadʌk ufọk adikinam utom amọ, ndin nditọufọk ndomokeed mfen ikibaaha ke ufọk. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Anwaan Pọtifa ndin amaamʌm Yosef ke afọñidem amọ anyʌñ abo anye, “Di naa ye ami!” Ado anye amaakpọñ afọñ amọ ke ubọk amọ, anyʌñ afeghe awuọ ke ufọk.<verse eid="GEN 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Ke ini anye akekịtte ke Yosef amaakpọñ afọñidem amọ ke ubọk amọ anyʌñ afeghe akpọñ ufọk, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />anye amaakoot nditọufọk amọ anyʌñ abo ammọ, “Ise mi, ekeben ayịn Hibru ami isọk ñnyịn nọ anye adidat ñnyịn atọ ndọk! Anye akedʌk adi mi adina ye ami, ndin ami nsio ñkpo. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Anye akekop ke ami mmesio ñkpo ñyem unwam, anye amaakpọñ afọñidem amọ ke ñkañ mmi anyʌñ afeghe awuọ ke ufọk.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Ndin anye amaanịm afọñidem Yosef tutu eteufọk amọ anyọñ adi. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Ndin anye amaadọkkọ ebe amọ mme ñkpọ ami: “Afʌn Hibru a-afo akedatta isọk ñnyịn akedi ambịne miin adiñkama ibre mbre. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Ado ke ini ami ñkebọññọ ñkpo ñyem unwam, anye amaakpọñ afọñidem amọ ke ñkañ mmi, anyʌñ afeghe awuọ ke ufọk.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Ke ini eteufọk Yosef akekoppo se anwaan amọ aketañ abo, “Ami ado naña afʌn mfo akenam ye ami,” anye amaakop akpọsọñ ufiob iyadesịd. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Ndin eteufọk Yosef amaamʌm anye akesịn ke ufọk ñkpakọb, ke itie ebonno mbon ñkpakọb adidem.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:20">Ado ke ini Yosef akebaaha ke ufọk ñkpakọb, <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaba ye Yosef, afọn ido ye anye, anyʌñ anam mme akpeme ñkpakọb enen iso ye anye. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Ndin akpeme ñkpakọb amaanam Yosef ado andise ñkpọ mbaña afịd mbon e-ekemʌmmọ ekesịn ke ñkpakọb, ndin emaenam anye ado adaiwuod ke afịd ñkpọ se ekenam do. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Akpeme ufọk ñkpakọb ikisịnne anyen ke ñkpọ ndomokeed a-akesịneke ke idak Yosef, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaba ye Yosef anyʌñ anọ anye mfọn ke se adoodo a-anye akenamma.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s1">Akamaiko ye Atemndidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Ke etək ini amaakeboiyo, akamaiko ye atem uyo adidem Iyib emaedue eteufọk ammọ, adidem Iyib. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Fero amaayat esịd ye mme adaidaha amọ iba, etubom ke atu mme akamaiko amọ ye ekamba awo a-akesitemme uyo amọ, <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />anyʌñ amʌm ammọ akedọñ ke ñkpakọb ke ufọk adaiso mbon ukpeme, ke ukem ufọk ñkpakọb a-Yosef akesịneke. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Ndin adaiso mbon ukpeme amaabo Yosef ase ñkpọ abaña ammọ, anye amaanyʌñ ase ñkpọ abaña ammọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:4">Ke ini ammọ ekebaaha ke ñkpakọb, <verse eid="GEN 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />mme awo iba ami e-ekedooho akamaiko adidem ye atem uyo adidem Iyib, e-ekedọñọke ke ufọk ñkpakọb, emaedappa ndab ukem akonayio ado, ndin ndab keedekeed amaanie se akewuọñọ.<verse eid="GEN 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Ke ini Yosef akediighe abịne ammọ ke usiere edem usen, anye amaakịt ke ammọ ekeba mfʌhọ-mfʌhọ. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Ndin anye amaabịp mme adaidaha Fero e-ekebaaha ye anye ke ñkpakọb ke ufọk eteufọk ammọ ate, “Nsoo ido ntak a-ndufo ebaaha mfʌhọ-mfʌhọ mfịn?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Ndin ammọ emaebọọrọ ete, “Ñnyịn awo iba imaidappa ndab, ado ibaaha awo se ikappa ammọ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Ndin Yosef amaabo ammọ ate, “Nte ukappa ndab inieghe Abasi? Indọkkọ miin mme ndab ndufo.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Ndin etubom mme akamaiko amaadọkkọ Yosef ndab amọ. Anye amaadọkkọ anye ate, “Ke ndab mmi ñkekịt fain nte ada ke iso mmi, <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />ndin fain ami amaanie ñkọk ita ke idem amọ. Kpa idaha ado anye amaaseghe, anwịm mfịd, ndin mme ayọ amọ emaenyʌñ edat ekappa mme kreb. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Kọọb Fero mmọdo akeba ke ubọk mmi, ndin ami mmaaben mme kreb ado ñnyịmme nsịn ke kọọb Fero ñnyʌñ mben kọọb ado nsịn anye ke ubọk.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yosef amaabo anye, “Ami ado se ndab mfo awuọñọ. Mme ñkọk ita ado ewuọñọ usen ita. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Asʌhọ usen ita Fero ayaudịppe fiin asio atịmme uben fiin akenịm ke itie mfo, ndin afo ayaasịn Fero kọọb amọ ke ubọk amọ, kpa naña afo akesinam ini a-afo akedooho akamaiko amọ. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Ado ke ini afịd ñkpọ amaasaña mfọn-mfọn ye afo, ntoiyo miin nyʌñ fọn ido ye ami; siak anyịñ mmi nọ Fero nyʌñ nam ensio miin ke ñkpakọb ami. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Sia ekemben ke adudu ñkanubọk ekpọñ isọñ mbon Hibru, ndin kpa ke umi, ami nnamma ñkpọ ndomokeed a-adotto se ekpensịn ke ñkpakọb.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Ke ini etubom mme atem uyo akịtte ke Yosef amaanọ nnen-nnen ukappa ndab, anye amaabo Yosef, “Ami ñko mmaadappa ndab: Ke iwuod mmi akpasa uyo ita ekedoro. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Akpasa andikidoro akpa amaadọñọ afịd utọ unwanwan ndidia Fero, ndin mme inuen ekesʌk eta ammọ esịññe ke akpasa ado ke iwuod mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yosef amaabo anye, “Ami ado se ndab mfo awuọñọ. Akpasa ita ado eda enọ usen ita. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Asʌhọ usen ita Fero ayaukpịkke fiin iwuod anyʌñ akọọñ idem mfo ke eto. Ndin mme inuen eyaedita abʌkidem mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Ndin ayọhọ usen ita akedo usọrọ usen emana Fero, anye amaanyʌñ anam usọrọ anọ mme adaidaha amọ. Anye amaanyʌñ adịppe iwuod etubom mme akamaiko ye etubom mme atem uyo ke iso mme adaidaha amọ: <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Anye amaatịmme abenne etubom mme akamaiko anịm ke itie amọ, nọ anye aben kọọb asịn ke ubọk Fero ini keed mfen, <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />ndin anye amaakọọñ idem etubom mme atem uyo ke eto, kpa naña Yosef aketañ anọ ammọ ke ukappa ndab amọ.<verse eid="GEN 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Ado, etubom mme akamaiko, ikitoiyoke Yosef; anye amaafre Yosef.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Ndab Fero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Ke ini ayọhọ-ayọhọ isua iba amaakeboiyo, Fero amaadappa ndab: Anye akeda ke mben Inyañ Nail,<verse eid="GEN 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />ndin ke esịd inyañ ado enañ itiaba emaewuọñọ edọọk edi, efọọn enyʌñ ekpoon, ndin edita ñnyanyaha ke mben inyañ. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Ammọ emaekeboiyo, uman enañ itiaba mfen, ediọiyọdiọi idem enyʌñ eba akpọ-akpọ, emaewuọñọ ke Nail edọọk edida ke mben inyañ ekpere mme akpa enañ. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Akema mme uman enañ e-ekediọiyọdiọi idem enyʌñ eba akpọ-akpọ emaedita mme umanenañ itiaba ekefọọnọ idem, enyʌñ ekpoon. Akema Fero amaademme ke idab.<verse eid="GEN 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Anye amaatịmme adaiya idab anyʌñ adappa ndab ayọhọ akañ iba: Iwuod abakpa itiaba, esọọñ idem enyʌñ efọọn, etịppe ewuọñọ ke itak keed. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Mbon ado emaekeboiyo, iwuod abakpa itiaba mfen emaetịppe, esaat enyʌñ etie nte ñkpọ a-afịm edem usakkautịn abiada. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Mme nsaad iwuod abakpa ami emaekoono mfọọn abakpa itiaba emen. Akema Fero amaademme ke idab; akịt ke akedo ndab.<verse eid="GEN 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Ke usiere ubakusen esịd amọ amaatịmede, ndin anye amaadọñ ekoot afịd mbiaidiọñ ye mbon aniọñ ke Iyib. Fero amaadọkkọ ammọ mme ndab amọ, ado awo ndomokeed ikikanna ikappa inọ anye.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Ndin etubom mme akamaiko amaabo Fero ate, “Mfịn ami entoiyo mme ndudue mmi. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Aba ini Fero akeyatta esịd ye nditọufọk amọ, ndin anye amañkọp miin ye etubom mme atem uyo ke ufọk adaiso mbon ukpeme. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Ñnyịn keedekeed imaidappa ndab ke akonayio keed, ndin ndab keedekeed akedo anie ukappa ndab anie. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Ndin ayịn Hibru keed amaaba do ye ñnyịn, ayịnufọk adaiso mbon ukpeme. Ñnyịn imaidọkkọ anye mme ndab ñnyịn, anye amaanyʌñ idọkkọ ñnyịn se mme ndab akewuọñọ, anọ awo keedekeed se ndab amọ akewuọñọ naña anye akedappa. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Ndin mme ñkpọ emaedisu ukem-ukem naña anye akenyʌñ akappa mme ndab ado inọọ ñnyịn: Emaetịmme emben miin enịm ke itie mmi, ndin awo anye ako emaekọọñ ke eto.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Akema Fero amaadọñ ekoot Yosef, ndin emaeben anye usọp-usọp eto ke ñkpakọb edi. Ke anye amaakekwaat ñwaebek anyʌñ akpəho afọñ amọ, anye amaadi ke iso Fero.<verse eid="GEN 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Ndin Fero amaabo Yosef, “Ami mmaadappa ndab, ndin awo ndomokeed ikanna ikappa anye. Ado ami mmekop nte ebo ke afo umaukop ndab amesikan adikappa.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yosef amaabọọrọ Fero ate, “Ami ñkanna adinam ado, ado Abasi ayaanọ Fero ibọọrọ a-anye ayemme.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Ndin Fero amaabo Yosef, “Ke ndab mmi ami ñkeda ke mben Inyañ Nail, <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />ndin ke ufọọd inyañ umanenañ itiaba emaewuọñọ edọọk edi, ekpoon enyʌñ efọọn, ammọ emaedita ñnyanyaha ke mben inyañ. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Ammọ emaekeboiyo, uman enañ itiaba mfen emaewuọñọ edi, ebañña akpọ-akpọ, udọñọ-udọñọ, enyʌñ esasaat. Akenam ñkịtte utọ ndiọi idem uman enañ ado ke afịd isọñ Iyib. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Mbon e-ekedoññoke nsaad-nsaad ye udọñọ-udọñọ emaekoono uman enañ itiaba e-ekekpoonokpoon, e-ekenyʌññọ ewuọñọ edi akpa eta. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Akpesʌkado a-ammọ eketañña mme mfọọn idem enañ ami eta, ukpəhọde ikibaaha ke idem ammọ, sia ammọ ekesʌk etie udọñọ-udọñọ naña ekeba akpa.” Akema ami mmaademme ke idab.<verse eid="GEN 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />“Ke ndab mmi ami mmaakịt iwuod abakpa itiaba, eyọhọ enyʌñ efọọn, eduyịt ke itak keed. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Ammọ emaekeboiyo, iwuod abakpa itiaba mfen emaetịppe, enyʌñ eyeeme, esaat enyʌñ etie nte ñkpọ a-afịm edem usakkautịn abiada. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Mme nsaad iwuod abakpa emaekoono mme mfọọn iwuod abakpa itiaba emen. Ami mmaatañ ami nnọ mbiaidiọñ, ado ndomokeed ke atu ammọ ikikanna inam nọ añnwaña miin.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Akema Yosef amaabo Fero ate, “Mme ndab Fero ado keed ye ukem-ukem. Abasi a-ayaara anọ Fero se anye ayem adinam. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Mfọọn umanenañ itiaba edo isua itiaba, mfọọn iwuod abakpa itiaba edo isua itiaba ñko; anye ado keed ye ukem ndab. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Mme akpọ-akpọ, ndiọi umanenañ itiaba e-ekewuọñọke edi akpatre edo isua itiaba, ñko mme iwuod abakpa itiaba i-imiikiwuọñọke ñkpọ, a-afịm edem usakkautịn akebiara edoñño akañ isua itiaba.”<verse eid="GEN 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />“Ado kpa se ami ñkedọkkọ Fero: Abasi a-awọt Fero se anye ayem adinam. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Ekamba eduek isua itiaba ayaadi ke afịd isọñ Iyib, <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />ado akañ isua itiaba ayaakeene ammọ. Ndin eyaefre afịd eduek se ikiba ke Iyib, akañ ayaanyʌñ akịm isọñ akappa. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Awo idiitoiyoke eduek a-akebaaha ke isọñ ado, sia akañ se idiikeene anye ayaasọñ ubọk ataa eti-eti. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Ndin ntak ekenọọhọ ndab ami esọk Fero ke usʌñ iba awọt abo ke Abasi amaabiide ayọhọ-ayọhọ, ndin idiikpeeneke Abasi ayaanam.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />“Ndin idahami yak Fero ayem awo aniọñ ye eti iwuod anyʌñ asịn anye nte aseñkpọ mbaña isọñ Iyib. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Yak Fero amek mme adaiwuod ke isọñ Iyib nọ ammọ ebọ ayọhọ mbaak ition eto ñkpọ idọk ke Iyib ke ufañ isua itiaba ake eduek adiiba. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Utom ammọ adiido adibọ afịd ndidia ke mme nti isua e-ediighe ke iso, enyʌñ eboon abakpa ke idak adudu Fero, eboon enịm se ediidia ke mme abio. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Mme ndidia ami edo se enịm enọ idʌñ, ediinyʌñ idia ke mme isua itiaba a-akañ adiiba ke Iyib, mbaak idʌñ adiwuuro ke ntak akañ.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Akikere ami amaafọn ke utọñ Fero ye afịd mme ñkpoon mbon utom amọ. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Akema Fero amaabịp ammọ abo, “Nte ñnyịn imiikeme adikịt utọ awo a-abaaha nte ete ami, awo a-sịbidịd Abasi adʌññọ anye ke idem?”<verse eid="GEN 41:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Ndin Fero amaabo Yosef, “Sia Abasi amaakeyaara afịd ami unọ fiin, ibaaha awo a-anieghe aniọñ ye eti iwuod nte afo. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Afo ayaado andise ñkpọ mbaña ufọk mmi, ndin afịd mbon mmi eyaesuuk iwuod enam se afo atañ. Ami ndiikpon ukan fiin ke ebekpo ikpọọñ.”<verse eid="GEN 41:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosef Ase Ñkpọ Abaña Iyib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Ndin Fero amaabo Yosef, “Ami mmumek fiin nte aseñkpọ mbaña afịd isọñ Iyib.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Ndin Fero amaasio ñkpannuun ke nnuunubọk amọ asịn ke nnuunubọk Yosef. Anye amaanyʌñ asịn anye eti uyaiya afọñ linen anyʌñ akọọñ anye ñkpọ itọñ kold ke itọñ. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Fero amaanam Yosef awat ke sariọd nte udiana amọ ke ukara, ndin mme awo emaesio ñkpo ke iso amọ ete, “Inọ usʌñ!” Naña ekesịn anye nte aseñkpọ mbaña afịd isọñ Iyib ado ami.<verse eid="GEN 41:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Akema Fero amaabo Yosef, “Ami ndo Fero, ado imiitooho ke uyio mfo awo ndomokeed ididịppeke ubọk me ukod ke afịd Iyib.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Ndin Fero amaanọ Yosef anyịñ Safenad-Panie anyʌñ anọ anye Asenad ayịn awonwaan Pọtifera, aku ke Ọn, nte anwaan amọ. Ndin Yosef amaawuọ asaaña ke afịd isọñ Iyib.<verse eid="GEN 41:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Yosef akesọñ isua edịb mme duob ke ini anye akedʌkkọ utom Fero, adidem Iyib. Ndin Yosef amaadakka ke iso Fero anyʌñ asaaña ke afịd Iyib. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Ke ukpa isua itiaba eduek, isọñ amaanwịm ataa uwak ñkpọ. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Yosef amaabọ afịd ndidia se ekenie ke mme isua itiaba e-eduek akebaaha ke Iyib anyʌñ anịm ndidia ke mme abio. Ke abio keedekeed anye amaanịm ndidia ato se eketọ ke ñkanñkʌk inwañ amọ. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yosef amaabon ataa uwak-uwak abakpa, a-atieghe nte ntan ke mben akpainyañ; amaawak eti-eti tutu anye atre adibad sia amaawak akan ibad.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Mbemiso mme isua akañ edisịm, nditọ ideen iba emaemana enọ Yosef ato Asenad, ayịn awonwaan Pọtifera, aku ke Ọn. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Yosef amaasio akpan amọ anyịñ Manase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manase atie nte usem Hibru a-adooho adifre.</char></note> anyʌñ abo, “Sia Abasi a-anam ami mfre afịd mfịna mmi ye afịd ufọk ete mmi.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Ndin udo amọ anye amaakoot Ifrem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ifrem atie nte usem Hibru a-adooho nseghe ñkemba</char></note> anyʌñ abo, “Ado sia Abasi a-anam ami ñnwịm mfịd ke isọñ ukuud mmi.” <verse eid="GEN 41:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Akema isua itiaba eduek ke Iyib amaakweeñe, <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />ndin isua itiaba akañ amaatọọñọ, kpa naña Yosef aketañ. Akañ amaaba ke afịd mme idʌñ, ado ke afịd isọñ Iyib ndidia amaaba. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Ke ini a-akañ aketọọñọke adituuk afịd awo ke Iyib, mme awo emaetua ebo Fero inọ mmimọ ndidia. Ndin Fero amaabo afịd mbon Iyib, “Ikaa ibịne Yosef inyʌñ inam se anye abo ndufo enam.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Ke ini akañ amaakesuana asịm afịd abio, Yosef amaabeere mme ufọk unịm ndidia, anyʌñ anyam abakpa anọ mbon Iyib, sia akañ amaanekke asọñ ubọk ke afịd isọñ Iyib. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Ndin afịd ederimbod emaedi Iyib edidep abakpa nto Yosef, sia akañ amaanekke asọñ ubọk ke afịd itie.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s1">Nditọete Yosef Ekaa Iyib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Ke ini Yekọb akekoppo ke abakpa a-aba ke Iyib, anye amaabo nditọ ideen amọ, “Nsoo inam ndufo eka iso ese emọ-emọ? <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Ami mmekop ke abakpa mmọdo ke Iyib. Isọiyọ ikaa do ikidep isọk ñnyịn, mbaak ñnyịn idikpañña.”<verse eid="GEN 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Akema nditọete Yosef awo duob emaesọiyọ ekaa adikidep abakpa ke Iyib. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Ado Yekọb ikiyakka Benyamin, ayịneka Yosef akaa ye mbon ñko, sia ndịk amaanam anye ke unọmọ akeme adikisịm anye. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Ke ntoro nditọ Isrel emaekeene esịne ke atu mbon e-ekekaaha ekedep abakpa, sia akañ amaasịm isọñ Kenan akọrọ.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Idaha ntoro, Yosef akedo adaukara ke Iyib, anyʌñ ado awo a-akenyamma abakpa anọ afịd mbon awo. Ndin ke ini nditọete Yosef ekedisịmme, ammọ emaenyuuk iwuod enọ anye enyʌñ esuuk iso ke isọñ. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Yosef akekekịt nditọete amọ, anye amaadiọọñọ ammọ, ado anye amaanam nte imọ ido asenawo, anyʌñ atañ ikọ nduaiya-nduaiya ye ammọ. Anye amaabịp ammọ ate, “Ndufo eto uke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Ñnyịn ito isọñ Kenan idi adidep ndidia.” <verse eid="GEN 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Akpesʌkado Yosef amaakediọọñọ nditọete amọ, ammọ ikidiọọñọke anye. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Ndin Yosef amaatoiyo mme ndab amọ a-akebañake ammọ, anyʌñ abo ammọ, “Ndufo edoñño mbon uyeb! Ekedi edise naña isọñ ñnyịn aba ye itie se ukpeme imiibaaha.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Iyoo, abọọñ mmi. Nditọufọk mfo ekedi adidep ndidia. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Afịd ñnyịn idoñño nditọ ete keed. Ñnyịn ido mbon akpanikọ, ñnyịn idoññoke mbon uyeb.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Yosef amaabo ammọ, “Iyoo! Ndufo edi edise isọñ ñnyịn itie se ukpeme imiibaaha.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Ado ammọ emaebọọrọ ete, “Nditọufọk mfo ekedo nditọete duob mme iba, nditọ e-ete keed abonno, e-edʌññọ ke isọñ Kenan. Andisịb ñkan mmọdo ye ete ñnyịn, keed ibaaha aba.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Yosef amaabo ammọ, “Ado kpa se ami ñkidọkkọ ndufo: Ndufo edoñño mbon uyeb! <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Ndin ntom ke ediidat idomo ndufo ise: Ma uwem Fero, ndufo idiikpọññọ itie ami ibọhọke akpeedem ayịnete ndufo adi mmi. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Dọñ keed ke atu ndufo akeben ayịnete ndufo adi; ndufo se isʌhọ eyaesịne ke ñkpakọb, nọ ato do edomo ikọ ndufo ese me se ndufo etañ ado akpanikọ. Adieke imiidooho, ma uwem Fero, ndufo edoñño mbon uyeb!” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Ndin anye amaasịn ammọ ke ñkpakọb ke usen ita.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Ke ayọhọ usen ita, Yosef amaabo ammọ, “Inam ntom ndin ndufo eyaedu uwem, sia ami mmebaak Abasi: <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Akpedo ndufo edo mbon akpanikọ, iyaak keed ke atu nditọete ndufo asịne mi ke ufọk ñkpakọb, ke ini ndufo mbon ako ebenne abakpa enyọñ ekenọọ mbon ufọk ndufo e-etieghe abiọọñ. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Ado ana nte eben akpeedem ayịnete ndufo ensọk miin, nọ ñkan nduuñọ ikọ ndufo mbaak ndufo idikpañña.” Ndin ammọ emaenam naña Yosef akebo.<verse eid="GEN 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Ammọ emaeneme ye emọ-emọ ete, “Ke akpanikọ imia ñnyịn ufen ke ntak ayịnete ñnyịn. Ñnyịn imaikịt naña anye akebọọ ndutʌhọ ke ini anye akikpeeghe ñnyịn ubọk abaña uwem amọ, ado ñnyịn ikikpañña utọñ; ami ado ntak a-ndutʌhọ ami isịmme ñnyịn.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Akema Rubịn amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, “nte ami ñkidọkkọke ndufo mbo ikiinam ayịn ado idiọọk? Ado ndufo ikiyemme ikpañ utọñ! Idahami ana nte ñnyịn ibọ utịb iyiib amọ.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Ammọ ikidiọọñọke ke se ammọ eketañ amaanwaña Yosef, sia anye akekamake akappaikọ atañ ikọ ye ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Akema anye amaadakka akpọñ ammọ anyʌñ aketua, ado akema anye amaatịmme adi amaana aditañ ikọ ye ammọ. Anye amaanam emʌm Simiọn esio ke atu ammọ, anyʌñ abọp anye ke iso ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Yosef amaanọ uyio ate edọñ abakpa ke mme ekpad ammọ nọ ayọhọ, etịmme eyaak akʌk ammọ esịn ke ekpad awo keedekeed, enyʌñ enọ ammọ ñkpọ se edia ke usʌñisañ ammọ. Ke emaekenam ami enọ ammọ, <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />ammọ emaedoot abakpa ammọ ke edem dọñki ammọ enyʌñ enyọñọ.<verse eid="GEN 42:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Ke itie a-ammọ eketreke ke akonayio adiduọk adudu, awo ammọ keed amaatat ekpad amọ adisio ndidia nnọọ dọñki amọ, ndin anye amaakịt silfa amọ ke inua ekpad amọ. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Anye amaadọkkọ nditọete amọ, “Emaetịmme eyaak silfa mmi ennọ. Se anye mi ke esịd ekpad mmi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:28">Esịd amaakịppe ammọ; ammọ emaenyʌñ ekanna ese emọ-emọ ke ñnyeñidem enyʌñ ebo, “Nsoo ke Abasi anam ye ñnyịn ntom?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Ke ini ammọ emaekenyọñ ebịne ete ammọ Yekọb ke isọñ Kenan, ammọ emaedọkkọ anye afịd se ikitịppe inọ ammọ. Ammọ emaebo, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Awo a-akedooho abọọñ ke idʌñ ado aketañ ikọ ye ñnyịn nduaiya-nduaiya, anyʌñ anam ñkpọ ye ñnyịn nte ikika uyeb ke idʌñ ado. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Ado ñnyịn imaidọkkọ anye ibo, ‘Ñnyịn ido mbon akpanikọ; ñnyịn idooho mbon uyeb. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Ñnyịn ikido duob mme iba, nditọ ete keed. Keed ibaaha aba, ndin akpeedem mmọdo idahami ye ete ñnyịn ke Kenan.’<verse eid="GEN 42:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />“Akema awo a-akedooho abọọñ ke idʌñ ado amaibo ñnyịn, ‘Naña ami ndiinam ndiọọñọ me ndufo edo mbon akpanikọ ado ami: Ikpọñ keed ke atu nditọete ndufo mi ye ami, inyʌñ iben ndidia inyọñọ ikinọ mbon ufọk ndufo e-etieghe abiọọñ. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Ado iben akpeedem ayịnete ndufo insọk miin nọ ami ndiinịm ke ndufo idoññoke mbon uyeb, ado ke edoñño mbon akpanikọ. Ndin ami ñyaayaak ayịnete ndufo inọ ndufo, ndin ndufo emekeme edinyam udua ke isọñ ami.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Akema, naña ammọ ekesʌkkọ enwañña ekpad ammọ, awo keedekeed amaakịt eboho akʌk amọ naña asịne ke esịd ekpad amọ! Ke ini ammọ ye ete ammọ ekekịtte mme eboho akʌk ado, ndịk amaanam ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Ndin ete ammọ, Yekọb, amaabo ammọ, “Ndufo emembọi nditọ mmi. Yosef ibaaha aba, Simiọn ñko ibaaha aba, ndin idahami ndufo eyem adiben Benyamin. Afịd ñkpọ akanna amfʌk miin!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Akema Rubịn amaabo ete amọ, “Afo amekeme adiwot nditọ ideen mmi naña iba adieke ami mmentịmmeke ndat anye usọk fiin. Yaak anye sịn ke idak ukpeme mmi, ndin ñyaaben anye ñnyọñ ndi.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Ado Yekọb amaabo, “Ayịn mmi idiisọiyọke ikaa do ye ndufo; ayịneka amọ amaakpa, ndin anye ikpọọñ asʌhọ. Adieke unọmọ asịmme anye ke usʌñisañ a-ndufo edatta anye esaña, ndufo eyaenam iwuod iwad mmi adʌk udi ke mfʌhọ.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s1">Isañ Uka Iyib Ayọhọ Akañ iba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Idaha ntoro, akañ amaanekke asọñ ke idʌñ. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Ndin ke ini ammọ emaekedia afịd abakpa a-ammọ ekebenne eto Iyib ema, ete ammọ amaabo ammọ, “Itịmme ikaa inyʌñ ikidep etək ndidia mfen inọ ñnyịn.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Ado Yuda amaabo anye, “Awo ado amaanwọñọ inọ ñnyịn abo, ‘Ndufo idiikịtte iso mmi aba, ibọhọke ayịnete ndufo asaña ye ndufo.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Akpedo afo ayaayak ayịnete ñnyịn aka ye ñnyịn, ñnyịn iyaisọiyọ ika ikidep ndidia usọk fiin. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Ado adieke afo umuuyakka anye ikeene ñnyịn aka, ñnyịn idiikaaha, sia awo ado akibo ñnyịn, ‘Ndufo idiikịtte iso mmi aba ibọhọke ayịnete ndufo asaña ye ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Ndin Isrel amaabịp abo, “Nsoo ido ntak a-ndufo ekebenne mfịna ami ensọk miin ke ndufo edikidọkkọ awo ado ke emenie ayịnete mfen?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ ebo, “Awo ado amaibịp ñnyịn mbuume a-akenekkeke ituuk ñnyịn ye esịd ufọk ñnyịn. Anye amaibịp ñnyịn abo, ‘Ete ndufo mmọdo ke uwem? Emenie ayịnete mfen?’ Ñnyịn ikibọọrọ ikeene naña anye akibịp. Ñnyịn ikidiọọñọ die ke anye ayaabo, ‘Iben ayịnete ndufo isọiyọ idi’?”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Akema, Yuda amaabo Isrel ete amọ, “Nam ayịn ado asaña ye ami, ndin ñnyịn iyaikaa ini keed, mbaak ñnyịn ye afo ye nditọ ñnyịn idu uwem ikiinyʌñ ikpañña. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Ami ke idem mmi ñyaatie ubiọñ ke adikpeme anye; afo amekeme adimmʌm miin nte awo akeseeghe anye anyen. Adieke ami mmiibenne anye ntịmme usọk fiin ñnyʌñ ndaaha anye ke iso mfo, yak ami ntie nte adueñkpọ ke iso mfo ke afịd ayio uwem. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Naña aba ami, akpedo ñnyịn ikibiatta ini, ikpaikikaa inyʌñ inyọñọ akañ iba.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Akema, ete ammọ Isrel amaabo ammọ, “Adieke anaaha ado ntoro, ana ndufo enam ntom: Isịn nti mfịd a-atooho isọñ ñnyịn mi ke mme ekpad ndufo inyʌñ iben ammọ isọiyọ ikaa ikinọ awo ado nte enọ, nte etək ufọfiọññọ ñkpọ ye etək adanakwọọk, anemufịk uyayak ye nsọñudua adan, mme isịb pistatio ye mmansañ mbakara. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Idat udomo akʌk silfa itie iba ikama, sia ana ndufo eben silfa e-ekesịnne ke inua ekpad ndufo etịmme eka. Akemeido akedo ndudue. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Iben ayịnete ndufo inyʌñ itịmme ikaa ibịne ete ado ini keed. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Ndin yak Abasi Andikponñkan itua ndufo mbọm ke iso ete ado, nọ anye ayaak ayịnete anye ako ye Benyamin etịmme enyọñ edi ye ndufo. Amaado ami, adieke anaaha nditọ mmi afịd iba ekpañña, yak ado ntoro.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Ndin ammọ emaeben mme enọ enyʌñ edian udomo akʌk silfa ke itie iba, ye Benyamin. Ndin ammọ emaesọp idem edakka esọiyọ ekaa Iyib, enyʌñ eben idem ammọ ekaa iso Yosef. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Ke ini Yosef akekịtte Benyamin ye ammọ, anye amaabo ayịnufọk amọ, “Ben ideen ami kaa ufọk mmi, wot unam nyʌñ tem ndidia; ana ammọ edia ñkpọ ye ami ke ufọọd uweemeayio.”<verse eid="GEN 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Awo ado amaanyʌñ anam naña Yosef akedọkkọ anye anyʌñ aben mbon ado akaa ufọk Yosef. <verse eid="GEN 43:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Idaha ntoro, ndịk amaamʌm ammọ ke ini ekebenne ammọ ekaa ufọk Yosef. Ammọ ekekere, “Iben ñnyịn edi umi ke ntak silfa e-ekekappakesịn ke ekpad ñnyịn ke akpa ini. Anye ayem adinwana ye ñnyịn nọ anye ikan ñnyịn ubọk anyʌñ idat ñnyịn nte ifʌn anyʌñ akoono mme dọñki ñnyịn.”<verse eid="GEN 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Ndin ammọ emaebịne akamaufọk Yosef eketañ ikọ ye anye ke anyenusʌñ ufọk. <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />Ammọ emaebo anye, “Mbọk imubeeñe fiin, abọọñ ñnyịn, ñnyịn imaidi mi akpa ini ididep ndidia. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Ado ke itie a-ñnyịn ikidatta isañ ikitre ke akonayio, ñnyịn imaitaat mme ekpad ñnyịn ndin awo keedekeed amaakịt akʌk amọ, nnen-nnen udomo, ke inua ekpad amọ. Ndin imitịmme iben akʌk ado idi. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Ñnyịn imitịmme ikama akʌk mfen se ñnyịn idiidat idep ndidia. Ñnyịn idiọọñọke awo se ikisịn akʌk ke ekpad ñnyịn”<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Anye amaabo, “Mfịna ibaaha, ikiifeghe ndịk. Abasi ndufo, Abasi ete ndufo, inọọ ndufo inie ke ekpad ndufo; ami mmaabọ akʌk ndufo.” Ndin anye amaakesio Simiọn asọk ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Akema akamaufọk amaaben ammọ adʌk ufọk Yosef, akenọ ammọ mmọọñ se eyie ukod, anyʌñ anọ mme dọñki ammọ ñkpọ nọ edia. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ eneeñe mme enọ ammọ ebono ebet Yosef adisịm ke uweemeayio, sia ammọ emaekop ke ammọ eyaedia ñkpọ ke ufọk Yosef.<verse eid="GEN 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Yosef amaakenyọñ adi, ammọ emaeben mme enọ a-ammọ ekekamake edinọ anye ke ufọk, enyʌñ esuuk iwuod ke isọñ ke iso amọ. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Anye amaabịp ammọ naña idem ammọ aba, anyʌñ abịp ammọ abo, “Idem akaanadeen ete ndufo e-eketañña ennọọ miin aba die? Anye mmọdo asʌk aba ke uwem?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ ebo, “Ete ñnyịn, ayịnufọk mfo mmọdo aba ke uwem ye ke nsọñidem.” Ndin ammọ emaenʌhọ etuak iwuod enọ anye.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Ke anye amaakekịt Benyamin, ayịneka ammọ, anye amaabịp abo, “Akpatre ayịnete a-ndufo e-eketañña ebaña ado ami?” Ndin anye amaabo, “Yak Abasi afọn mfọn ye afo, ayịn mmi.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Esịd amaanekke aduọ anye ke adikịt ayịneka amọ, ndin Yosef amaasọsọp awuọ akeyem itie se anye atua ayịd. Anye amaadʌk esịd ubeed amọ aketua ayịd.<verse eid="GEN 43:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Ke anye amaakeyie iso ama, amaawuọ adi, anyʌñ amʌm idem akama, abo, “Ideeme ndidia.”<verse eid="GEN 43:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Ndin emaenịm ndidia enọ anye ke idem amọ, ake nditọete ke idem ammọ, ye ake mbon Iyib e-ekediaha ñkpọ ye anye ke idem ammọ, sia mbon Iyib isidiaha ñkpọ ye mbon Hibru, sia adooho mbubiam adinam ntoro. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Mbon ado emaetie ke iso amọ ekeene isua emana ammọ, tọọñọ ke akpan tutu asịm akpatre; ndin ammọ emaese emọ-emọ ke ñkpaidem. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Ke ini ekedeemeke ndidia a-aketooho akpokoro Yosef enọ ammọ, udeeme ake Benyamin amaawak akañ ition akan ake mbon mfen. Ndin ammọ emaedia usọrọ enyʌñ enwọñ ñkpọ ye anye, ikoppo ndịk.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s1">Kọọb Silfa ke Ekpad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Akema Yosef amaanọ akamaufọk amọ uyio ate: “Dọñ uwak ñkpọ ndidia ke ekpad ideen ado nọ ado se ammọ ekan ebiom, nyʌñ sịn akʌk ke inua ekpad awo keedekeed. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Ndin sịn kọọb silfa mmi ke inua ekpad akpeedem, dian ye akʌk abakpa amọ.” Anye amaanyʌñ anam se Yosef akebo.<verse eid="GEN 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Ke ayio amaakesiere, ammọ emaedakka edʌk usʌñ unyọñọ ye mme dọñki ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Ammọ ikikaaha anyan ikpọñ abio ke Yosef akebooho akamaufọk amọ. “Bịne ammọ ini keed, ndin umaukusịme ammọ, bo ntom, ‘Nsoo inam ndufo eben idiọọk esio usiene eti? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Nte idooho kọọb ami ke eteufọk mmi asikama anwọñ mmọọñ anyʌñ akama abre idiọñ? Se ndufo enam ado ataa ibak.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Ke anye amaakesịme ammọ, anye amaatañ afịd ikọ ami ye ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Ado ammọ emaebo anye, “Ntak a-abọọñ ñnyịn atañña mme utọ ñkpọ ami-e? Nsaa ñnyịn-o, nditọufọk mfo edinam ñkpọ a-abaaha ntoro! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Ñnyịn imaiben akʌk a-ñnyịn ikikịtte ke mme inua ekpad ñnyịn ito ke isọñ Kenan idat usọk fiin. Ndin nsoo ido ntak yak ñnyịn ikpiyịp silfa me kold ke ufọk eteufọk mfo? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Adieke ekịtte awo keed ke atu nditọufọk mfo nte akama kọọb ado, anye adot ñkpa; ndin ñnyịn se isʌhọ iyaido ifʌn inọ abọọñ mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Anye amaabo, “A-anekke afọn, ndin, yak asu naña ndufo etañ. Awo e-ekịtte anye ye kọọb ado ayaakappa ado afʌn mmi; ndufo mbon ako eyaebọkkọ.”<verse eid="GEN 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Ndin ammọ keedekeed emaesọsọp esuuk ekpad ke isọñ enyʌñ etat inua ekpad. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Akema akamaufọk amaakaa iso adiyem, atọọñọke ke ekamba awo tutu akesịm akpeedem. Ndin emaekekịt kọọb ado ke ekpad Benyamin. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Ke ntak ami, ammọ emaewai afọñidem ammọ enyʌñ edoot mbiomo ammọ ke mme dọñki ammọ etịmme ekaa abio.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yosef akesʌk aba ke ufọk ke ini Yuda ye nditọete amọ ekedʌkkọ edi, ndin ammọ emaeduọññọ ke isọñ ke iso amọ. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Yosef amaabịp ammọ ate, “Nsoo ke ndufo enam ami? Nte ndufo idiọọñọke ke ami mmekeme adiyaara ñkpọ ñkịt ke ubre idiọñ?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yuda amaabọọrọ. “Nsoo ke ñnyịn idiikan itañ inọ abọọñ mmi? Nsoo ke ñnyịn idiikan itañ? Idiinam die iwọt ke ñnyịn idueghe? Abasi amaayaara ndudue nditọufọk mfo. Idahami ñnyịn ido ifʌn abọọñ mmi, ñnyịn ke idem ñnyịn ye anye e-ekekịtte ye kọọb ado.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Ado Yosef amaabo, “Nsaa mmi-o adinam utọ ñkpọ ado! Awo e-ekekịtte ye kọọb ado ikpọọñ adiido afʌn mmi. Ndufo mbon ako, inyọñọ ibịne ete ndufo ke emem.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Akema Yuda amaadakka abịne anye akebo, “Dakka nọ ayịnufọk mfo, abọọñ mmi, yak ami ntañ ikọ nnọ abọọñ mmi. Kuuyat esịd ye ayịnufọk mfo, akpesʌkado a-afo adooho ukem ye Fero ke idem amọ. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Abọọñ mmi amaabịp nditọufọk amọ abo, ‘Nte ndufo emenie ete me ayịneka mfen?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Ndin ñnyịn imaibọọrọ ite, ‘Ñnyịn iminie ete a-amaasọñ, ndin etəkayịn mmọdo e-ekemanna enọ anye ke usọñ amọ. Ayịneka amọ amaakpa, ndin anye ado ukweeñe ayịn ke idịb eka amọ a-asʌhọke, ete amọ anyʌñ ama anye.’<verse eid="GEN 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />“Ndin afo amaabo nditọufọk mfo, ‘Iben anye idat insọk miin nọ ami ñkịt anye ke idem mmi.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Ndin ñnyịn imaibo abọọñ mmi ite, ‘Ayịn ado idiikanna ikpọñ ete amọ; adieke akpọññọ anye, ete amọ ayaakpa.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Ado afo amaabo nditọufọk mfo, ‘Ibọhọke akpatre ayịnete ndufo ikeene ndufo adi, ndufo idiikịtte iso mmi aba.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Ke ini ñnyịn ikitịmmeke inyọñ ikikịt ayịnufọk mfo ete ñnyịn, ñnyịn imaidọkkọ anye se abọọñ mmi aketañ.<verse eid="GEN 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />“Ndin ete ñnyịn amaabo, ‘Ndufo itịmme ikaa ikidep etək ndidia mfen.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Ado ñnyịn imaibo anye, ‘Ñnyịn idiikanna ika. Ukweeñe ñkpọ ado adieke akpatre ayịnete ñnyịn akaaha ye ñnyịn ke ñnyịn idiika. Ñnyịn ibooho ikịt awo ado iso ibọhọke akpatre ayịnete ñnyịn akaa ye ñnyịn.’<verse eid="GEN 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />“Ayịnufọk mfo ete ñnyịn amaibo ñnyịn, ‘Ndufo emediọọñọ ke anwaan mmi akeman nditọ ideen iba annọ. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Keed ke atu ammọ amaawuọ añkpọñ miin, ndin ami mmaabo, “Ana ado ekewaawai anye mbai-mbai.” Ndin ami ñnyʌññọ ñkịt anye tọọñọ ado. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Adieke ebenne anye ami ñko eñkpọñ miin, ndin unọmọ akesịm anye, ndufo eyaenam iwuod iwad mmi asọiyọ adʌk udi ke ukuud.’<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />“Ndin idahami, adieke ayịn ami imiisañake ye ñnyịn ke ini ami ñnyọññọ mbịne ayịnufọk mfo ete mmi, ndin adieke ete mmi, a-adooho uwem amọ adiana keed ye uwem ayịn ami, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />akịtte ke ayịn ado ibaaha aba, anye ayaakpa. Nditọufọk mfo eyaenam iwuod iwad ete ammọ asọiyọ adʌk udi ke mfʌhọ. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Ayịnufọk mfo aketie ubiọñ abaña uwem ayịn ado anọ ete mmi. Ami mmaabo, ‘adieke ami mmiibenne anye ntịmme usọk fiin, ami ñyaanie ubiomikpe ke iso mfo, nte ete mmi, ke afịd ayio uwem mmi!’<verse eid="GEN 44:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />“Ndin idahami, mbọk yak ayịnufọk mfo akappa aba mi nte afʌn abọọñ mmi ke itie ayịn ami, nyʌñ yak ayịn ami atịmme anyọñ ye nditọete amọ. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Ami ndiinam die ntịmme mbịne ete mmi adieke ayịn ami imiibaaha ye ami? Iyoo! Kuuyak ami ñkịt ukuud adiidi ibịne ete mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s1">Yosef Ayaara Idem Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Ndin Yosef ikikanna imʌm idem amọ aba ke iso mbon utom amọ, ndin anye amaatañ ke akpọsọñ uyio ate, “Inam afịd awo ewuọñọ ekpọñ iso mmi!” Ndin awo ndomokeed ikibaaha ye Yosef ke ini anye akeyaarake idem anọ nditọete amọ. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Ndin anye amaadịppe uyio atua ayịd tutu mbon Iyib ekop naña anye atua, mbon ufọk Fero emaenyʌñ ekop ebaña.<verse eid="GEN 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Akema Yosef amaabo nditọete amọ, “Ami ndo Yosef! Ete mmi mmọdo asʌk aba ke uwem?” Ado nditọete amọ ikikanna ibọọrọ anye, sia ndịk amaanam ammọ ke iso amọ.<verse eid="GEN 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Ndin Yosef amaabo nditọete amọ, “Isịkke iñkpere miin.” Ke ini ammọ emaekenam ntoro, anye amaabo, “Ami ndo ayịnete ndufo Yosef, anye a-ndufo ekenyamma enọọ Iyib! <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Ndin idahami, ikiifʌhọ, ikiinyʌñ ikop idiọọkesịd ke adikiñnyam miin mi, sia akedo ke ntak adinyaaña uwem ke Abasi akendọñ miin nọ ibem ndufo iso ndi. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Ke ukpa isua iba idahami akañ a-aba ke isọñ, ndin ke ufañ isua ition a-adiighe ke iso utọ inwañ ye idọk idiibaaha. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Ado Abasi akendọñ miin nọ ibem ndufo iso ndinịm ñkpọ inọ ndufo, e-edooho nsʌhọ ke ederimbod, ñnyʌñ ñnyaaña uwem ndufo ke ekamba ñkpọkñyak.<verse eid="GEN 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />“Ndin, idooho ndufo ekennọọ miin ndi mi, ado Abasi. Anye akenam ami ndo ete nnọ Fero, abọọñ ke afịd ufọk amọ ye andikara ke afịd Iyib. <verse eid="GEN 45:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />Idahami isọp idem inyọñọ ibịne ete mmi inyʌñ ibo anye, ‘Ami ado se ayịn mfo Yosef atañ: Abasi a-anam ami ndo abọọñ ke afịd Iyib. Suuk di mbịne miin; kuubiat ini. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Afo uduudʌñ ke ukañ Kosen anyʌñ aba añkpere miin: Afo, nditọ mfo, nditọ ayeyịn mfo, udịmedọñ mfo, ye udịmenañ mfo, ye afịd se afo anie. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Ami ñyaunọ se afo adia do, sia isua akañ ition asʌk adi ke iso. Imiidooho ntoro afo ye ufọk mfo ye afịd se ido ake mfo eyaekappa edoñño akpọikpọi uweene.’<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />“Ndufo ke idem ndufo ye ayịneka mmi Benyamin emekịt ke ado ami ndo anditañ ikọ ye ndufo. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Dọkkọ ete mmi baña afịd ukpono e-ennọọhọ miin ke Iyib ye afịd ñkpọ se ndufo ekịt. Ndin iben anye idi mi usọp-usọp.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Ndin anye amaatop ubọk awañ ke itọñ Benyamin, anyʌñ atua ayịd; Benyamin amaanyʌñ afat anye akama, atua ayịd. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Ndin anye amaatʌm afịd nditọete amọ inua, anyʌñ atua ayịd abaña ammọ. Akema nditọete amọ emaeneme nneme ye anye.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Ke ini etob ami akesịmme ebekpo Fero ke nditọete Yosef emaedi, Fero ye afịd mme adaidaha amọ emaekop inemesịd. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Fero amaabo Yosef, “Dọkkọ nditọete mfo, ‘Inam ntom: Idoot mbiomo ke anyọñ mme enañ ndufo inyʌñ itịmme inyọñ isọñ Kenan, <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />inyʌñ ikidat ete ndufo ye ufọk ndufo insọk miin. Ndin ami ñyainọ ndufo isọñ a-afọnnọ akan ke Iyib, ndin ndufo eyaekop inem ke mbunwịm isọñ ado.’<verse eid="GEN 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />“Emaana utemme fiin ete adọkkọ amọ abo, ‘Inam ntom: Idat mme ukpadñkpọ ke Iyib inọ nditọ ndufo ye ibaan ndufo, ndin idat ete ndufo inyọñ idi. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Ikiikere ibaña mme ñkpọ ndʌñufọk ndufo, sia ataa nti ñkpọ ke afịd isọñ Iyib ayaado ake ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Ndin nditọ Isrel emaenam ntoro. Yosef amaanọ ammọ mme ukpadñkpọ, naña Fero akenọọ uyio, ndin anye amaanọ ammọ se ediidia ke usʌñisañ ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Amaanọ ammọ keedekeed ufa afọñ, ado anye akenọ Benyamin udomo silfa ikie ita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 3.5</char></note> ye mme utọ afọñ ition. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Ndin se anye akenọọ esọk ete amọ ado ami: Mme dọñki duob e-ekekoonoke ñkpọ se ifọọn ikan ke Iyib, ye uman dọñki duob e-ekekoonoke abakpa ye uyo ye mme ndidia mfen ke isañ amọ. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Akema anye amaasio nditọete amọ unyọñ, ndin ke idaha a-ammọ ekeyemme adikpọñ, anye amaabo ammọ, “Ikiitọọhọ ke usʌñ!”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Ndin ammọ emaedakka edọọk ewuọñọ ke Iyib enyʌñ ebịne ete ammọ Yekọb ke isọñ Kenan. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Ammọ emaekedọkkọ anye ebo, “Yosef mmọdo asʌk aba ke uwem! Ke adinekke ntañ, anye ado andikara afịd Iyib.” Idem amaakpa Yekọb, ndin anye ikinịmme ammọ ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="GEN 45:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Ado ke ini ammọ ekedọkkọke anye afịd ñkpọ se Yosef aketañ anọ ammọ, ye ke anye adikikịt mme ukpadñkpọ a-Yosef akenọọhọ ediben anye edi, sịbidịd Yekọb amaatịmme aset. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Ndin Isrel amaabo, “Ami mmenịm! Ayịn mmi Yosef mmọdo asʌk aba ke uwem. Ñyaakaa ñkekịt anye mbemiso ami ñkpa.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s1">Yekọb Akaa Iyib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Akema Isrel amaadakka ye afịd se ikido ake amọ, ndin anye akekesịm Beeseba, anye amaawa uwa anọ Abasi ete amọ Aisik.<verse eid="GEN 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Ndin Abasi amaatañ ikọ anọ Isrel ke ñkukịd ke akonayio anyʌñ abo, “Yekọb! Yekọb!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Se miin mi.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Anye amaabo. “Ami ndo Abasi, Abasi mme ete mfo,” “Kuuyak ndịk unam fiin adisọiyọ ñkaa Iyib, sia ami ñyaanam afo ado ekamba idịd do. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Ami ñyaasọiyọ ñkaa Iyib ye afo, ndin ami ñyaudat fiin ntịmme ñnyọñ ndi. Ndin ubọk Yosef aduukʌp fiin anyen.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Akema, Yekọb amaakpọñ Beeseba, ndin nditọ Isrel emaeben ete ammọ Yekọb ye nditọ ammọ ye ibaan ammọ ke ukpadñkpọ a-Fero akenọọhọ ekewat ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Ndin Yekọb ye afịd ubon amọ emaekaa Iyib, esaña keed ye ufene ammọ ye afịd inie se ammọ ekenie ke Kenan. <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />Yekọb amaakoono afịd ubon amọ akaa Iyib, nditọ ideen ammọ ye nditọ ideen ayeyịn ye nditọ ibaan ye nditọ ibaan ayeyịn ye afịd ubon amọ.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Mme anyịñ nditọ Isrel (Yekọb ye ubon amọ) e-ekekaaha Iyib edo ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 46:8" />
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 46:8">Rubịn akpan Yekọb.<verse eid="GEN 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Nditọ ideen Rubịn:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:9">Hanọk, Palu, Hesrọn ye Kaami.<verse eid="GEN 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Nditọ ideen Simiọn:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:10">Yemuel, Yamịn, Ohad, Yakịn, Soha, ye Sọọl, ayịn awonwaan a-awonwaan Kenan akemanna.<verse eid="GEN 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Nditọ ideen Lifai:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:11">Kesọn, Kohad ye Merari.<verse eid="GEN 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Nditọ ideen Yuda:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:12">Er, Ọnan, Sela, Peres ye Seera (ado Er ye Ọnan emaekpañña ke isọñ Kenan).</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:12">Nditọ ideen Peres:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="GEN 46:12">Hesrọn ye Hamul.<verse eid="GEN 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Nditọ ideen Isaka:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:13">Tola, Pua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">46:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se ñko ke 1 Krọnikịd 7:1</char></note>, Yasub ye Simrọn.<verse eid="GEN 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Nditọ ideen Sebulọn:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:14">Sered, Elon ye Yaleel.<verse eid="GEN 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Mbon ami ekedo nditọ ideen a-Lia akemanna anọ Yekọb ke Padan Aram,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">46:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Adoro usobutịn Mesopotemia</char></note> ke amaaboiyo Daina ayịn awonwaan amọ. Nditọ ideen ye ibaan amọ ekedo edịb mme duob mme ita.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Nditọ ideen Kad:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:16">Sefọn, Hakai, Suni, Esbon, Eri, Arodi ye Areli.<verse eid="GEN 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Nditọ Asaa:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:17">Imna, Isfa, Isfi ye Beria. Ayịneka ammọ awonwaan akedo Sera.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:17">Nditọ ideen Beria:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="GEN 46:17">Heba ye Malkiel.<verse eid="GEN 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Mbon ami ekedo nditọ a-Silpa akemanna anọ Yekọb, a-Leban akenọọhọ ayịn amọ Lia nte ayịnufọk, duob mme itiokeed ke afịd.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Nditọ ideen anwaan Yekọb Ratiel:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:19">Yosef ye Benyamin.<verse eid="GEN 46:19" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Ke Iyib, Manase ye Ifrem emaemana enọ Yosef eto Asenad, ayịn awonwaan Pọtifera, aku ke Ọn.<verse eid="GEN 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Nditọ ideen Benyamin:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:21">Bela, Beka, Asbel, Kera, Neman, Ehi, Rọs, Mupịm, Hupịm ye Ard.<verse eid="GEN 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Mbon ami ekedo nditọ ideen a-Ratiel akemanna anọ Yekọb, duob mme inaañ ke afịd.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Ayịn awodeen Daan:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:23">Husịm.<verse eid="GEN 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Nditọ ideen Naftali:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:24">Yaseel, Kuuni, Yesa ye Silem.<verse eid="GEN 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Mbon ami ekedo nditọ ideen se Bilha akeman anọ Yekọb, a-Leban akenọọhọ ayịn amọ Ratiel nte ayịnufọk, afịd ammọ ekedo awo itiaba.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Afịd mbon e-ekesañake ye Yekọb eka Iyib, mbon e-eketooho asaha ubon amọ, awo ibatta ibaan nditọ amọ, ekedo awo ata mme itiokeed ke ibad. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Ekpeben nditọ ideen iba e-ekemanna enọ Yosef ke Iyib edian, mbon e-ekesịneke ke ubon Yekọb, e-ekekaaha Iyib, ekedo ata mme duob ke afịd.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Ndin Yekọb amaasio Yuda anọ ato akekịt Yosef, anyʌñ abịp usʌñ naña esaña eka Kosen. Ke ini ammọ ekesịmme ukañ Kosen, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yosef amaabo ebeeñe sariọd amọ idem, ndin anye amaadakka akaa Kosen akesoobo ete amọ Isrel. Yosef akesʌk abọbiọññọ ete amọ ke iso, anye amaatop ubọk awañ ete amọ ke itọñ anyʌñ atua ayịd akpeene.<verse eid="GEN 46:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Isrel amaabo Yosef, “Idahami ami mmebeeñe idem adikpa, sia ami mmedikịt ke anyen mmi ke afo mmọdo ke uwem.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Ndin Yosef amaabo nditọete amọ ye afịd mbon ufọk ete amọ, “Ami ñyaadọọk ñka ñkedọkkọ Fero mbo, ‘Nditọete mmi ye mbon ufọk ete mmi, e-ekedʌñọke ke isọñ Kenan, e-edi embịne miin. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Ideen edoñño mme akpemeedọñ, mme abọọk ufene, ndin ammọ e-edi mi ye mme udịmedọñ ye udịmenañ ye afịd se ammọ enie.’ <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Fero amaikoot ndufo anyʌñ abịp abo, ‘Nsoo ñkpọ ido ubọkutom ndufo?’ <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />ana ndufo ebọọrọ, ‘nditọufọk mfo ebọọk ufene tọọñọ idaha edoññoke ntək ideen tutu ami, kpa naña mme ete ñnyịn ekenam.’ Ndin eyaeyaak ndufo ebono ke ukañ Kosen, sia mbon Iyib imaaha mme akpemeedọñ.”<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Yosef amaakaa akedọkkọ Fero ate, “Ete mmi ye nditọete mmi, ye udịmedọñ ye udịmenañ ammọ ye afịd ñkpọ se ammọ enie, emaeto ke isọñ Kenan ediwuọ, ndin idahami ammọ mmọdo ke Kosen.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Anye amaasio nditọete amọ ition aben akewọt Fero.<verse eid="GEN 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Fero amaabịp nditọete ammọ ate, “Nsoo ido ubọkutom ndufo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Ammọ emaebọọrọ Fero, “Nditọufọk mfo edoñño mme akpemeedọñ, kpa naña mme ete ñnyịn ekedoñño.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ etañ enọ Fero ete, “Ñnyịn ikidi adidʌñ mi ke etək ini, sia akañ anekke asọñ ke Kenan, ndin mme ufene nditọufọk mfo inieghe mbid se eta. Ndin ke ami, mbọk yak nditọufọk mfo edʌñọ ke Kosen.”<verse eid="GEN 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Ndin Fero amaabo Yosef, “Ete mfo ye nditọete mfo ekedi ukeene fiin, <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />ndin isọñ Iyib mmọdo unaa fiin ke iso; nam yak ete mfo ye nditọete mfo edʌñọ ke itie a-afọnnọ akan ke isọñ Iyib. Yak ammọ edʌñọ ke Kosen. Ndin adieke afo adiọọñọke me aba ke atu ammọ awo a-anieghe asaña-asaña ukeme, sịn ammọ nọ ese ñkpọ ebaña ufene mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Akema Yosef amaaben ete amọ Yekọb adʌk akewọt Fero. Ke Yekọb amaakekọọm Fero, <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Fero amaabịp Yekọb ate, “Afo ado awo isua ifañ?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Ndin Yekọb amaabọọrọ Fero ate, “Mme isua isañuwem mmi ado ikie mme edịb mme duob. Mme isua isañuwem mmi iwakka, ado imemme ye ami; ndin ammọ ikpettekpet mme isua isañuwem mme ete mmi.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Akema Yekọb amaakọọm Fero anyʌñ awuọ akpọñ iso amọ.<verse eid="GEN 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Ndin Yosef amaanam ete amọ ye nditọete amọ edʌñọ ke Iyib, anyʌñ anọ ammọ udeeme ke isọñ a-afọnnọ akan, ke ukañ Ramese, naña Fero aketemme. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Yosef amaanyʌñ anọ ete amọ ye nditọete amọ ye afịd ufọk ete amọ ndidia, nte asañake akekem ye ibad nditọ ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosef ye Akañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Ndidia ikibaaha ke afịd ñkanñkʌk ado, sia akañ amaanekke asọñ. Iyib ye Kenan emaeba ke akpọsọñ ufen ke ntak akañ ado. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yosef amaabọ afịd akʌk a-akebaaha ke Iyib ye Kenan se ammọ ekedat edep abakpa ammọ, ndin anye amaaben akaa ke akwere Fero. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Ke ini akʌk mbon Iyib ye Kenan amaakekweeñe, afịd mbon Iyib emaedi ebịne Yosef edibo anye, “Inọ ñnyịn ndidia. Ntak añnyịn ikpikpaññake ke iso mfo-o? Afịd akʌk ñnyịn a-akweeñe.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yosef amaabo ammọ, “Iben mme ufene ndufo idi. Ami ñyaanyam ndidia inọ ndufo ke ukpəho ye ufene ndufo, sia adooho akʌk ndufo a-akweeñe.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Akema ammọ emaeben ufene ammọ esọk Yosef, ndin anye amaanọ ammọ ndidia ke ukpəho ye enañmbakara ammọ, edọñ ye ebod ammọ, ye enañ ye dọñki ammọ. Ndin anye amaakama ammọ ke isua ado ke adinọ ndidia ke ukpəho ye afịd ufene ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Ke isua ado amaakeboiyo, ammọ emaedi edibịne anye ke isua mfen edibo anye, “Ñnyịn ikanna idịp abọọñ ñnyịn akpanikọ ibo sia akʌk ñnyịn amaakekweeñe, ndin ufene ñnyịn ado afo adinie, ñkpọ ndomokeed mfen ibaaha aba inọ abọọñ ñnyịn ke imiibọhọke idem ñnyịn ye isọñ ñnyịn. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Ntak a-ñnyịn ye isọñ ikpitakka ke iso mfo-o? Idep ñnyịn ye isọñ ñnyịn ke ukpəho ndidia, ndin ñnyịn ye isọñ ñnyịn iyaisịne ke idak ufʌn inọ Fero. Inọ ñnyịn abakpa nọ ñnyịn idu uwem ikiinyʌñ ikpañña, ndin isọñ ñnyịn inaaha ukpọk.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Ndin Yosef amaadep afịd isọñ ke Iyib anọ Fero. Mbon Iyib, keedekeed ye afịd ammọ, emaenyam mme inwañ ammọ, sia akañ amaanekke asọñ ye ammọ. Ndin isọñ amaakappa ado ake Fero, <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Yosef amaanyʌñ anam mbon awo ekappa edoñño ifʌn, tọọñọ ke utịd abio Iyib keed tutu akewuọ mfen. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Kpayeado, anye ikideppe isọñ mme aku, sia ammọ ekesibọ udeeme afịd ini ke ubọk Fero enyʌñ esinie ndidia eto udeeme a-Fero akesinọọhọ ammọ. Ke ntak ado ammọ ikinyamma isọñ mme aku.<verse eid="GEN 47:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Ndin Yosef amaabo mbon awo ate, “Idahami, sia ami mmidep ndufo ye isọñ ndufo mfịn ami nnọ Fero, ise ñkpasi a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mi nọ edat etọ inwañ. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Ado ke ini mfịd inwañ adiighe, inọ Fero mbakka keed ke itie ition. Mbakka inaañ ke itie ition se isʌhọ ndufo emekeme adinịm se ediitọ ke inwañ ye nte ndidia enọ idem ndufo ye mme ufọk ndufo ye nditọ ndufo.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Ammọ emaebo anye, “Afo amenyaaña uwem ñnyịn. Iso abọọñ ñnyịn akpekap anen ye ñnyịn; ñnyịn iyaisịne ke ifʌn inọ Fero”<verse eid="GEN 47:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Ndin Yosef amaanịm nte ewʌhọ a-abañake isọñ ke Iyib, asʌkkọ ababa tutu mfịn ami, ke mbaak keed ke itie ition ke afịd ñkpọ inwañ anie Fero. Akedo isọñ mme aku ikpọọñ imiikidooho ake Fero.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Idaha ntoro, nditọ Isrel ekedʌñọ ke Kosen ke Iyib, enie inie do, etọt, enyʌñ ewak ke ibad.<verse eid="GEN 47:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Ndin Yekọb amaadʌñ ke Iyib isua duob mme itiaba, ndin ibad isua uwem amọ akedo ikie keed mme aba mme itiaba. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Ini amaakekpere Isrel adikpa, anye amaakoot ayịn amọ Yosef anyʌñ abo anye, “Adieke iso mfo anenne ye ami, sịn ubọk mfo ke idak ifʌkkọ mmi nyʌñ nwọñọ ke imọ iyaifọn ido inyʌñ inam akpanikọ innọ miin. Kumbuuk miin ke Iyib, <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />ado ke ini ami nduọkkọ adudu ye mme ete mmi, mben miin sio ke Iyib nyʌñ mbuuk miin ke itie e-ebuuhọ ammọ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Ñyaanam naña afo atañ.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Anye amaabo, “Nwọñọ nnọ miin.” Akema Yosef amaanwọñọ anọ anye, ndin Isrel amaanọ Abasi ukpono naña anye akebereke ke iwuod esañ amọ.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s1">Manase ye Ifrem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Ke ini amaakeboiyo, emaedọkkọ Yosef ebo, “Ete mfo adọdọñọ.” Ndin anye amaaben nditọ amọ iba, Manase ye Ifrem asaña ye ammọ. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Ke ini ekedọkkọke Yekọb ebo, “Ayịn mfo Yosef a-adi aduse fiin,” Isrel amaakoot inweek adat, anyʌñ asọñ idem asuuk atie ke anyọñ ikʌk.<verse eid="GEN 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Akema Yekọb amaabo Yosef, “Abasi Andikponñkan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Abasi Andikponñkan ado El-Sadai</char></note> amaayaara idem annọ ke Luus ke isọñ Kenan, anyʌñ andiọñ ke itie ado, <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />ndin amaambo miin, ‘Ami ñyaanam afo atọt anyʌñ awak ke ibad. Ñyaanam afo ado ekamba atu awo, ami ñyaanọ ubon mfo se ukeene fiin isọñ ami nte nsi-nsi inie.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />“Idahami ndin, nditọ mfo iba ekemanake ke Iyib mbemiso ami ñkedi ubịne ke itie ami, eyaediọọñọ ammọ nte ake mmi; Ifrem ye Manase eyaedoñño ake mmi; kpa naña Rubịn ye Simiọn edoñño ake mmi. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Nditọ se imana ikeene ammọ eduunie fiin. Eyaediọọñọ ammọ ke anyịñ nditọeka ammọ ke isọñ a-ammọ edatta enie. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Ke ini ami ñketịmmeke edem ñnyọñ ke Padan,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Adoro usobutịn Mesopotemia</char></note> ke mfʌhọ esịd mmi, Ratiel amaakpa ke isọñ Kenan ke ini ñnyịn ikisʌkkọ iba ke usʌñ, ikiinyọọñọ usʌñ ikpọñ Efrad. Ndin ami mmaabuuk anye do ke mben usʌñ e-ekaaha Efrad” (a-adooho, Betlehem).<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Ke ini Isrel akekịtte nditọ Yosef, anye amaabịp abo, “Mme anie idoñño ami?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yosef amaabọọrọ ete amọ, “Ammọ edoñño nditọ A-Abasi annọọhọ miin mi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Ndin Isrel amaabo, “Dat ammọ nsọk nọ ndiọñ ammọ.”<verse eid="GEN 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Idaha ntoro, anyen Isrel amaakịm ke ntak usọñ, ndin anye ikiikanna ikịt ñkpọ afọn. Ke Yosef amaakedat nditọ amọ iba asịkke akpere anye, ete amọ amaatʌm ammọ inua anyʌñ afat ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Ndin Isrel amaabo Yosef, “Ami ñkidotto anyen ke ñyaamaana ñkịt iso mfo aba, ado idahami Abasi a-anam ami ñkịt nditọ mfo ñkọrọ.”<verse eid="GEN 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Ndin Yosef amaadooño ammọ ke edọñ Isrel anyʌñ anyuuk iwuod amọ ase isọñ. <verse eid="GEN 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Ndin Yosef amaamʌm ammọ awo iba, Ifrem ke ubọk nnasia a-akaaha ubọk ufiin Isrel ye Manase ke ubọk ufiin a-akaaha ubọk nnasia Isrel, anyʌñ aben ammọ asịkke akpere idem amọ. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Ado Isrel amaadot ubọk nnasia amọ ke iwuod Ifrem, akpesʌkado a-anye akedooho udọ, anyʌñ akpakka ubọk ufiin amọ ke iwuod Manase, akpesʌkado Manase akedooho akpan.<verse eid="GEN 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Ndin anye amaadiọñ Yosef anyʌñ abo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">“Yak Abasi mme ete mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">Ebraham ye Aisik e-ekesañake ke akpanikọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">Abasi a-akedooho andiñkpeme miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">ke afịd usen uwem mmi tutu asịm usen mfịn,<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />enyere Abasi a-akemfakka miin asio ke afịd unọmọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">adiọñ nditọ ideen ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Yak ekoot ammọ ke anyịñ mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">ye ke anyịñ mme ete mmi Ebraham ye Aisik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">ammọ eyaenyʌñ ewak eti-eti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">ke isọñ.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Ke ini Yosef akekịtte naña ete amọ adot ubọk nnasia amọ ke iwuod Ifrem anye ikinemme esịd; ndin anye amaamʌm ubọk ete amọ ayem adidooro nsio ke iwuod Ifrem mben ñkedot ke iwuod Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Yosef amaabo anye, “Iyoo, ete mmi, anye ami ado akpan; dot ubọk nnasia mfo ke iwuod amọ.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Ado ete amọ amaasịn, anyʌñ abo, “Ami mmediọọñọ, ayịn mmi, ami mmediọọñọ. Anye ñko ayaanyʌñ akappa ado ubon, anye ñko ayaanyʌñ akpon. Ado udọ eka amọ ayaakpon akan anye, ubon amọ ayaanyʌñ asakka awak anyʌñ akappa mme idịd. <verse eid="GEN 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Isrel amaadiọñ ammọ usen ado anyʌñ abo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:20">“Ke anyịñ mfo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru ado ndufo</char></note> ke Isrel adiinọ adidiọñ ami:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:20">‘Abasi ayaanam afo atie nte Ifrem ye Manase.’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 48:20">Ndin anye amaaben Ifrem anịm nte iwuod anọ Manase.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Ndin Isrel amaabo Yosef, “Ami mmekpere ñkpa, ado Abasi ayaaba ye afo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru ado ndufo</char></note> anyʌñ uben fiin atịmme anyọñ ke isọñ mme ete mfo. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Ndin ami mmedian isọñ keed mfen unọ fiin akan ake nditọete mfo, isọñ a-ami ñkebọọhọ mbon Amọọ ke akañkañ ye utịgha mmi.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s1">Yekọb Adiọñ Nditọ Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Akema Yekọb amaakoot nditọ amọ anyʌñ abo ammọ: “Ida ikanna nọ ntañ inọ ndufo se idiitịppe inọ ndufo ke ini iso.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />“Ida ikanna inyʌñ ikpañ utọñ, ndufo nditọ Yekọb;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">ikpañ utọñ inọ ete ndufo Isrel.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />“Rubịn, afo ado akpan mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">adudu mmi, akpa idiọọñọ adudu mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">ñwuọnda ke ukpono, ñwuọnda ke inweek.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Ntʌkko-ntʌkko nte mmọọñ, afo uduuwuọhọ uda aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">sia afo amaadọọk ikʌk ete mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">adọọk anyọñ mbịd mmi akesappa.<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />“Simiọn ye Lifai edoñño nditọeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:5">akañkañ ammọ edo ñkpọ ekọñ afai.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Ami ndiidʌkkọ esob ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">yak ami ñkuuwana ke mbono ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">sia ammọ ekewotto mme awo ke iyadesịd ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">enyʌñ ekpok asịb ekpaha abaakenañ naña ammọ emama.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Adọdiọọk anọ iyadesịd ammọ, sia a-afiop ataa eti-eti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">ye ifiobesịd ammọ, sia adooho afai!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Ami ñyaasuan ammọ ke Yekọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">ñnyʌñ nsuan ammọ ke Isrel.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />“Yuda,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yuda ada anọ itooro</char></note> nditọete mfo eyautooro fiin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">ubọk mfo ayaafiik itọñ mme asua mfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">nditọ ete mfo eyaetuak iwuod unọ fiin.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Yuda, afo ado ñyịn ekpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">ayịn mmi, afo amenyọñ adiyem ndidia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">Nte ekpe anye a-asọrọ anyʌñ asuuk anaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">nte uman ekpe, anie idedei adibịmme anye?<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Esañ ubọọñ idiikpọññọ Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">esañ ukara idiinyʌññọ ikpọñ ñkpatiañ ukod amọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">tutu awo se inie anye adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">ndin ñkobitem mme idịd ayaado ake amọ.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Anye ayaayịt dọñki amọ ke fain,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">ayịt abaak enañmbakara amọ ke eti ñkọk eto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">anye ayaakama wain ayet mme afọñ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">ayet mme afọñidem amọ ke iyiib kreb.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Anyen amọ ayaayiibe akan wain,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:12">eded amọ asaana akan mmọọñeba.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />“Sebulọn adiidʌñ ke mben akpainyañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">anyʌñ ado itie mbeghe ubom;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">adaña amọ ayaaben akaa Sidọn.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />“Isaka ado asọñ idem dọñki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:14">a-anaaha ke mme abaedọñ.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Ke ini anye akịtte naña itie nduọkadudu amọ afọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">ye naña isọñ amọ anem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">anye ayaanyuuk afara amọ anọ mbiomo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">anyʌñ ayaak idem anọ utom ifʌn.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />“Daan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daan awuọñọ anọ unen</char></note> ayaanọ mbon amọ unenikpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:16">nte keed ke atu mme esiin ke Isrel.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Daan adiido udʌkikọd ke mben usʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">ibọm ke akpọusʌñ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">a-adommo enañmbakara itịghitịghi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">nọ andiwad anye adooro aduọ ebeek.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />“Ami ñyem adinyaaña mfo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />“Udịm mbon amauke eyaenwana ye Kad,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kad awuọñọ nwana</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">ado anye ayaanwana afiik ammọ ke itịghitịghi.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />“Ndidia Asaa adiido ndiin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:20">anye ayaanọ inem ndidia a-adotto ye adidem.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />“Naftali ado uman edob, e-ekpọkkọ eyaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:21">a-amanna mfọọn nditọ.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />“Yosef<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yosef ado ñyịn enañ ikọd</char></note> ado eti uduud fain,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">eti uduud fain a-adaaha ke mben idịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">ake mme ñkọk amọ ebiọkkọ edọọk ndibene.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Ke idiọọkesịd mbon utịgha emaenwana ye anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:23">ammọ emaetịgha anye ke idañ ke usua.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Ado utịgha amọ ada inyeeñeke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">adudu ubọk amọ a-asọñ ada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">sia atooho ubọk Akpọsọñ Abasi Yekọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">sia atooho Akpemeedọñ, a-adooho Itiad Isrel,<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />ke ntak Abasi ete mfo, u-unwamma fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">ke ntak Andikponñkan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Sadai</char></note>, u-udiọññọ fiin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">ye mme adidiọñ e-etooho ikpaanyọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">mme adidiọñ e-ebaaha ke esịd idịm ke idak isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">mme adidiọñ e-etooho eba ye ntʌñidịb.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Mme adidiọñ ete mfo e-ekpon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">ekan mme adidiọñ ñkaan ikpọabod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">ekan mme uwak ñkpọ e-etooho ñkaan abod.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Yak afịd ami adoro Yosef ke iwuod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">anye a-adooho adaiso ke atu nditọete amọ.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />“Benyamin ado ewaikọd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">ke ubakusen anye awai se akemʌm ata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">ke ndubiayio anye adeeme mbịme.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Afịd ami ado esiin Isrel duob mme iba, ndin ami ado se ete ammọ aketañ anọ ammọ ke ini anye akediọññọ ammọ, anyʌñ anọ keedekeed adidiọñ a-adotto ye anye.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Yekọb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Ndin Yekọb amaanọ ammọ mme item ami: “Akpere ini ami adikiba ye mme aduuk mmi. Imbuuk miin ye mme ete mmi ke abaitiad ke inwañ Efrọn mbon Hed, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />abaitiad ke inwañ Makpela, a-akpereke Mamre ke Kenan, ake Ebraham akedeppe adian ye inwañ ato Efrọn a-aketooho Hed nte itie ubuuk akpo. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Ke itie ado ke ekebuuk Ebraham ye anwaan amọ Sera, ke ndo ke ekebuuk Aisik ye anwaan amọ Ribeka, kpa ke ndo ke ami ñkebuuk Lia. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Ekedep inwañ ado ye abaitiad a-abaaha do eto mbon Hed.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ubon Hed</char></note>”<verse eid="GEN 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Ke ini Yekọb amaakekweeñe adinọ nditọ amọ item, anye amaadʌt ukod amọ adịppe adoot ke ñkpana, anweek akpatre inweek, ndin emaeben anye esọk mbon amọ.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Ndin Yosef amaaduọ afʌk ete amọ, anyʌñ atua ayịd abaña anye, anyʌñ atʌm anye inua. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Ndin Yosef amaanọ mbiaibọk se iba ke idak amọ uyio ate etịm ekama akpo ete amọ, Isrel. Ndin mbiaibọk emaekịm akpo ibọk, <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />enyʌñ edat usen aba ayọhọ-ayọhọ, sia ado akedo ini e-ekenịmme adikịm akpo ibọk nnịm. Ndin mbon Iyib emaenyʌñ efʌhọ Yekọb ke usen ata mme duob.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Ke ini mme usen mfʌhọ emaekeboiyo, Yosef amaabo esob Fero ate, “Adieke iso ndufo anenne ye ami, idọkkọ Fero innọ miin. Idọkkọ anye ibo, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />‘Ete mmi amaanam ami ñnwọñọ unwọñọ, amaanyʌñ abo, “Ami mmekpere ñkpa; mbuuk miin ke udi a-ami ñketịppeke nnịm nnọ idem mmi ke isọñ Kenan.” Yak ami ndọọk ñka ñkebuuk ete mmi; amaakem ñyaatịmme ñnyọñ ndi.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Fero amaabo, “Dọọk kaa kebuuk ete mfo, naña anye akenam afo anwọñọ adinam.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Ndin Yosef amaadọọk akaa adibuuk ete amọ. Afịd ñkpisọñ Fero emaesaña ye anye, mme ikpọawo ke esob amọ ye afịd ikpọawo ke Iyib, <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />ke awo imiikisịnne afịd mbon ufọk Yosef ye nditọete amọ ye mbon ufọk ete amọ. Ntəkayịn ye mme udịmedọñ ye udịmenañ ikpọọñ ke ekekpọñ ke Kosen. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Mme sariọd ye mbon uwat enañmbakara emaedọọk ekaa ye anye ekọrọ. Akedo ataa ekamba udịm awo.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Ke ini ammọ ekesịmme afe ubeek abakpa ke Atad, a-akpereke Yọdan, ammọ emaeseeme ke akpọsọñ uyio, enyʌñ etua ndod-ndod ayịd; ndin ke itie ado Yosef amaafʌhọ ikpo ete amọ ke usen itiaba. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Ke ini mbon Kenan e-ekedʌññọ do ekekịtte naña efʌhọ ikpo ke afe ubeek abakpa ke Atad, ammọ emaebo, “Mbon Iyib esʌk enịm asaña-asaña adinam ufʌhọ ikpo.” Ami ado ntak e-ekoodo itie a-akpereke Yọdan Ebeel Misraim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">50:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebeel Misraim awuọñọ mfʌhọ mbon Iyib.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Ndin nditọ Yekọb emaenam naña anye akenọọ ammọ uyio: <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Ammọ emaeben anye ekaa ke isọñ Kenan ekebuuk ke abaitiad ke inwañ Makpela, a-akpereke Mamre, ake Ebraham akedeppe adian ye inwañ nte itie ubuuk akpo ato Efrọn a-aketooho Hed. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Ke emaekebuuk ete amọ ima, Yosef amaatịmme anyọñ Iyib, anye ye nditọete amọ ye afịd mbon se ikikeene anye ikibuuk ete amọ.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosef Asọọñọ Nditọete Amọ Idem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Ke ini nditọete Yosef ekekịtte ke ete ammọ amaakpa, ammọ emaebo, “Nsoo idiitịppe adieke Yosef anieghe udu ibaña ñnyịn ndin, anye isio ñnyịn usiene ke afịd ukwaññkpọ se ñnyịn ikinam anye?” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Ndin ammọ emaedọñ utom enọ Yosef, ete, “Ete mfo amainọ ñnyịn item ami mbemiso anye akpa: <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />‘Se ndufo ediitañ ye Yosef ado ami: Ami mmubeeñe fiin nte adakka anọ nditọete mfo ke mme idiọọkñkpọ ye mme ukwaññkpọ a-ammọ ekenamma ke adidiọọk ido ye afo.’ Mbọk feen mme idiọọkñkpọ mme nditọufọk Abasi mme ete ndufo.” Ke ini etob ammọ akedisịmme Yosef, anye amaatua.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Akema nditọete amọ emaedi, ediduọññọ ke isọñ ke iso amọ ebo. “Ñnyịn idoñño ifʌn mfo.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Ado Yosef amaabo ammọ, “Ikiifeghe ndịk. Nte ami ndo Abasi? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Ndufo ekeyem innam miin idiọọk, ado Abasi amaakappa anam ado eti, nọ anyaaña uwem uwak awo. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Ke ntoro, ikiifeghe ndịk. Ami ñyaase ñkpọ ibaña ndufo ye nditọ ndufo.” Anye amaasọọñọ ammọ idem, anyʌñ atañ ifuuro-ifuuro ikọ ye ammọ.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Yosef</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Yosef amaadʌñ ke Iyib ye afịd mbon ufọk ete amọ. Anye amaadu uwem isua ikie mme duob, <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />anyʌñ akịt ayọhọ emana ita nditọ Ifrem. Anye amaanyʌñ akịt nditọ Makia ayịn Manase e-ekemanna edot Yosef ke ukod.<verse eid="GEN 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Akema Yosef amaabo nditọete amọ, “Ami mmekpere ñkpa. Ado Abasi ayaadise ndufo, ado unwam inọ ndufo anyʌñ isio ndufo ke isọñ ami iben akaa isọñ a-anye akenwọñọke anọ Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Ndin Yosef amaanam nditọ Isrel enwọñọ unwọñọ enyʌñ ebo, “Abasi ayaiñyaaña ndufo, ke ntoro ana ndufo eben akpọ mmi esio ke itie ami.”<verse eid="GEN 50:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Akema Yosef amaakpa ke amaakesịm isua ikie mme duob. Ndin ke ammọ emaekekịm anye ibọk akpo, ammọ emaesịn anye ke akebe akpo enịm ke Iyib.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>